  <para style="h">Itanguriro</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca mbere ca Mose citwa Itanguriro</para>
  <para style="toc2">Itanguriro</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ita</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca mbere ca Mose citwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Itanguriro</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ukuremwa kw’ibintu vyose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Mu ntango, Imana yaremye amajuru n’isi. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Ico gihe isi ntiyagira imero kandi nta kintu cari kuri yo. Umwijima wari utwikiriye ikidengeri c’amazi menshi kandi Mpwemu w’Imana yatambatamba hejuru y’ayo mazi.<verse eid="GEN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Imana iravuga iti: “Nihabeho umuco,” maze umuco ubaho. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Imana ibona ko umuco ari mwiza, hanyuma iwutandukanya n’umwijima. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Imana yita umuco “umurango”, umwijima na wo iwita “ijoro”. Nuko haza umugoroba hanyuma igitondo; uwo uba umusi wa mbere.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Imana iravuga iti: “Nihabeho ikirere hagati y’amazi n’ayandi, kugira ngo gitandukanye amazi yo hejuru n’ayo kw’isi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Nuko Imana ishiraho ikirere co gutandukanya amazi yo kw’isi n’ayo hejuru. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Imana yita ico kirere “ijuru”. Nuko haza umugoroba hanyuma igitondo; uwo uba umusi wa kabiri.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Imana iravuga iti: “Amazi yo musi y’ijuru niyegeranire mu kibanza kimwe, hanyuma haboneke ahantu humutse.” Nuko bigenda uko nyene. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Imana yita ahantu humutse “isi”, amazi yegeraniye hamwe na yo iyita “ikiyaga”. Imana ibona ko vyose ari vyiza.<verse eid="GEN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Imana iravuga iti: “Isi nimereko ivyatsi n’ibiterwa vy’ubwoko bwose: ibiterwa bifise imbuto n’ibiti vyama ivyamwa bifise imbuto muri vyo, nk’uko amoko yavyo angana.” Nuko bigenda uko nyene. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Isi izana ibimera: ibiterwa bifise imbuto nk’uko amoko yavyo ari hamwe n’ibiti vyama ivyamwa bifise imbuto muri vyo nk’uko amoko yavyo ari. Imana ibona ko ari vyiza. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Nuko haza umugoroba hanyuma igitondo; uwo uba umusi wa gatatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Imana iravuga iti: “Nihabeho ivyaka kw’ijuru kugira ngo bitandukanye umurango n’ijoro; maze bibe ibimenyetso bitandukanya ibihe, imisi n’imyaka. <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />Ivyo vyaka biri kw’ijuru nivyakire isi.” Nuko bigenda uko. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Imana irema ivyaka bibiri binini: icaka cane co kuganza umurango n’icaka bukebuke co kuganza ijoro. Yongera irema n’inyenyeri. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Nuko Imana ibishira kw’ijuru kugira ngo biboneshereze isi, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />biganze umurango n’ijoro, vyongere bitandukanye umuco n’umwijima. Kandi Imana ibona ko ari vyiza. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Nuko haza umugoroba hanyuma igitondo; uwo uba umusi wa kane.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Imana iravuga iti: “Ibifise ubuzima nivyuzure mu mazi, inyoni na zo niziguruke hejuru y’isi mu kirere.”<verse eid="GEN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Nuko Imana irema ibifise ubuzima binini vyo mu kiyaga n’ikintu cose gihema kandi kiba mu mazi nk’uko amoko yavyo ari, hamwe n’inyoni zose nk’uko amoko yazo ari. Kandi Imana ibona ko ari vyiza. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Nuko Imana irabihezagira, ivuga iti: “Nimurondoke, mugwire mwuzure amazi yo mu biyaga; inyoni na zo nizigwire zuzure isi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Nuko haza umugoroba hanyuma igitondo; uwo uba umusi wa gatanu.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Imana iravuga iti: “Isi niyuzure ibifise ubuzima nk’uko amoko yavyo ari: ibikoko vy’ibitungwa, ibikoko vyikwega hasi n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba.” Nuko biba uko nyene. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Imana irema ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba, ibikoko vy’ibitungwa n’ibikoko vyikwega hasi, vyose nk’uko amoko yavyo ari. Kandi Imana ibona ko ari vyiza.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Nuko Imana iravuga iti: “Tureme abantu mw’ishusho yacu, base natwe, baheze baganze amafi yo mu mazi, inyoni zo mu kirere, ibikoko vyose vy’ibitungano, ivyo mw’ishamba hamwe n’ibikoko bigenda vyikwega hasi vyose.”<verse eid="GEN 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Nuko Imana irema abantu mw’ishusho yayo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 1:27">Mw’ishusho yayo ni ho yabaremye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 1:27">ibarema ari umugabo n’umugore.<verse eid="GEN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Nuko Imana irabahezagira, ivuga iti: “Nimurondoke mugwire; mwuzure isi kandi muyiganze. Muganze amafi yo mu biyaga, inyoni zo mu kirere hamwe n’ibindi biremwa vyose bigendagenda kw’isi.”<verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Maze Imana iravuga iti: “Ndabahaye ibiterwa vyose bifise imbuto hamwe n’ibiti vyama ivyamwa bifise imbuto muri vyo biri kw’isi yose. Bizobabera ivyokurya. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Ibikoko vyose vyo kw’isi n’inyoni zose zo mu kirere, ibikoko vyose bigenda vyikwega hasi; ni ukuvuga ibifise ubuzima vyose; ndabihaye ivyatsi ngo bibibere ivyokurya.” Nuko bigenda uko nyene.<verse eid="GEN 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Maze Imana yihweza ivyo yaremye vyose, ibona ko ari vyiza cane. Nuko haza umugoroba hanyuma igitondo; uwo uba umusi wa gatandatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Uko ni ko iremwa ry’isi n’ijuru n’ibintu vyose biri muri vyo ryarangiye.<verse eid="GEN 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Ku musi ugira indwi, Imana yari yamaze kurangiza igikorwa cayo co kurema. Nuko kuri uwo musi iraruhuka ibikorwa vyayo vyose. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Imana ihezagira umusi ugira indwi iraweza, kuko kuri uwo musi yaruhutse igikorwa cayo c’irema.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Iyi ni yo nkuru y’iremwa ry’isi n’ijuru. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ni we yaremye isi n’ijuru.<verse eid="GEN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />Nta bimera ku misozi vyari bwamere kw’isi kandi nta biti vyari bwakure, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana atari bwarungike imvura kw’isi, kandi nta muntu yari ahari wo kuyirima. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Ariko imigezi yiburuka iva mu kuzimu ikavomera isi. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana arema umuntu mu mukungugu wo hasi, ahumekera impwemu y’ubuzima mu mazuru yiwe, maze wa muntu aca aba uwufise ubuzima.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ategura itongo muri Edeni, ku ruhande rwo mu buseruko; aba ari ho ashira wa muntu yarema. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ameza ibiti vy’ubwoko bwose muri iryo tongo, ibiti bibereye ijisho kandi vyama ivyamwa biryoshe. Hagati muri iryo tongo ahashira igiti c’ubugingo n’igiti co kumenyekanisha iciza n’ikibi.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Uruzi rwavomera iryo tongo rwatemba ruva muri Edeni, rukigaburamwo inzuzi zine. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Uruzi rwa mbere rwitwa Pishoni, urwo rwatemba mu karere kose ka Havila, ahari inzahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Inzahabu zo muri ako karere ni nziza cane. Hari kandi n’ibimota neza bidasanzwe, n’ayandi mabuye y’agaciro bita onigisi. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Uruzi rwa kabiri rwitwa Gihoni rwatembera mu karere ka Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Uruzi wa gatatu rwitwa Tigiri. Urwo na rwo rwatemba rwerekeye mu buseruko bwa Ashuri. Uruzi rwa kane rwitwa Efurate.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ashira wa muntu mw’itongo rya Edeni kugira ngo aririme yongere arizigame. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana agabisha wa muntu ati: “Urashobora kurya ku vyamwa vy’igiti cose kiri muri iri tongo. <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />Ariko ntiwemerewe kurya ku giti kimenyekanisha iciza n’ikibi, kuko umusi wakiriyeko uzopfa nta kabuza.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana aravuga ati: “Si vyiza ko umuntu yibana wenyene. Ngira ndamuronderere umufasha bakwiranye.”<verse eid="GEN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana arema mw’ivu ibikoko vyose vyo mw’ishamba n’inyoni zose zo mu kirere, vyose abicisha imbere ya wa muntu kugira ngo avyite amazina, kandi uko yita ikiri n’ubuzima cose, ryaca riba izina ryaco. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Yise amazina ibikoko vyose vy’ibitungwa, inyoni zose zo mu kirere n’ibikoko vyose vyo mw’ishamba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:20">Ariko uwo muntu ntiyashoboye kuronkamwo umufasha bakwiranye. <verse eid="GEN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana asinziriza wa muntu ubutikoma. Agisinziriye, amukuramwo urubavu rumwe, maze muri ico kibanza ruvuyemwo ahuzuza inyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana abumba umugore muri urwo rubavu, araheza amuzanira wa mugabo.<verse eid="GEN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Wa mugabo aca aravuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">“Iri ni igufa ryo mu magufa yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">ni agace k’umubiri wanje!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">Azokwitwa ‘umugore’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 2:23">kuko yakuwe mu mugabo.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Ni co gituma umugabo azosiga se na nyina akabana n’umugore wiwe ubutakivana, maze bakaba umubiri umwe.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Uwo mugabo n’uwo mugore bari gusa, ariko nta soni vyabatera.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Uko icaha caje mu bantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Mu bikoko vyo mw’ishamba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yari yararemye, inzoka ni yo yarusha ibindi ubugunge. Umusi umwe ibaza wa mugore iti: “Ni ivy’ukuri ko Imana yababwiye iti: ‘Ntimukarye ku vyamwa vyo ku giti na kimwe co mw’itongo’?”<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Wa mugore yishura ya nzoka iti: “Turashobora kurya ku vyamwa vyo ku biti vyo mw’itongo, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />ariko Imana yavuze iti: ‘Ntimukarye ku vyamwa vy’igiti kiri hagati mw’itongo, ndetse ntimukagikoreko; kuko nimwabikora, muzopfa.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Ya nzoka ibwira wa mugore iti: “Ni ukuri ntimuzopfa. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Imana irazi ko umusi mwariye ku vyamwa vyaco amaso yanyu azokwuguruka, mukamera nk’Imana ku bijanye no kumenya iciza n’ikibi.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Nuko wa mugore abona ko ivyamwa vya ca giti ari vyiza, ko bibereye kuribwa kandi ko bituma umuntu agira ubwenge. Aca afata bimwe mu vyamwa vyaco arabirya, yongera ahako n’umugabo wiwe, na we ararya. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Ubwo nyene amaso yabo bompi aruguruka, batahura ko bari gusa, baca batangura guterateranya amababi y’ibiti vy’imisukoni kugira ngo baronke ivyo bipfuka.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Ku mugoroba akayaga kariko karahuhuta, wa mugabo n’umugore wiwe bumva <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana agendagenda mw’itongo, baca barinyegeza mu biti kugira ngo ntababone. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ahamagara wa mugabo, aramubaza ati: “Uri hehe?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Na we arishura ati: “Numvise uriko uragendagenda mw’itongo ngira ubwoba nca ndinyegeza kuko ndi gusa.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana aramubaza ati: “Ni nde yakubwiye ko uri gusa? Woba wariye ku vyamwa vya ca giti kandi narabikubujije?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Wa mugabo arishura ati: “Ni wa mugore wampa yampaye kuri ivyo vyamwa nca ndarya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana abaza wa mugore ati: “Ni kuki wakoze ivyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Wa mugore arishura ati: “Inzoka ni yo yampenze, ni co gituma nanje nariye kuri ico camwa.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana abwira ya nzoka ati: “Ko wubahutse gukora ivyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:14">uravumwe kurusha ibikoko vyose vy’ibitungwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">n’ibikoko vyose vyo mw’ishamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:14">Uzohora ugenda ukwega inda hasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">kandi uzorya umukungugu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:14">ubuzima bwawe bwose.<verse eid="GEN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Nzoshira urwanko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">hagati yawe n’uwu umugore</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">no hagati y’uruvyaro rwawe n’uruvyaro rwiwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:15">azokumena umutwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:15">nawe uzomukomora ku gitsintsiri.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Abwira wa mugore na we ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:16">“Nzogwiza ububabare bwawe mu gihe cawe co kuvyara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:16">uzovyara abana ubanje kubabara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:16">Uzohora wipfuza umugabo wawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:16">na we azokuganza.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Abwira Adamu na we ati: “Ko wumviye umugore wawe, ukarya ku vyamwa vya ca giti kandi nari narakwihanikirije nti: ‘Ntiwemerewe kurya ku vyamwa vyaco,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:17">Isi iravumwe kubera wewe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:17">uzoronka ivyo urya ubanje kuyirima ukaruha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:17">ubuzima bwawe bwose.<verse eid="GEN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Izokumerera amahwa n’ibitovu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:18">kandi uzorya ibimeze kuri yo.<verse eid="GEN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Kubira icuya mu ruhanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">ni kwo kuzotuma uronka ivyokurya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:19">kugeza usubiye mw’ivu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">kuko ari ryo wavuyemwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 3:19">Kuko uri umukungugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 3:19">kandi uzosubira mu mukungugu.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Nuko Adamu yita umugore wiwe Eva, kuko ni we yari agiye kuba nyina w’abafise ubuzima bose.<verse eid="GEN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana akorera Adamu na Eva impuzu mu nsato z’ibikoko arabambika. <verse eid="GEN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana aravuga ati: “Umuntu amaze kumera nkatwe mu bijanye no kumenya iciza n’ikibi. Hamwe yokwamura ivyamwa vyo ku giti c’ubugingo akabirya, yoca abaho ibihe bidashira.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana aca yirukana wa muntu muri rya tongo rya Edeni amurungika kurima isi yaremwemwo. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Amaze kwirukana wa muntu, aca ashira mu buseruko bw’itongo rya Edeni abakerubi hamwe n’inkota yaka umuriro iguma igenda igaruka kugira ngo irinde inzira ija ku giti c’ubugingo.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kayini na Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Nuko Adamu aryamana na Eva umugore wiwe, na we asama inda, avyara umwana bamwita Kayini. Aravuga ati: “Navyaye umuntu ndabifashijwemwo n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>!” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Mu nyuma avyara uwundi mwana w’umuhungu, bamwita Abeli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:2">Bamaze gukura, Abeli aba umwungere w’intama, Kayini na we aba umurimyi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Igihe kimwe, Kayini azana bimwe mu vyimburwa vyiwe abitanga nk’ishikanwa imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Abeli na we azana intama zavutse ubwa mbere, arazibaga, atanga inyama zazo zinuze nk’ishikanwa. Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ashima ishikanwa rya Abeli, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />ariko ntiyashima Kayini n’ishikanwa ryiwe. Maze ivyo bituma Kayini ashavura cane, ariraburanirwa.<verse eid="GEN 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza Kayini ati: “Ni kuki ushavuye utyo? Ni kuki wiraburaniwe? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Niwakora ibitunganye, uzoshimwa. Ariko niwakora ibidatunganye, icaha kibunze ku muryango kandi gishaka kukuganza, ariko ukwiye kukinesha.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Umusi umwe Kayini abwira murumunawe Abeli ati: “Ingo tujane mu mirima.” Bashitseyo, Kayini ahindukirira murumunawe Abeli, aramwica.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Hanyuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza Kayini ati: “Murumunawe Abeli ari hehe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Na we arishura ati: “Sindabizi. None ni jewe njejwe kuragira murumunanje?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Ivyo wakoze ni ibiki? Amaraso ya murumunawe ariko arasemerera ampamagara avugira mw’ivu! <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Ubu rero uravumwe kandi urirukanywe kuri iyi si yasamye ikamira amaraso ya murumunawe. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Niwarima, nta co uzokwimbura. Uzoba inyererezi igendagenda kw’isi.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kayini yishura <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Igihano ndonse kiraremereye kandi kirandengeye. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Unyirukanye muri kino gihugu kandi unyirukanye imbere yawe. Ungize inyererezi itagira aho iba kw’isi kandi umuntu wese azombona ashobora kunyica.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Oya, si ko bizogenda. Umuntu azokwica Kayini azobihanirwa incuro indwi.” Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ashira kuri Kayini ikimenyetso co kugabisha kugira ngo uwuzomubona ntazomwice. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Nuko Kayini ava imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aja kuba mu gihugu c’i Nodi, mu buseruko bwa Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uruvyaro rwa Kayini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Maze Kayini aryamana n’umugore wiwe, na we asama inda avyara umwana bamwita Enoki. Kayini yubaka igisagara, acita Enoki, acitiriye umuhungu wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enoki avyara umwana amwita Iradi; Iradi na we avyara Mehuyayeli; Mehuyayeli na we avyara Metushayeli; Metushayeli na we avyara Lameki.<verse eid="GEN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameki arongora abagore babiri, umwe yitwa Ada uwundi Zila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada avyara Jabali, maze Jabali aba sekuruza w’ababa mu mahema kandi b’aborozi. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Murumunawe yitwa Jubali. Uwo na we yabaye sekuruza w’abavuza inanga n’imyironge. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Zila na we avyara umwana amwita Tubali-Kayini. Na we yabaye umuhinga mu gucura ibikoresho mu mwakaka no mu vyuma. Tubali-Kayini yari afise mushikiwe yitwa Nama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Umusi umwe Lameki abwira abagore biwe ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada na Zila, nimunyumvirize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">bapfasoni banje, nimwumve amajambo yanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Narishe umuntu kuko yankomerekeje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">nica n’umusore kuko yankubise.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Nimba uwishe Kayini abihanirwa incuro indwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:24">uwishe Lameki we azobihanirwa incuro mirongo indwi n’indwi.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adamu yongera kuryamana n’umugore wiwe, na we avyara umuhungu amwita Seti, kuko yavuga ati: “Imana impaye uwundi mwana mu kibanza ca Abeli, uwo Kayini yishe.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Seti na we avyara umuhungu, amwita Enoshi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:26">Muri ico gihe abantu ni ho batangura kwambaza izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Uruvyaro rwa Adamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Uru ni rwo rukurikirane rw’abakomoka kuri Adamu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 5:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 5:1">Igihe Imana yarema abantu, yabaremye mw’ishusho yayo. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Yabaremye ari umugabo n’umugore kandi irabahezagira, maze ibita “abantu” igihe baremwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamu amaze imyaka ijana na mirongo itatu, yavyaye umuhungu yasa na we cane, ishusho yiwe bwite; maze amwita Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Seti amaze kuvuka, Adamu yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana umunani ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Adamu yamaze imyaka amajana icenda na mirongo itatu, hanyuma arapfa.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Seti amaze imyaka ijana n’itanu yavyaye Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Amaze kuvyara Enoshi, Seti yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana umunani n’indwi, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Seti yamaze imyaka amajana icenda na cumi n’ibiri, hanyuma arapfa.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Enoshi amaze imyaka mirongo icenda, yavyaye Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Kenani amaze kuvuka, Enoshi yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana umunani na cumi n’itanu ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Enoshi yabayeho imyaka amajana icenda n’itanu, hanyuma arapfa.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Kenani amaze imyaka mirongo indwi, yavyaye Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Mahalaleli amaze kuvuka, Kenani yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana umunani na mirongo ine, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kenani yamaze imyaka amajana icenda na cumi, hanyuma arapfa.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Mahalaleli amaze imyaka mirongo itandatu n’itanu, yavyaye Yaredi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Yaredi amaze kuvuka, Mahalaleli yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana umunani na mirongo itatu, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Mahalaleli yamaze imyaka amajana umunani na mirongo icenda n’itanu, hanyuma arapfa.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Yaredi amaze imyaka ijana na mirongo itandatu n’ibiri, yavyaye Enoki. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Enoki amaze kuvuka, Yaredi yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana umunani, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaredi yamaze imyaka amajana icenda na mirongo itandatu n’ibiri, hanyuma arapfa.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Enoki amaze imyaka mirongo itandatu n’itanu, yavyaye Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Metusela amaze kuvuka, Enoki yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana atatu, agendana n’Imana, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Enoki yamaze imyaka amajana atatu na mirongo itandatu n’itanu, <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />agendana n’Imana. Hanyuma umusi umwe arazimangana abantu baramubura, kuko Imana yamujanye.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Metusela amaze imyaka ijana na mirongo umunani n’indwi, yavyaye Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Lameki amaze kuvuka, Metusela yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana indwi na mirongo umunani n’ibiri, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Metusela yamaze imyaka amajana icenda na mirongo itandatu n’icenda, hanyuma arapfa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lameki amaze imyaka ijana na mirongo umunani n’ibiri, yavyaye umwana w’umuhungu. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Nuko uwo muhungu amwita Nowa, avuga ati: “Uzotuzanira ihumure mu bikorwa vy’umuruho tugira mu kurima iyi si <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavumye.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Nowa amaze kuvuka, Lameki yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana atanu na mirongo icenda n’itanu ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Lameki yamaze imyaka amajana indwi na mirongo indwi n’indwi, hanyuma arapfa.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Nowa amaze imyaka amajana atanu, yavyaye abahungu batatu, ari bo Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Isi yononekara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Abantu bamaze kugwira kw’isi bakavyara abakobwa, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />abana b’Imana babonye ko abo bakobwa b’abantu ari beza, maze barongora abo bihitiyemwo. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Mpwemu wanje ntazokwama yihanganira abantu, kuko ari imibiri ipfa gusa. Kuva ubu ntibazorenza imyaka ijana na mirongo ibiri.”<verse eid="GEN 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Muri iyo misi, no mu misi yakurikiye, kw’isi haba ibigatanya vy’Abanefilimu. Aho ni igihe abana b’Imana begera abakobwa b’abantu bakavyarana na bo. Abo ni bo bahizi ba kera, abantu ba rurangiranwa.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ingene ibibi abantu bakora vyabaye vyinshi kw’isi, n’ingene ivyo bakora n’ivyo biyumvira imisi yose ari ibibi gusa. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Ivyo bituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yicuza igituma yararemye abantu akabashira kw’isi, umutima wiwe wuzura umubabaro. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Ngiye kurandura aba bantu bose naremye ndabakure kw’isi. Nzobarandurana n’ibikoko bininibinini na bitobito, ivyikwega hasi n’inyoni zo mu kirere, kuko ndicujije icatumye ndabirema.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Ariko Nowa we <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amugirira ubuntu.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inkuru ya Nowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Iyi ni yo nkuru ya Nowa n’umuryango wiwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 6:9" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 6:9">Nowa yari umugororotsi, ni we muntu wenyene yaba kw’isi muri ico gihe atagira umugayo kandi yagendana n’Imana. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nowa yari afise abahungu batatu: Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Muri ico gihe, isi yari yarononekaye mu maso y’Imana, yuzuyemwo ubugizi bwa nabi. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Nuko Imana yihweza ingene isi yononekaye, kuko abantu bose bo kw’isi bakora ibibi, <verse eid="GEN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />maze ibwira Nowa iti: “Nafashe ingingo yo kurandura abantu bose, kuko isi yuzuye ibibi ku bwabo. Ngiye kubarandurana n’isi! <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Wewe niwibazire ubwato mu giti citwa goferi. Uze ubushiremwo ivyumba hanyuma ubuhomeshe ikaburimbi imbere n’inyuma. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Uku ni ko uzobukora: uburebure buze bube ingero z’igice c’ukuboko amajana atatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 135.</char></note>, ubwaguke ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 23.</char></note>, uburebure bw’igihagararo na bwo ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 14.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Uze usakare ubwo bwato, ariko usigaze umwanya wuguruye ungana n’ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 45.</char></note> musi y’igisakazo. Uze kandi ushire umuryango mu mbavu, hanyuma wubake ibisenge bitatu, ico hasi, ico hagati n’ico hejuru. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Ngiye guteza umwuzure kw’isi uzorandura ikintu cose kizima musi y’ijuru. Ikintu cose kiri kw’isi kizopfa. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Ariko nzogirana isezerano nawe. Uze winjire mu bwato, wewe n’umugore wawe, n’abahungu bawe n’abagore babo. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Uze winjirane mu bwato bibiribibiri mu bifise ubuzima vyose, ikigabo n’ikigore mu bwoko bwose bw’ibikoko, kugira ngo bikirane nawe. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Inyoni zibirizibiri mu bwoko bwose bw’inyoni, ibikoko bibiribibiri vyo mu bwoko bwose bw’ibikoko bininibinini, n’ivyikwega hasi; vyose bizoza aho uri kugira ngo bikirane nawe. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Kandi uze wibuke kujana ivyokurya bikwiye umuryango wawe n’ibikoko vyose.”<verse eid="GEN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nuko Nowa akora vyose nk’uko Imana yabimutegetse.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Nowa ati: “Injira mu bwato, wewe n’umuryango wawe wose, kuko nasanze ari wewe wenyene ugororotse mu bantu b’iki gihe. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Injirana ibikoko indwi vyo mu bwoko bwose bidahumanye, ikigabo n’ikigore; na bibiribibiri mu bikoko bihumanye, ikigabo n’ikigore, <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />wongere winjirane inyoni indwi zo mu bwoko bwose, ingabo n’ingore. Uko ni ko ubwoko bwavyo buzobandanya bubaho kw’isi inyuma y’umwuzure. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Mu misi indwi ngiye kurungika imvura kw’isi imare imisi mirongo ine n’amajoro mirongo ine igwa, kugeza ndanduye ikintu cose kizima naremye.”<verse eid="GEN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nuko Nowa akora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamutegetse vyose.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Nowa yari amaze imyaka amajana atandatu igihe umwuzure warengera isi. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Nuko Nowa, abahungu biwe, umugore wiwe n’abakazana biwe binjira mu bwato kugira ngo bahunge umwuzure. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Ubwoko bwose bw’ibikoko bidahumanye n’ibihumanye, n’ubw’inyoni hamwe n’ubw’ibikoko bitobito vyikwega hasi <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />vyinjirana na Nowa mu bwato ari bibiribibiri, ikigabo n’ikigore, nk’uko Imana yari yabitegetse Nowa. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Imisi indwi iheze ni ho umwuzure waza kw’isi.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Nowa amaze imyaka amajana atandatu, ku musi ugira indwi w’ukwezi kwa kabiri, amazi yose y’i kuzimu arazikuruka, n’ingomero zo mw’ijuru ziragomoroka. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Nuko imvura igwa kw’isi imisi mirongo ine n’amajoro mirongo ine.<verse eid="GEN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Uwo musi nyene ni ho Nowa yinjirana mu bwato n’umugore wiwe, n’abahungu biwe: Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti hamwe n’abagore babo. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Bari kumwe n’ibikoko vy’ubwoko bwose: ibitungano n’ibinyeshamba, ivyikwega hasi, hamwe n’ubwoko bwose bw’inyoni n’ibiguruka. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Bibiribibiri mu vyaremwe vyose bifise ubuzima vyaje aho Nowa ari vyinjira mu bwato. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Ivyinjiye vyari ikigore n’ikigabo vyo mu bwoko bwose, nk’uko Imana yari yabitegetse Nowa. Hanyuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca avyugaranira mu bwato na Nowa.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Nuko umwuzure ubandanya kwongerekana kumara imisi mirongo ine; amazi aba menshi, maze bwa bwato buca butangura kureremba hejuru y’isi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Amazi amaze kuduga akagwira rwose kw’isi, ubwato buca bureremba hejuru yayo. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Nuko amazi aragwira cane kw’isi arengera n’imisozi miremire yo musi y’ijuru, <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />araduga arengera amasonga y’imisozi iruta iyindi gushika nko ku ngero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi na zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 6,8.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Ibifise ubuzima vyose biri kw’isi birapfa: inyoni, ibikoko vy’ibitungwa, ibenyeshamba n’ibindi bikoko bitobito vyikwega hasi, n’abantu bose. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Ikintu cose kizima caba kw’isi kirapfa. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Uko ni ko Imana yaranduye ikintu cose gifise ubuzima: abantu, ibikoko, ivyikwega hasi hamwe n’inyoni zo mu kirere; vyose vyararanduwe. Nowa n’abari kumwe na we mu bwato ni bo bonyene barokotse.<verse eid="GEN 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Kandi umwuzure wamaze imisi mirongo itanu urengeye isi.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Umwuzure ugabanuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Maze Imana yibuka Nowa n’ibikoko vyose vyo mw’ishamba hamwe n’ibitungano vyari kumwe na we mu bwato, nuko irungika umuyaga kw’isi, maze amazi atangura kugabanuka. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Amazi y’i kuzimu ntiyasubira kuzikuruka, kandi na ya mvura y’isegenya irahita. <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />Nuko amazi y’umwuzure abandanya agabanuka kw’isi. Inyuma y’imisi ijana na mirongo itanu yari yagabanutse cane. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Ku musi ugira indwi w’ukwezi kw’indwi, bwa bwato buhagarara kuri umwe mu misozi ya Ararati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Nuko amazi abandanya agabanuka gushika mu kwezi kw’icumi. Ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kw’icumi ni ho amasonga y’imisozi yatangura kuboneka.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Inyuma y’imisi mirongo ine, Nowa yugurura idirisha yari yarasigaje ku bwato, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />arekura igikona, na co kiraguruka kigenda kigaruka, kugeza igihe amazi yakamye kw’isi. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Hanyuma Nowa arekura inuma kugira ngo arabe ko amazi yagabanutse kw’isi. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Ariko iyo numa ibura aho igwa, kuko amazi yari akirengeye isi. Nuko igaruka ku bwato, maze Nowa agorora ukuboko yinjiza ya numa mu bwato. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Haheze iyindi misi indwi, Nowa yongera kurekura ya numa kandi. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Ya numa igarutse ku mugoroba, izana ibabi rishasha ry’igiti ca Elayo mu kanwa kayo. Maze Nowa atahura ko amazi yagabanutse kw’isi. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Yongera arindira iyindi misi indwi, maze arekura ya numa kandi; ariko uwo musi ntiyagaruka.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Ico gihe Nowa yari amaze imyaka amajana atandatu n’umwe. Ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kwa mbere kw’uwo mwaka, amazi yari yamaze gukama. Nuko Nowa akurako icari gipfutse ubwato, maze abona ko isi iriko irumuka. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Ku musi ugira mirongo ibiri n’indwi w’ukwezi kwa kabiri isi yari imaze kwumuka rwose.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Imana ibwira Nowa iti: <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Va mu bwato, wewe n’umugore wawe, n’abahungu bawe hamwe n’abagore babo. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Rekura ibifise ubuzima vyose muri kumwe, inyoni, ibikoko n’ivyikwega hasi, kugira ngo birondoke kandi bigwire kw’isi.”<verse eid="GEN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Nuko Nowa, umugore wiwe, abahungu biwe n’abagore babo bava mu bwato. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Ibikoko vyose, ivyikwega hasi n’inyoni zose n’ibigendagenda kw’isi vyose birasohoka biva mu bwato, nk’uko amoko yavyo ari.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Maze Nowa yubakira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igicaniro, afata bimwe mu bikoko n’inyoni bidahumanye, abitangako ikimazi kuri ico gicaniro. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> anezerezwa n’ubumote bw’ico kimazi, araheza yivugana mu mutima ati: “Sinzosubira kuvuma isi ndayiziza abantu, naho ivyiyumviro vyo mu mitima yabo ari bibi kuva mu buto bwabo. Kandi sinzosubira kurandura ibifise ubuzima vyose nk’uko mpejeje kubikora.<verse eid="GEN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Isi ikiriho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">igihe co kubiba n’ico kwimbura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">igihe c’imbeho n’ic’ubushuhe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">igihe c’ici n’ic’agatasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">hamwe n’igihe c’ijoro n’ic’umurango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 8:22">bizokwamaho.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Imana igiriranira isezerano na Nowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Nuko Imana ihezagira Nowa n’abahungu biwe irababwira iti: “Nimurondoke mugwire mwuzure isi. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Ibikoko vyose vyo kw’isi, inyoni zose zo mu kirere, ibikoko bitobito vyikwega hasi, n’amafi yose yo mu biyaga bizobatinya bicike ivutu imbere yanyu. Vyose ndabishize musi y’ububasha bwanyu. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Ibintu vyose bigendagenda bibaho ndabibahaye kugira ngo bibabere ivyokurya, nk’uko nabahaye ibiterwa.<verse eid="GEN 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Ariko ntimuze mwigere murya inyama zikirimwo ubuzima, ari yo maraso. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Kandi uwuzosesa amaraso y’uwundi muntu nzobimuhanira; n’igikoko na co kizokwica umuntu gitegerezwa gupfa. Umuntu wese azokwica uwundi ategerezwa gupfa na we.<verse eid="GEN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Uwuzosesa amaraso y’umuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:6">amaraso yiwe na we azoseswa n’uwundi muntu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:6">kuko mw’ishusho y’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:6">ni ho umuntu yaremwe.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Mwebwe nimurondoke mugwire, mwuzure isi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Imana yongera ibwira Nowa n’abahungu biwe iti: <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Ngira ngirane isezerano namwe hamwe n’uruvyaro rwanyu, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />n’ivyaremwe vyose vyavanye namwe mu bwato: inyoni, ibikoko vy’ibitungwa, n’ibikoko vyose vyo mw’ishamba; muri make, ikintu cose kizima kiri kw’isi. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Nshizeho iri sezerano hagati yanje namwe, ko amazi y’umwuzure atazosubira kurandura ibifise ubuzima; ntihazosubira kubaho umwuzure ngo urandure isi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Imana yongerako iti: “Iki ni co kimenyetso c’isezerano ngiranye namwe n’ikintu cose kizima kiri kumwe namwe, kandi rikaba ari n’isezerano ry’abazovuka hanyuma: <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Nshizeho umunywamazi mu bicu; ni wo uzoba ikimenyetso c’isezerano ngiranye namwe n’isi yose. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Ninarungika ibicu hejuru y’isi, maze umunywamazi ukaboneka, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />nzoca nibuka isezerano nagiranye namwe n’ivyaremwe vyose. Amazi y’umwuzure ntazosubira kurandura ivyaremwe vyose. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Umunywamazi niwaboneka mu bicu, nzowubona maze nibuke isezerano ridata igihe hagati y’Imana n’ivyaremwe vyose biri kw’isi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Imana ibwira Nowa iti: “Iki ni co kimenyetso c’isezerano ngiraniye namwe hamwe n’ivyaremwe vyose biri kw’isi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abahungu ba Nowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Abahungu ba Nowa bavanye na we mu bwato ni Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti. Hamu ni we sekuruza wa Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Aba ni bo bahungu batatu ba Nowa, kandi abantu bose bakwiragiye kw’isi bakomotse kuri bo.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Inyuma y’umwuzure, Nowa yabaye umurimyi maze atera uruzabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Umusi umwe Nowa anywa umuvinyu yari yaganye, araborerwa maze aryama atambaye mw’ihema ryiwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Hamu, sekuruza wa Kanani, abonye ko se ari gusa, arasohoka abibwira abavukanyi biwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Nuko Shemu na Yafeti bafatira impuzu ku bitugu vyabo, bagenza umugongo binjira mw’ihema, bapfuka se. Binjiye bagenza umugongo kugira ngo ntibabone ubwambure bwa se.<verse eid="GEN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Nowa yikanguye atakiborewe akamenya ivyo umuhererezi wiwe yakoze, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />aravuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">“Kanani aravumwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">Azobera bene se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">umugurano ari inyuma y’abandi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Yongerako ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Shemu iragahezagirwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanani aze amubere umugurano.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Imana ize yagure amatongo ya Yafeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Yafeti aze yibere mu mahema ya Shemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanani aze amubere umugurano.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Inyuma y’umwuzure, Nowa yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana atatu na mirongo itanu. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Imyaka yose Nowa yabayeho ni amajana icenda na mirongo itanu, hanyuma arapfa.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Urutonde rw’amahanga</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Uru ni rwo rukurikirane rw’imiryango ya Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti, abahungu batatu ba Nowa, na bo bakaba bavyaye abahungu inyuma y’umwuzure.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Uruvyaro rwa Yafeti</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Bene Yafeti ni: Gomeri,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:2">Magogi, Madayi, Yavani, Tubali, Mesheki na Tirasi.<verse eid="GEN 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Bene Gomeri ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:3">Ashikenazi, Rifati na Togaruma.<verse eid="GEN 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Bene Yavani ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:4">Elisa, Tarushishi, Kitimu na Dodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Ababakomotseko babaye ku biyaga ni na bo bakwiragiye mu bihugu bitandukanye, umwumwe wese bijanye n’ururimi rwiwe, ubwoko bwiwe n’igihugu ciwe.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Uruvyaro rwa Hamu</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Bene Hamu ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:6">Kushi, Egiputa, Puti na Kanani.<verse eid="GEN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Bene Kushi ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:7">Seba, Havila, Sabuta, Rama na Sabuteka.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 10:7">Abahungu ba Rama ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:7">Sheba na Dedani.<verse eid="GEN 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kushi yavyaye Nimurodi, uwo ni we yatanguye kuba umuhizi mu ntambara kw’isi. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Kubera ko yari umuhigi w’umunyenkomezi wa mbere kw’isi, izina ryiwe ryabaye rurangiranwa. Ni co gituma abantu bavuga bati: “Uwu muntu ameze nka Nimurodi, wa muhigi w’umunyenkomezi mu maso y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Ibisagara vya mbere vy’ubwami bwiwe vyari Babiloni, Ereki, Akadi na Kalune mu gihugu ca Shinari. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Avuye aho, yahavuye yagura ubwami bwiwe ashika muri Ashuri, yubaka Ninewe, Rehoboti Iru, Kala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />na Reseni, igisagara kinini kiri hagati ya Ninewe na Kala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Abakomotse kuri Egiputa ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:13">Abaludi, Abanami, Abalehabi, Abanafutuhi, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Abapatirusi n’Abakasiluni (ari bo bakomotsweko n’Abafilisitiya), hamwe n’Abakafutori.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanani yavyaye</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:15">Sidoni, ari we mfura yiwe, hamwe na Heti. <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />Kandi yakomotsweko n’Abayebusi, Abamori, Abagirugashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Abahiwi, Abaruki, Abasini <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Abaruvadi, Abazemari n’Abahamati.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:18">Mu nyuma imiryango y’Abanyakanani yahavuye isanzara. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Imbibe z’igihugu c’i Kanani zava i Sidoni mu buraruko bwa Gerari n’i Gaza mu bumanuko, na Sodomu, Gomora, Adima na Zeboyimu mu buseruko, gushika i Lasha.<verse eid="GEN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Aba ni bo bahungu ba Hamu, uko imiryango yabo, indimi zabo, intara zabo n’ibihugu vyabo biri.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Uruvyaro rwa Shemu</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shemu, mukuru wa Yafeti, na we yavyaye abahungu; ni we sekuruza w’abakomoka kuri Eberi.<verse eid="GEN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Bene Shemu ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:22">Elamu, Ashuri, Arupakisade, Ludi na Aramu.<verse eid="GEN 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Abahungu ba Aramu ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:23">Uzi, Huli, Geteri na Mesheki.<verse eid="GEN 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arupakisade yavyaye Shela;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:24">Shela na we avyara Eberi.<verse eid="GEN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Eberi yavyaye abahungu babiri:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:25">umwe yitwa Pelegi, kuko igihe yavuka abantu bari kw’isi bari bigabuyemwo ibice; uwundi bavukana yitwa Yokitani.<verse eid="GEN 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yokitani yavyaye</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 10:26">Alumodadi, Shelefu, Hazarumaveti, Yera, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadoramu, Uzali, Dikula, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obali, Abimayeli, Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofiru, Havila, na Yobabu. Abo bose bari abahungu ba Yokitani.<verse eid="GEN 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Igihugu babamwo cahera i Mesha gushika i Sefaru mu misozi yo mu buseruko.<verse eid="GEN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Aba ni bo bakomotse kuri Shemu, nk’uko imiryango yabo, indimi zabo, intara zabo n’ibihugu vyabo biri.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Iyo ni yo miryango yakomotse ku bahungu ba Nowa nk’uko imiryango yabo mu bihugu vyabo iri. Amahanga yose yo mw’isi yakomotse kuri iyi miryango inyuma y’umwuzure.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Umunara wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Muri ico gihe, abantu bose baba kw’isi bavuga ururimi rumwe, bagakoresha n’amajambo amwe. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Bamaze kwimukira mu buseruko, basanga ikiyaya mu gihugu ca Shinari, baca bagereraho.<verse eid="GEN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Nuko baravugana bati: “Nimuze tubumbe amatafari tuyaturire neza.” Muri ico gihugu bubakisha amatafari mu gishingo c’amabuye n’ikaburimbi mu gishingo c’isima n’umusenyi. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Baravuga bati: “Nimuze twiyubakire igisagara gifise umunara ushika mw’ijuru. Ivyo bitume tumenyekana cane kandi bitume tudashwiragira kw’isi yose.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amanukanwa no kuraba ico gisagara n’umunara abo bantu bariko barubaka. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Aravuga ati: “Aba bantu bagiye hamwe kandi bavuga ururimi rumwe. Ko batanguye gukora ibi, nta kintu na kimwe bazoshaka gukora kizobananira. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Reka tumanuke dutume haba indimi nyinshi, maze bazazanirwe vyanke ko bumvikana.”<verse eid="GEN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Uko ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabashwiragirije kw’isi yose, bituma batabandanya kwubaka ca gisagara. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Ni co gituma ico gisagara ciswe Babeli, kuko aho ni ho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yateye abantu kuzazanirwa kubera indimi nyinshi, maze abashwiragiza kw’isi yose.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuva kuri Shemu gushika kuri Aburamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Uru ni rwo rukurikirane rw’abagize umuryango wa Shemu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 11:10" />
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 11:10">Shemu amaze imyaka ijana, aca avyara Arupakisade; aho hari haheze imyaka ibiri inyuma y’umwuzure. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Arupakisade amaze kuvuka, Shemu yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana atanu, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Arupakisade amaze imyaka mirongo itatu n’itanu, yavyaye Shela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Shela amaze kuvuka, Arupakisade yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana ane n’itatu, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Shela amaze imyaka mirongo itatu, yavyaye Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Eberi amaze kuvuka, Shela yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana ane n’itatu, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Eberi amaze imyaka mirongo itatu n’ine, yavyaye Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Pelegi amaze kuvuka, Eberi yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana ane na mirongo itatu, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelegi amaze imyaka mirongo itatu, yavyaye Rewu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Rewu amaze kuvuka, Pelegi yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana abiri n’icenda, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Rewu amaze imyaka mirongo itatu n’ibiri yavyaye Serugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Serugi amaze kuvuka, Rewu yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana abiri n’indwi, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Serugi amaze imyaka mirongo itatu, yavyaye Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Nahori amaze kuvuka, Serugi yabayeho iyindi myaka amajana abiri, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Nahori amaze imyaka mirongo ibiri n’icenda, yavyaye Tera. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Tera amaze kuvuka, Nahori yabayeho iyindi myaka ijana na cumi n’icenda, ayivyaramwo abandi bahungu n’abakobwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tera amaze imyaka mirongo indwi, yavyaye Aburamu, Nahori na Harani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uruvyaro rwa Tera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Uru ni rwo rukurikirane rw’abagize umuryango wa Tera.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 11:27" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 11:27">Tera yavyaye Aburamu, Nahori na Harani. Harani na we yavyaye Loti. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Ariko Harani yapfiriye muri Uri mu Bakaludaya, mu gihugu ciwe c’amavukiro, se Tera akiriho. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Maze Aburamu na Nahori na bo bararongora. Umugore wa Aburamu yitwa Sarayi; umugore wa Nahori na we yitwa Milika, akaba yari umukobwa wa Harani, uwo Harani ni we yari se wa Isika kandi. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Sarayi yari ingumba, ntiyashobora kuronka umwana.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Umusi umwe Tera ava muri Uri mu Bakaludaya aja i Kanani ajanye na Aburamu umuhungu wiwe, n’umwuzukuru wiwe Loti, umuhungu wa Harani, hamwe n’umukazana wiwe Sarayi, umugore wa Aburamu. Ariko bashitse i Harani, baca bagereraho.<verse eid="GEN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tera yamaze imyaka amajana abiri n’itanu, hanyuma apfira i Harani.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ihamagarwa rya Aburamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Aburamu ati: “Va mu gihugu cawe, mu bwoko bwawe no mu muryango wa so, uje mu gihugu nzokwereka.<verse eid="GEN 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Nzokugira ihanga rikomeye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">kandi nzoguhezagira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:2">izina ryawe nzorigira rurangiranwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:2">kandi uzobera abandi umuhezagiro.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Abazoguhezagira nzobahezagira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">kandi abazokuvuma nzobavuma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:3">imiryango yose yo kw’isi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">izohezagirwa biciye kuri wewe.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Nuko Aburamu aca aragenda nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamutegetse ajana n’umuhungwabo Loti. Igihe yava i Harani, Aburamu yari amaze imyaka mirongo indwi n’itanu. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Nuko agenda ajanye n’umugore wiwe Sarayi, n’umuhungwabo Loti, n’ibintu vyose bari batunze hamwe n’abantu bose bari baronkeye i Harani, maze berekeza mu gihugu c’i Kanani, baragenda bashikayo.<verse eid="GEN 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Aburamu aca muri ico gihugu ashika ahitwa i Shekemu, ku giti kinini ca More. Muri ico gihe, Abanyakanani ni bo baba muri ico gihugu. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Hanyuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yiyereka Aburamu, aramubwira ati: “Uruvyaro rwawe nzoruha iki gihugu.” Aburamu aca yubakira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamwiyeretse igicaniro aho hantu.<verse eid="GEN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Inyuma y’aho, Aburahamu yerekeza mu bumanuko, ashinga amahema mu misozi yaho. Mu burengero hari Beteli, mu buseruko hakaba Hayi. Aho na ho ahubakira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikindi gicaniro, maze asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="GEN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Hanyuma Aburamu arabandanya aja mu bumanuko, agenda aracumbika, atumbereye i Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aburamu aja kuba muri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Hanyuma muri ico gihe hatera inzara ikomeye muri ico gihugu, bituma Aburamu aja kuba muri Egiputa ahamara igihe. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Bagira bashike muri Egiputa, Aburamu abwira umugore wiwe Sarayi ati: “Ndazi ko uri umugore mwiza cane. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Abanyegiputa nibakubona bazovuga bati: ‘Uwu ni umugore wiwe.’ Bazoca banyica, ariko wewe bakureke ubeho. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Ndagusavye rero uze ubabwire ko uri mushikanje; ivyo bizotuma bamfata neza ntibanyice kubera wewe.”<verse eid="GEN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Aburamu ashitse muri Egiputa, Abanyegiputa babona ko umugore wiwe ari mwiza cane. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Abaganwa ba Farawo bamubonye na bo babwira Farawo ubwiza bwiwe. Maze baca bajana Sarayi ku kirimba c’umwami. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Ivyo vyatumye umwami afata Aburamu neza amuha intama, impene, inka, indogoba z’ingabo n’ingore, abakozi b’abahungu n’abakobwa n’ingamiya, ku bwa Sarayi.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ateza Farawo n’umuryango wiwe ivyago bitandukanye kubera Sarayi, umugore wa Aburamu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Nuko Farawo atumako Aburamu aramubaza ati: “Ibi wankoreye ni ibiki? Ni kuki utambwiye ko ari umugore wawe? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Ni kuki wavuze ngo ni mushikawe, bigatuma ndamugira umugore wanje? Ubu rero, ng’uwo umugore wawe. Mwakire muce muva aha mugende!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Nuko Farawo ategeka bamwe mu bakozi biwe kwirukana Aburamu, bamurungikana n’umugore wiwe n’ivyo yari atunze vyose.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Aburamu atandukana na Loti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Nuko Aburamu ava muri Egiputa asubira i Negebu, ari kumwe n’umugore wiwe Sarayi, n’umuhungwabo Loti, n’ivyo bari batunze vyose. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Ico gihe Aburamu yari afise ibitungwa vyinshi, n’ifeza n’inzahabu.<verse eid="GEN 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Nuko ava ni Negebu, agenda aracumbika, ashika i Beteli, muri ca kibanza cari hagati ya Beteli na Hayi, aho yari yarashinze amahema ubwa mbere. <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />Aho ni ho Aburamu yari yarubatse igicaniro, akahasengera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Loti, umwe yagumye agendana na Aburamu, na we yari afise ibitungwa bininibinini na bitobito hamwe n’amahema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Ariko aho hantu bari ntihashobora kubakwira bari kumwe, kuko ivyo bari batunze vyari vyinshi bituma badashobora kugumana. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Nuko haduka impari hagati y’abungere b’imikuku ya Aburamu n’ab’imikuku ya Loti. Muri ico gihe, Abanyakanani n’Abaperizi ni bo baba muri ico gihugu.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Aburamu abwira Loti ati: “Ntihakwiye kuba impari hagati y’abungere bawe n’abanje, kuko turi incuti. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Igihugu cose kiri imbere yawe. Ndakwinginze tuvane. Niwahitamwo i bubamfu, ndaja i buryo; niwahitamwo i buryo, ndaja i bubamfu.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Nuko Loti yunamura amaso araba ikiyaya ca Yorodani yerekeye i Zowari. Ako karere karimwo inzuzi nyinshi, nk’itongo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> canke nk’igihugu ciza ca Egiputa. Aho hari imbere y’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arandura ibisagara vya Sodomu na Gomora. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Maze Loti yihitiramwo ikiyaya cose ca Yorodani agenda atumbereye mu buseruko. Uko ni ko bavanye. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Nuko Aburamu ahitamwo kuba mu gihugu c’i Kanani, Loti na we aja kuba mu bisagara vyo muri ca kiyaya, ashinga amahema yiwe hafi y’i Sodomu. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Abantu b’i Sodomu bakora ibibi vyinshi kandi bacumura k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Loti amaze kugenda, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Aburamu ati: “Unamura amaso yawe uhereye aha uri, urabe mu mihingo yose: mu buraruko, mu bumanuko, mu buseruko no mu burengero. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Iki gihugu cose ubona nzokiguha wewe n’uruvyaro rwawe kibe icanyu ibihe vyose. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Uruvyaro rwawe nzorugwiza nk’umukungugu wo kw’isi ku buryo ata muntu azoshobora kubaharura. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Gendagenda mu gihugu cose, kuko ndakikugabiye.”<verse eid="GEN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Nuko Aburamu yimura amahema yiwe aja kuba i Heburoni hafi y’ibiti binini vya Mamure. Aho na ho ahubakira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igicaniro.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Aburamu atabara Loti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Muri ico gihe, haduka intambara muri ako karere. Amurafeli umwami w’i Shinari, Ariyoki umwami w’i Elasari, Kedolawoma umwami w’i Elamu na Tidali umwami w’i Goyimu; <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />bose batera Bera umwami w’i Sodomu, Birusha umwami w’i Gomora, Shinabu umwami w’i Adima, Shemeberi umwami w’i Zeboyimu, n’umwami w’i Bela, ari ho Zowari. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Abo bami batanu bagize urunani bashira inguvu zabo hamwe mu kiyaya ca Sidimu, ari co kiyaya c’Ikiyaga c’Umunyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Bari bamaze imyaka icumi n’ibiri bakorera umwami Kedolawoma, maze mu mwaka ugira icumi na gatatu baramugarariza.<verse eid="GEN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Mu mwaka ugira icumi na kane, umwami Kedolawoma azanana n’abami bafatanije na we batera Abarefayimu i Ashiteroti-Karunayimu, n’Abazuzi i Hamu, n’Abamiti i Shave Kiriyatayimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />n’Abahori babaneshereza iwabo ku musozi Seyiri, babashitsa i Eliparani aho ubugaragwa bugarukira. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Maze basubira inyuma baja ahitwa Eni-Mishipati, ari ho Kadeshi, bigarurira igihugu cose c’Abamaleki, hamwe n’ic’Abamori baba i Hazazoni-Tamari.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Hanyuma umwami w’i Sodomu, uw’i Gomora, uw’i Adima, uw’i Zeboyimu n’uw’i Bela, ari ho i Zowari, barahagaruka baja hamwe bitegurira ingwano mu kiyaya c’i Sidimu <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />bahangana na Kedolawoma umwami w’i Elamu, na Tidali umwami w’i Goyimu, na Amurafeli umwami w’i Shinari na Ariyoki umwami w’i Elasari; abo bami bane bahangana na batanu. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Ikiyaya c’i Sidimu cari cuzuye ibinogo vyimbwemwo ikaburimbi, maze ingabo z’abami b’i Sodomu n’i Gomora bariko barahunga, bamwe muri bo bakorokera muri vya binogo, abandi na bo bahungira ku misozi. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Nuko ba bami bane baratsinda, begeranya ubutunzi bwose bw’i Sodomu n’i Gomora, n’ivyimburwa vyabo vyose barabijana. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Bajana na Loti wa muhungwabo na Aburamu yaba i Sodomu hamwe n’ivyiwe vyose.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Umwe mu bari bacitse kw’icumu araza abibwira Aburamu Umuheburayo, yaba hafi y’ibiti binini vya Mamure Umumori, yavukana na Eshikoli na Aneri; kandi abo bari bafatanije na Aburamu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Aburamu yumvise ko umuhungwabo yagizwe imbohe, yegeranya abagabo amajana atatu na cumi n’umunani bavukiye iwe kandi bigishijwe ivyo kugwana, maze akurikira ba bami bane gushika i Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Ahashitse agabura abantu biwe mu migwi, abatera mw’ijoro; maze anesha abo bami, arabakurikirana gushika i Hoba mu buraruko bw’i Damasiko. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Aburamu yegeranya ibintu vyose vyari vyibwe, agarukana n’umuhungwabo Loti hamwe n’ivyiwe vyose, n’abagore bose hamwe n’abandi bantu.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Aburamu atabarutse ahejeje kunesha umwami Kedolawoma n’abami bari bafatanije, umwami w’i Sodomu aza kumusanganira mu kiyaya c’i Shave, ari co bita ikiyaya c’umwami.<verse eid="GEN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Maze Melekisedeki umwami w’i Salemu, akaba n’umuherezi w’Imana Musumbavyose amuzanira imikate n’umuvinyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Ahezagira Aburamu avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 14:19">“Aburamu aragahezagirwa n’Imana Musumbavyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:19">yaremye ijuru n’isi.<verse eid="GEN 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Kandi iragahezagirwa Imana Musumbavyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 14:20">yaguhaye kunesha abansi bawe.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Nuko Aburamu aha Melekisedeki ica cumi c’ivyo yari afise vyose.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Umwami w’i Sodomu abwira Aburamu ati: “Ndagusavye umpe abantu, ariko ugumane ibintu wagaruye.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Aburamu aramwishura ati: “Ndakurahiye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana Musumbavyose, yaremye ijuru n’isi, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />ko ata kintu na kimwe cawe ntwara, n’aho koba akanyuzi canke umugozi w’ikirato, kugira ngo ntuzohave uvuga uti: ‘Ni jewe natungishije Aburamu.’ <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Jewe nta kintu na kimwe ntwara uretse ivyo abantu banje bariye. Ariko abo dufatanije Aneri, Eshikoli na Mamure barashobora kwakira imigabane yabo.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Imana igiriranira isezerano na Aburamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Hanyuma y’ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avugana na Aburamu mu ndoto ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 15:1">“Aburamu, ntugire ubwoba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 15:1">Ni jewe nzogukingira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 15:1">kandi ni jewe nzoguha impera ikomeye.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Ariko Aburamu arishura ati: “Uhoraho Nyeninganji, mbega imihezagiro yose wompa yomarira iki, ko ntagira umwana? Uwugiye kuragwa ivyanje vyose ni Eliyezeri umukozi wanje ava i Damasiko.” <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Aburamu yongerako ati: “Erega nta ruvyaro wampaye, ni co gituma umwe mu bakozi banje ari we agiye kuba samuragwa wanje.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Oya, si umukozi wawe azokubera samuragwa, ahubwo umuhungu wawe bwite ni we azokubera samuragwa.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ajana Aburamu hanze aramubwira ati: “Raba kw’ijuru uharure inyenyeri nimba wobishobora. Uko ni ko uruvyaro rwawe ruzongana!”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Nuko Aburamu yizera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amwemera nk’umugororotsi.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramubwira ati: “Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nagukuye muri Uri mu Bakaludaya kugira ngo ndaguhe iki gihugu kibe iragi ryawe.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Ariko Aburamu aramubaza ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, ni igiki conyemeza ko iki gihugu kizoba icanje?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Nzanira ishashi y’inka, ishashi y’impene n’impfizi y’intama; vyose bimaze imyaka itatu; uzane n’intunguru hamwe n’inuma ikiri nto.”<verse eid="GEN 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Aburamu azana vya bikoko, abihimburamwo kubiri, maze igihimba cose agitumberanya na kigenzi caco, ariko za nyoni ntiyazihimburamwo kubiri. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Nuko ibinyoni bikunda inyama biza aho ya mivyimba iri, ariko Aburamu akaguma avyirukana.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Izuba rigiye kurenga, Aburamu afatwa n’itiro ryinshi cane, maze umwijima w’umuzitanya uteye ubwoba uramuhwikira. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca abwira Aburamu ati: “Umenye neza ko abagukomokako bazoba abanyamahanga mu gihugu kitari icabo. Bazoba abagurano muri ico gihugu imyaka amajana ane. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Ariko nzohana igihugu kizobagira abagurano, kandi mu nyuma bazokivamwo bafise ubutunzi bwinshi. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Ariko wewe uzoramba wipfire ushaje kandi mu mahoro, uhamvye ba sogokuruza. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Ku runganwe rugira kane, uruvyaro rwawe ruzogaruka muri kino gihugu, kuko ivyaha vy’Abamori ntibiraba vyinshi kugira ngo ndabirukane mu gihugu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Izuba rimaze kurenga hakaza umwijima, haza inkono yo gucaniramwo ifumba umwotsi n’ikimuri caka bica hagati ya vya bihimba vy’imivyimba. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Uwo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agirana isezerano na Aburamu avuga ati: “Iki gihugu ndagihaye uruvyaro rwawe, kuva ku ruzi rwa Egiputa gushika ku ruzi runini Efurate. <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />Ni igihugu c’Abakayini, Abakenizi, Abakadimoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Abaheti, Abaperizi, Abarefayimu, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Abamori, Abanyakanani, Abagirugashi n’Abayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ivuka rya Ishimayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Sarayi muka Aburamu, ntiyari bwashobore kuvyarana na we umwana. Ariko yari afise incoreke y’Umunyegiputakazi yitwa Hagari. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Nuko Sarayi abwira Aburamu ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyashatse ko ndonka umwana. None genda uryamane n’umuguranokazi wanje. Hari n’aho vyokunda nkaronka abana biciye kuri we.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:2">Nuko Aburamu yumvira Sarayi umugore wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Sarayi umugore wa Aburamu afata Hagari ya ncoreke y’Umunyegiputakazi, umuha Aburamu umugabo wiwe nk’umugore. Ivyo vyabaye Aburamu amaze imyaka icumi aba mu gihugu c’i Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Nuko Aburamu aryamana na Hagari, na we aca asama inda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:4">Hagari amaze kumenya ko yibungenze, atangura gusuzugura inabuja Sarayi. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Sarayi abwira Aburamu ati: “Nimba ndiko ndasuzugurwa ni ikosa ryawe! Naguhaye incoreke yanje nk’umugore, none amaze kubona ko yibungenze, aratanguye kunsuzugura. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we akwiye guca urubanza hagati yanje nawe!”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Aburamu aramwishura ati: “None ko ari incoreke yawe, mugirire ico ushaka.” Nuko Sarayi aca atangura gufata Hagari nabi cane ku buryo ahava akiyomora.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> araza asanga Hagari hafi y’iriba mu bugaragwa; iryo riba ryari hafi y’inzira ija i Shuri. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Aramubaza ati: “Hagari, ncoreke ya Sarayi, uva he, ukaja he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Aramwishura ati: “Ndiko ndahunga mabuja Sarayi.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Wa mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramubwira ati: “Subira kwa nyokobuja, uce bugufi imbere yiwe.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Yongerako ati: “Nzogwiza uruvyaro rwawe ku buryo rutazoharurika.”<verse eid="GEN 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Wa mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yongera aramubwira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">“Uribungenze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">kandi uzovyara umuhungu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:11">Uze umwite Ishimayeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ishimayeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">risigura ngo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Imana irumva.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:11">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yumvise ijwi ry’umubabaro wawe.<verse eid="GEN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Uwo mwana azomera nk’indogoba y’inyeshamba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">azohangana n’abantu bose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">kandi abantu bose bazohangana na we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 16:12">kandi azokwankana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 16:12">n’abavukanyi biwe bose.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, Hagari yita izina <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari ahejeje kuvugana na we. Aravuga ati: “Uri Eli Royi, Imana imbona,” kuko yavuga ati: “Ni ivy’ukuri ndabonye Imana y’indavyi.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Ni co gituma iryo riba baryise Beyeri-Lahayi-Royi bisigura “Iriba ry’Imana nzima imbona”. Iryo riba riri hagati ya Kadeshi na Beredi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Nuko Hagari avyarana na Aburamu umuhungu, Aburahamu aca amwita Ishimayeli. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Ico gihe Hagari yavyara Ishimayeli, Aburamu yari afise imyaka mirongo umunani n’itandatu.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Aburamu yitwa Aburahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Aburamu amaze imyaka mirongo icenda n’icenda, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwiyereka amubwira ati: “Ndi Imana Mushoboravyose; gendera imbere yanje mu bwizigirwa kandi ubeho ubuzima butagira umugayo. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Nzogirana isezerano nawe kandi nzoguha uruvyaro runini.”<verse eid="GEN 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Aburamu avyumvise yikubita hasi yubamye. Maze Imana aramubwira iti: <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Iri ni ryo sezerano ngiranye nawe: nzokugira sekuruza w’amahanga menshi. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Kandi kuva ubu ntuzosubira kwitwa Aburamu, uzokwitwa Aburahamu, kuko ndakugize sekuruza w’amahanga menshi. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Nzoguha kurondoka cane. Uruvyaro rwawe ruzovamwo amahanga menshi, kandi muri bo hazovamwo abami. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Nzokomeza isezerano hagati yawe nanje no hagati yanje n’uruvyaro rwawe ribe isezerano ridahera, uko urunganwe ruzokurikirana n’urundi. Nzoba Imana yawe n’Imana y’uruvyaro rwawe. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Igihugu cose c’i Kanani, ico ubamwo ubu nk’umunyamahanga, nzokiguha wewe n’uruvyaro rwawe kibe icanyu bwegu ibihe vyose, kandi nzobabera Imana.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Icerekana iryo isezerano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Imana yongera ibwira Aburahamu iti: “Wewe n’uruvyaro rwawe mubwirizwa kwubahiriza iri sezerano, uko urunganwe ruzokurikirana n’urundi. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Iri ni ryo sezerano ryanje wewe n’uruvyaro rwawe mubwirizwa kwubahiriza: umuhungu wese ategerezwa gukebwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Mutegerezwa gukebwa, kandi ico kizoba ikimenyetso c’isezerano ngiranye namwe. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikira urundi, umuhungu wese atagerezwa gukebwa amaze imisi umunani avutse, utibagiye n’abagurano bazovukira mu rugo rwawe canke abo uzogura amahera mu banyamahanga, abazoba batari abo mu ruvyaro rwawe. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Baba abavukiye mu rugo rwawe canke abo waguze amahera, bose bategerezwa gukebwa. Imibiri yanyu izogaragarako icerekana isezerano ryanje ridahera. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Umuhungu wese atazokebwa, azocibwa mu bwoko bwiwe, kuko azoba atubahirije isezerano ryanje.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sarayi yitwa Sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Hanyuma Imana ibwira Aburahamu iti: “Sarayi umugore wawe ntuzosubire kumwita Sarayi, kuva ubu uzomwite Sara. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Nzomuhezagira kandi nzoguha umuhungu nciye kuri we. Nzomuhezagira kandi azoba nyina w’amahanga; abami n’amahanga menshi bazokomoka kuri we.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Nuko Aburahamu yikubita hasi yubamye, aratwenga yivugana mu mutima ati: “Mbe umuntu w’imyaka ijana nkanje yoba akivyara umwana? Mbe Sara yoba akivyara umwana amaze imyaka mirongo icenda?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Maze Aburahamu abwira Imana ati: “Icompa Ishimayeli akagira umuhezagiro wawe!”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Imana iravuga iti: “Oya, Sara umugore wawe azokuvyarira umwana w’umuhungu, uze umwite Isaka. Nzokomeza isezerano ryanje na we n’uruvyaro rwiwe, ribe isezerano ridahera. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Ku bijanye na Ishimayeli, numvise ico wasavye: nzomuhezagira, nzomuha kurondoka cane, ntume uruvyaro rwiwe rugwira cane. Azoba sekuruza w’abakuru b’imiryango icumi na babiri, kandi uruvyaro rwiwe ruzoba ihanga rikomeye. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Ariko isezerano ryanje nzorikomeza kuri Isaka, uwo Sara azokuvyarira igihe nk’iki mu mwaka uza.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Imana ihejeje kuvugana na Aburahamu ica ivana na we iragenda.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Uwo musi nyene Aburahamu afata umuhungu wiwe Ishimayeli n’umugabo wese yaba mu rugo rwiwe, harimwo abahavukiye n’abo yaguze amahera, arabakeba nk’uko Imana yari yamubwiye. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Aburahamu yari amaze imyaka mirongo icenda n’icenda igihe yakebwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Ishimayeli, umuhungu wiwe, yari amaze imyaka icumi n’itatu igihe yakebwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Aburahamu n’umuhungu wiwe Ishimayeli, uko ari babiri, bakebwe uwo umusi. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Umuntu wese w’igitsina gabo yaba mu rugo rwa Aburahamu, yaba uwahavukiye canke uwaguzwe amahera mu banyamahanga, na we yakebwe uwo musi hamwe na we.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Abashitsi batatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> asubira kwiyereka Aburahamu ku biti binini vya Mamure yicaye mu muryango w’ihema ryiwe. Muri uwo mwanya hari hashushe cane. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Aburahamu yunamura amaso araraba, maze abona abagabo batatu bahagaze hafi yiwe. Ababonye ava mu muryango w’ihema yiruka kubasanganira, yikubita hasi imbere yabo yubamye.<verse eid="GEN 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />Aravuga ati: “Ba nyakwubahwa, nimba ngiriwe ubuntu imbere yanyu, ndabasavye mushike iwanje, jewe umusavyi wanyu. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Munkundire ndabazanire amazi makeya mwoge ibirenge, hanyuma muruhukire musi y’igiti. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Kandi ko mwangiriye ubuntu jewe umusavyi wanyu mugashika iwanje, munkundire ndabazimane, kugira ngo mugire intege zo kubandanya urugendo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Na bo baramwishura bati: “Bikore nk’uko ubivuze.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Nuko Aburahamu yinjira yihuta mw’ihema aho Sara yari ari aramubwira ati: “Nyarutsa ufate ingero seya zitatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 16.</char></note> z’ifu ya mbere nziza, ugire igikandu hanyuma ukore imikate.”<verse eid="GEN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Hanyuma Aburahamu yiruka iyo imikuku yari iri afata inyana nini ivyibushe, ayiha umwe mu bakozi biwe, na we yihutira kuyitegura. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Maze Aburahamu azana amata y’urubu, ay’ifyufyu n’inyama za ya nyana bateguye, abizimana ba bagabo. Bariko bararya, Aburahamu ahagarara hafi yabo musi y’igiti.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Baramubaza bati: “Sara umugore wawe ari he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Na we arabishura ati: “Ari aho mw’ihema.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Maze umwe muri bo aravuga ati: “Nzogaruka iwawe igihe nk’iki umwaka uza, kandi Sara umugore wawe azoba afise umwana w’umuhungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Muri ako kanya, Sara yari mu muryango w’ihema ryari inyuma y’uwariko aravuga yumviriza. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Aburahamu na Sara bari bakuze cane, kandi Sara yari yararengeje imyaka yo kuvyara. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Nuko Sara aratwenga yivugana ati: “Ko ndi akaheze, n’umwami wanje na we akaba ashaje, mbega ivyo vyoba bikindyohera?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza Aburahamu ati: “Ni kuki Sara atwenze akavuga ati: ‘Mbega umutamakazi nkanje noba nkironka umwana?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Mbega hari ikintu kidashobokera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>? Aho nzogarukira igihe nk’iki umwaka uza, Sara azoba afise umwana w’umuhungu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Nuko Sara agira ubwoba, arahakana ati: “Sinatwenze.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Watwenze koko.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aburahamu asengera Sodomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Hanyuma ba bagabo bava aho, bagenda batumbereye i Sodomu. Aburahamu ajana na bo abaherekeje. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aribwira ati: “Mbega noshobora guhisha Aburahamu ico nshaka gukora? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Ehe agiye kuba sekuruza w’ihanga rinini kandi amahanga yose yo kw’isi azohezagirwa biciye kuri we. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Naramuhisemwo kugira ngo arongore abana biwe n’abo mu nzu yiwe n’abazovuka inyuma yiwe, kugira ngo bagendere mu nzira z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bakore ibigororotse kandi bace imanza ziroranye, kugira ngo nzoshitse kuri Aburahamu ivyo namusezeraniye.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Aburahamu ati: “Urwamo rwagiriza Sodomu na Gomora ni rwinshi cane kandi ivyaha vyabo birateye ubwoba. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Manutse kuraba ko ivyo bakoze bijanye n’urwamo rwanshikiriye, biba vyo bitaba vyo, ndabimenya.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Ba bagabo barahindukira bagenda batumbereye i Sodomu, ariko Aburahamu aguma ahagaze imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Aburahamu aramwegera aramubaza ati: “None ugiye kurandurana abagororotsi n’abanyakibi? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Hamwe wosanga hariyo abantu mirongo itanu b’abagororotsi muri kirya gisagara, na ho nyene wokirandura; ntiwogihangaza ku bwabo? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Oya ntiwokora ikintu gisa n’ico; ntiworandura abagororotsi hamwe n’abanyakibi; ngo umugororotsi afatwe co kimwe n’umunyakibi. Ivyo ntibikabe! Mbega Umucamanza w’isi yose ntakwiye gukora ibigororotse?”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Ninasanga hari abagororotsi mirongo itanu i Sodomu, igisagara cose ndagihangaza ku bwabo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Aburahamu arabandanya ati: “Umpangaze, nubahutse kuvugana n’Imana kandi ndi umukungugu n’umunyota. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Mbega hamwe wosanga ari mirongo ine na batanu, badashika mirongo itanu, na ho nyene worandura igisagara cose kubera abo batanu babuze?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arishura ati: “Ninasanga hari abagororotsi mirongo ine na batanu i Sodomu, sindakirandura.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Aburahamu yongera kubaza ati: “Hamwe ho wosanga ari mirongo ine gusa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arishura ati: “Na ho nyene sindakirandura ku bw’abo mirongo ine.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Aburahamu aravuga ati: “Mwami, ndasavye ntunshavurire, umpangaze mvuge. Hamwe ho wosanga ari mirongo itatu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arishura ati: “Sindabikora ninasanga ari mirongo itatu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Aburahamu arabandanya ati: “Umpangaze, nubahutse kuvugana n’Imana kandi. Birashoboka ko wosanga ari mirongo ibiri gusa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Sindakirandura nibaba ari mirongo ibiri.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Ubwa nyuma Aburahamu arabaza ati: “Mwami, ndasavye ntunshavurire, umpangaze mvuge rimwe gusa. Hamwe wosanga hari icumi ho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Ku bw’abo icumi sindakirandura.”<verse eid="GEN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahejeje kuvugana na Aburahamu, abandanya inzira yiwe, Aburahamu na we asubira i muhira iwe.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Imana irandura Sodomu na Gomora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Ba bamarayika bashika i Sodomu ku mugoroba, ico gihe Loti yari yicaye kw’irembo ryinjira mu gisagara ca Sodomu. Ababonye aja kubasanganira, yikubita hasi imbere yabo yubamye, <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />arababwira ati: “Ba nyakwubahwa, ndabinginze muze mwoge ibirenge, murare iwanje, jewe umusavyi wanyu. Ejo mu gitondo muzoheza muvyuke kare mubandanye urugendo rwanyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Na bo baramwishura bati: “Oya, turarara hanze, ku kibuga c’igisagara.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Ariko Loti abandanya abinginga, na bo barateba baremera kujana na we no kurara iwe. Loti abategurira amazimano agizwe n’imikate itarimwo umwambiro, barafungura. <verse eid="GEN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Ariko imbere yo kuja kuryama, abagabo bose bo muri ico gisagara ca Sodomu, abakuze n’abakiri bato, bakikuza inzu ya Loti. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Bahamagara Loti baramubwira bati: “Ba bagabo baza kurara iwawe iri joro bari he? Batuzanire tubasambanye!”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Nuko Loti arasohoka yugara umuryango ahagarara imbere y’inzu. <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />Arababwira ati: “Bavukanyi, ndabinginze ntimukore ikibi nk’ico! <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Mfise abakobwa babiri batarigera baryamana n’umugabo. Reka abe ari bo ndabazanira mubagenze uko mushaka. Ariko ntihagire ico mugira aba bagabo, kuko ni abashitsi banje mbwirizwa kubakingira.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Baramukankamira bati: “Tuve imbere!” Baravuga bati: “Uwu mugabo yaje muri iki gisagara ari umunyamahanga, none raba yigize umucamanza wacu. Ubu rero turagukorera ikibi gisumba ico tubakorera.” Nuko basunikira Loti hirya, begera umuryango ngo bawumene.<verse eid="GEN 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Ba bamarayika babiri bafata Loti ukuboko bamwinjiza mu nzu, bugara umuryango. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Maze bateza uruhumyi ba bagabo bari ku muryango, abakuze n’abato, ku buryo batashobora kubona aho umuryango uri.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Ba bamarayika babaza Loti bati: “Hari abandi bantu ufise hano, baba abakwe, abahungu, abakobwa, canke uwundi muntu w’incuti ufise muri iki gisagara? Basohore bose ubakure muri iki gisagara. <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />Tugira turandure iki gisagara, kuko urwamo rwagiriza abantu baba muri co rwabaye rwinshi cane imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni co gituma yadutumye kukirandura.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Nuko Loti arasohoka aja kubwira abakwe bategura kurongora abakobwa biwe ati: “Nimwihute muve muri iki gisagara kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agiye kukirandura!” Ariko bo babifata nk’aho ariko arafyina.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Mu gitondo kare, ba bamarayika bihutisha Loti bati: “Nyarutsa usohokane n’umugore wawe n’abakobwa bawe babiri muri kumwe kugira ngo ntimurandurwe n’igihano c’ababa muri iki gisagara!”<verse eid="GEN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Loti atanguye gukwega amaguru, ba bamarayika bamufata ukuboko, we n’umugore wiwe n’abakobwa biwe babakwegera inyuma y’igisagara, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amugiriye ubuntu. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Babashikanye hanze y’igisagara, umwe muri ba bamarayika arabihanikiriza ati: “Nimuhunge! Kandi ntimuhindukire canke ngo mugire aho muhagarara muri iki kiyaya. Nimuhungire ku musozi, kugira ngo ntimuranduke.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Loti aravuga ati: “Oya ba nyakwubahwa! <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Jewe umusavyi wanyu nagiriwe ubuntu imbere yanyu kandi mwanyeretse imbabazi nyinshi mu kunkiza. Ariko rero sinohungira ku musozi, kuko ikiza cohava kiza ntarashikayo hanyuma kikampitana. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Murabona karya gasagara ko kari hafi. Ndabasavye mundeke mpungireyo; ntimubona ko ari gato? Harya nohakirira.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Wa mumarayika aramwishura ati: “N’ico na co ndakikwemereye. Karya gasagara sindakarandura. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Ariko ihute uhungireyo kuko ata co nkora utarashikayo.” Ni co gituma ako gasagara bakise Zowari, bisigura “ahantu hato”.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Nuko Loti ashika i Zowari izuba rirashe. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akororera kuri Sodomu na Gomora umuriro n’ibizuku vyaka bivuye mw’ijuru; <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />arandura ivyo bisagara vyose hamwe n’ikiyaya cose, n’abantu bose baba muri ivyo bisagara n’ibiterwa vyose. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Ariko muka Loti arahindukira araba inyuma aca acika inkingi y’umunyu.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Nuko Aburahamu azinduka kare mu gitondo aja muri ca kibanza yahagararamwo imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Maze araba muri ca kiyaya cose atumbereje amaso i Sodomu n’i Gomora abona umwotsi mwinshi upfunduka nk’umwotsi w’itanure.<verse eid="GEN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Ariko igihe Imana yarandura ivyo bisagara, yagumye yibuka ico Aburahamu yayisavye, ikiza Loti ikiza caranduye ivyo bisagara vyo mu kiyaya.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loti n’abakobwa biwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Nuko Loti ava i Zowari kuko yatinya kuhaba, adugana n’abakobwa biwe babiri mu misozi, baja kuba mw’isenga. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Umukuru muri ba bakobwa abwira mutoyi ati: “Urabona ko data ashaje, kandi nta mugabo asigaye muri iki gihugu ngo aturongore nk’uko bigenda ku bandi. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Ingo duhe data umuvinyu tumuboreze, hanyuma turyamane na we kugira ngo turonke uruvyaro biciye kuri we.”<verse eid="GEN 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Nuko baboreza se n’umuvinyu iryo joro, maze umukobwa mukuru arinjira asambana na se. Kubera akaborerwe, Loti ntiyigeze amenya igihe yinjiriye n’igihe yasohokeye.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Umusi ukurikira, umukuru abwira mutoya wiwe ati: “Urabona ko nararanye na data iri joro. Ingo twongere tumuboreze n’iri joro na ryo, maze winjire uryamane na we kugira ngo turonke uruvyaro biciye kuri data.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Nuko bongera kuboreza se n’umuvinyu iryo joro. Wa mukobwa mutoya arinjira aryamana na we. Kubera akaborerwe, Loti ntiyigeze amenya igihe yinjiriye n’igihe yasohokeye.<verse eid="GEN 19:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Nuko ba bakobwa ba Loti uko ari babiri basama inda batewe na se. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Umukuru avyara umwana amwita Mowabu. Ni we sekuruza w’ihanga ryitwa Abanyamowabu gushika uno musi. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Umutoya na we avyara umuhungu amwita Beni-Ami. Ni we sekuruza w’ihanga ryitwa Abamoni gushika uno musi.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Aburahamu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Nuko Aburahamu arunguruza aja mu bumanuko ahitwa Negebu, amara igihe aba hagati y’ahitwa Kadeshi na Shuri, hanyuma yungururiza ahitwa Gerari. Akiba aho nk’umunyamahanga, <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Aburahamu avuga kuri Sara, abwira abaho ati: “Ni mushikanje!” Nuko Abimeleki, umwami w’i Gerari atuma abantu gutora Sara bamujana ku kirimba iwe.<verse eid="GEN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Ariko Imana yiyerekera Abimeleki mu ndoto, iramubwira iti: “Ntugenda udapfuye kubera uwo mugore wazanye, kuko afise umugabo.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Ariko Abimeleki ntiyari bwaryamane na we. Nuko aravuga ati: “Mwami, urashobora kurandura ihanga ata co ryagirizwa? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Si Aburahamu ubwiwe yambwiye ati: ‘Ni mushikanje’? Kandi na we ubwiye yavuze ati: ‘Egome, ni musazanje.’ Ibi nabikoze ata co niyagiriza, kandi nta kibi nakoze.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Imana imwishurira mu ndoto iti: “Egome, ndazi ko wabikoze ata co wiyagiriza, kandi ni jewe nakubujije kuncumurako. Ni co gituma ntakwemereye ko umukorako. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Ubu rero subiza uwo mugore umugabo wiwe, kuko ni uwuvugishwa n’Imana, aca agusengera kugira ngo ntupfe. Ariko nutamusubiza umugore wiwe, umenye neza ko wewe n’abawe bose muzopfa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Nuko Abimeleki avyuka mu gitondo, akoranya abaganwa biwe arabibabwira, na bo bagira ubwoba bwinshi. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Abimeleki ahamagara Aburahamu aramubaza ati: “Ibi wadukoreye ni ibiki? Ni ikihe kibi nagukoreye cotuma unkoresha jewe n’ubwami bwanje icaha kingana gityo? Wakoze ibidakorwa imbere yanje.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Abimeleki abaza Aburahamu ati: “Ni igiki caguteye gukora ivyo?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Aburahamu aramwishura ati: “Nibwiye mu mutima nti: ‘Abantu b’aha hantu ntibatinya Imana. Bazohava banyica kugira ngo batware umugore wanje.’ <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Ariko kandi ni mushikanje, kuko dusangiye data, ariko ntidusangiye mama; uko ni ko yabaye umugore wanje. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Igihe Imana yampamagara ngo mve mu nzu ya Data nkaba ingenzi, namubwiye nti: ‘Ndakwingize uze unyereke urukundo unkunda muri ubu buryo: ahantu hose tuzoja, uze ubwire abaho ko ndi musazawe.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Nuko Abimeleki afata intama, impene n’inka, abagurano b’abagabo n’abagore abiha Aburahamu, amusubiza na Sara umugore wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Abimeleki aramubwira ati: “Igihugu canje kiri imbere yawe; hitamwo aho ushaka kuba.”<verse eid="GEN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Abwira Sara ati: “Musazawe ndamuhaye shekeli igihumbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibiro 12.</char></note> z’ifeza. Ni ikimenyetso c’uko ata co wagirizwa imbere y’abari kumwe nawe bose. Kandi usubijwe iteka ryawe imbere ya bose.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Nuko Aburahamu asenga Imana, na yo ikiza Abimeleki, umugore wiwe n’abagurano b’abagore biwe kugira ngo bashobore kuvyara, <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yamaze gutuma abagore bose bo mu nzu ya Abimeleki baba ingumba ku bwa Sara, umugore wa Aburahamu.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ivuka rya Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Umusi umwe, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yibuka Sara, amukorera ico yari yaramusezeraniye. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Sara atwara inda, avyarana na Aburahamu umwana w’umuhungu mu butama bwiwe. Ivyo vyashitse igihe Imana yari yaravuze ko bizoberako. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Uwo mwana Aburahamu yavyaye kuri Sara amwita Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Haheze imisi umunani Isaka avutse, Aburahamu aramukeba, nk’uko Imana yari yaramutegetse. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Aburahamu yari amaze imyaka ijana igihe Isaka yavuka.<verse eid="GEN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Sara aravuga ati: “Imana irantwengeje. Umuntu wese azovyumva azotwengana nanje.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Yongerako ati: “Ni nde yobwiye Aburahamu ko Sara azokwonsa umwana? None raba ndamuvyariye umuhungu mu butama bwiwe!”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hagari na Ishimayeli birukanwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Nuko Isaka arakura hanyuma Sara aramucutsa. Umusi yacukiyeko, Aburahamu ategura umusi mukuru ukomeye. <verse eid="GEN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Ariko Sara abonye Ishimayeli wa muhungu Aburahamu yavyara kuri Hagari Umunyegiputakazi ariko arakina na Isaka umwana wiwe, <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />aca abwira Aburahamu ati: “Irukana urya muguranokazi n’umuhungu wiwe. Umuhungu w’uwo muguranokazi ntazosangira iragi n’umwana wanje Isaka.”<verse eid="GEN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Ivyo bibabaza Aburahamu cane kuko Ishimayeli na we yari umwana wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Ariko Imana ibwira Aburahamu iti: “Ntubabazwe n’ivy’urya mwana n’umuguranokazi wawe. Kora ivyo Sara akubwira vyose, kuko uruvyaro rwawe uzoruronka biciye muri Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Ariko uruvyaro rw’umuhungu w’incoreke yawe na rwo nzorugira ihanga, kuko na we ni umwana wawe.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Bukeye, Aburahamu avyuka kare mu gitondo, ategura ivyokurya n’umukuza w’urusato wuzuye amazi abiha Hagari. Yongera afata wa mwana amushira ku mugongo wa Hagari, aramurungika. Hagari aca afata inzira, agenda arayerera mu bugaragwa bwa Berisheba.<verse eid="GEN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Ya mazi yari mu mukuza w’urusato aheze, aca afata umwana amushira mu gitutu musi y’agasaka, <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />na we aragenda yicara hirya, nk’ahoshika umwampi urashwe, kuko yavuga ati: “Sinshaka kubona umwana wanje apfa.” Ni ko kwicara hirya maze araturika ararira.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Ariko Imana yumva ijwi rya wa mwana arira, hanyuma umumarayika w’Imana ahamagara Hagari ari mw’ijuru ati: “Ubaye iki ga Hagari? Ntutinye! Imana yumvise ijwi ry’urya mwana aririra aho ari. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Subira aho ari umuhagurutse, hanyuma umufate ukuboko, kuko uruvyaro rwiwe nzorugira ihanga rikomeye.”<verse eid="GEN 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Nuko Imana yugurura amaso ya Hagari, abona iriba ry’amazi. Aca aragenda yuzuza wa mukuza w’urusato amazi, aha umwana wiwe amazi yo kunywa.<verse eid="GEN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Nuko Imana ibana na we mu gukura kwiwe, aba umuhinga mu kurasisha umuheto. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Yaba mu bugaragwa bw’i Parani, maze nyina amuronderera umugore ava muri Egiputa.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amasezerano y’i Berisheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Muri ico gihe Abimeleki ajana na Pikoli, umukuru w’ingabo ziwe, abwira Aburahamu ati: “Biragaragara ko Imana iri kumwe nawe mu vyo ukora vyose. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Ubu rero ndashaka undahire mw’izina ry’Imana ko utazokwigera umpemukira, jewe, abana banje canke uruvyaro rwanje; ko uzonyereka ubuntu, jewe n’iki gihugu wabayemwo uri umunyamahanga, nk’uko nanje nakweretse ubuntu.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Aburahamu aramwishura ati: “Ndakurahiye.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Hanyuma Aburahamu yidoga ari kumwe na Abimeleki ku bijanye n’iriba abakozi ba Abimeleki bari baramutwaye ku nguvu. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimeleki aravuga ati: “Sinzi uwabikoze. Wewe nta co wabimbwiyeko, ndavyumvise uno musi.”<verse eid="GEN 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Nuko Aburahamu aha Abimeleki intama, impene n’inka; bagirana amasezerano. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Aburahamu atoranya kandi intama zivyara indwi mu mukuku wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimeleki aramubaza ati: “Ni kuki utoranije izo ntama mu zindi?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Aburahamu aramwishura ati: “Ndakwinginze wakire izi ntama indwi nk’ikimenyetso c’uko ari jewe nimvye iryo riba.”<verse eid="GEN 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Ni co gituma aho hantu hitwa Berisheba, bisigura “iriba ry’indahiro”, kuko ari ho barahiriye uko ari babiri.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Bahejeje kugiranira amasezerano i Berisheba, Abimeleki na Pikoli, umukuru w’ingabo ziwe, baragenda basubira mu gihugu c’Abafilisitiya. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Nuko Aburahamu atera igiti citwa tamarisi i Berisheba, ahasengera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana yamaho. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Aburahamu amara igihe kirekire aba muri ico gihugu c’Abafilisitiya.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s1">Aburahamu ageragezwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Haheze igihe, Imana igerageza ukwizera kwa Aburahamu. Iramuhamagara iti: “Aburahamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Na we ati: “Sabwe.”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Imana iti: “Jana umuhungu wawe, umuhungu wawe w’ikinege Isaka ukunda cane, uje mu ntara ya Moriya, hanyuma umutange nk’ikimazi gituriwe ku musozi nzokwereka.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Mu gitondo c’umusi ukurikira, Aburahamu avyuka kare, ategura indogoba yiwe, ajana babiri mu bakozi biwe, hamwe n’umuhungu wiwe Isaka. Ahejeje kwegeranya inkwi zikwiye zo guturira ikimazi, afata inzira ija aho Imana yari yamubwiye. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Ku musi ugira gatatu ari ku rugendo, Aburahamu arunamuka abona wa musozi agiyeko ukiri kure yiwe. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Aburahamu abwira ba bakozi biwe ati: “Nimugume hano n’iyi ndogoba. Jewe n’umuhungu wanje turabandanije hariya imbere. Tugiye gusenga, duhejeje duca tugaruka.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Aburahamu ashira za nkwi zo guturira ikimazi ku rutugu rwa Isaka umuhungu wiwe, na we afata umuriro n’imbugita, babandanya urugendo ari babiri. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isaka abwira se Aburahamu ati: “Data!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Na we ati: “Mbwira mwana wanje!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isaka aravuga ati: “Umuriro n’inkwi turabifise, none intama yo gutangako ikimazi iri he?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Aburahamu aramwishura ati: “Imana iraja kwironkera intama yo gutangako ikimazi, mwana wanje.” Nuko barabandanya.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Bashitse mu kibanza Imana yamubwiye, Aburahamu yubaka igicaniro, agishirako za nkwi. Hanyuma afata Isaka umuhungu wiwe aramuboha, amuryamika kuri ca gicaniro hejuru ya za nkwi. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Hanyuma agorora ukuboko atora imbugita kugira ngo akerere umuhungu wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Ariko umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amuhamagara ari mw’ijuru ati: “Aburahamu! Aburahamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Na we ati: “Sabwe!”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Aramubwira ati: “Ntugire ico ugira uwo mwana canke ngo umukomeretse, kuko ubu ndabonye neza ko wubaha Imana, kuko ntiwanyimye n’umwana wawe, kandi ari ikinege.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Aburahamu yunamutse abona impfizi y’intama ifashwe amahembe mu gisaka. Nuko afata iyo ntama ayitangako ikimazi mu kibanza c’umuhungu wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Aburahamu yita aho hantu “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azovyizanira”. Gushika n’uno musi abantu baracavuga bati: “Ku musozi w’Imana, iravyizanira.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Wa mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahamagara Aburahamu ubugira kabiri ari mw’ijuru, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />aramubwira ati: “Indahiro ni jewe nyene, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ko wanyumviye ntunyime umwana wawe kandi ari ikinege, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />nzoguhezagira vy’ukuri kandi nzogwiza uruvyaro rwawe nk’inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru canke nk’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga. Bazokwigarurira ibisagara vy’abansi babo, <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />kandi amahanga yose yo kw’isi azohezagirwa biciye ku ruvyaro rwawe, kuko wanyumviye.”<verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Nuko Aburahamu asubira hamwe yasiga ba bakozi biwe, basubirana i Berisheba, aho Aburahamu yabandanije aba.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uruvyaro rwa Nahori</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Aburahamu yumva ko Milika, umugore wa murumunawe Nahori, yamuvyariye abahungu.<verse eid="GEN 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Umukuru yitwa Uzi, uwa kabiri akitwa Buzi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 22:21">bagakurikirwa n’uwitwa Kemuweli, ari we se wa Aramu,<verse eid="GEN 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kesedi, Hazo, Piludasho, Yidalafu na Betuweli.<verse eid="GEN 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betuweli ni we yavyaye Rebeka.</para>
  <para style="lf" vid="GEN 22:23">Abo ni bo bahungu umunani Milika yavyaranye na Nahori, murumuna wa Aburahamu.<verse eid="GEN 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Incoreke ya Nahori yitwa Reyuma na we yari yamuvyariye abahungu ari bo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 22:24">Teba, Gahamu, Tahashi na Mayaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sara yabayeho imyaka ijana na mirongo ibiri n’indwi, <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />hanyuma apfira i Kiriyati-Araba, ari ho Heburoni, mu gihugu c’i Kanani. Aho ni ho Aburahamu yamugandaririye, aramuririra.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Hanyuma Aburahamu ava hambavu y’ikiziga c’umugore wiwe, aja kuvugana n’abakuru b’Abaheti. <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />Arababwira ati: “Murazi ko ndi umunyamahanga na kavantara muri mwebwe. Ndabasavye mumpe ikibanza co guhambamwo kugira ngo mpambane iteka umugore wanje.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Abaheti bishura Aburahamu bati: <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Nyakwubahwa, twumvirize. Wewe Imana yakugize umuganwa ahambaye muri twebwe. Hitamwo aho guhamba haruta ahandi abe ari ho umuhamba. Nta muntu n’umwe muri twebwe yokwima aho uhamba umuntu wawe.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Aburahamu arahaguruka yunamira Abaheti baba muri ico gihugu. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Arababwira ati: “Ko munyemereye ko mpamba umugore wanje, ndabasavye munsabire Efuroni mwene Zohari, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />anyemerere ndamugurire isenga afise i Makapela, aho itongo ryiwe rigarukira. Ndahamugurira ku giciro bikwiranye mwese mukoranye, maze aho hantu hambere ikibanza co guhambamwo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Uwo Efuroni yari yicaye aho mu bandi Baheti. Nuko yishura Aburahamu, abandi Baheti bose bari bakoraniye kw’irembo ry’igisagara bumva, ati: <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Oya nyakwubahwa, nyumviriza neza. Ndakugabiye rirya tongo n’isenga riri muri ryo. Imbere y’aba bantu bo mu bwoko bwanje ndahaguyaye. Genda uhambe uwawe.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Aburahamu yongera yunamira abantu bo muri ico gihugu, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />abwira Efuroni bose bumva ati: “Ndakwinginze nanje unyumvirize. Nyemerera ndaguhe igiciro bikwiranye na rirya tongo, kugira ngo nshobore guhamba umuntu wanje.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efuroni yishura Aburahamu ati: <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Nyakwubahwa, nyumviriza neza. Rirya tongo riciye shekeli amajana ane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 4.6</char></note> z’ifeza. None ayo mahera amaze iki hagati yanje nawe? Genda uhambe uwawe.”<verse eid="GEN 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Nuko Aburahamu yemera igiciro Efuroni amubwiye, amuharurira za shekeli amajana ane z’ifeza abakuru b’Abaheti bose babona.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Uko ni ko Aburahamu yaguriye itongo Efuroni i Makapela, hafi y’i Mamure. Aho yaguze hari hagizwe n’itongo, isenga n’ibiti vyari muri ryo. <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Iryo tongo ryegukira Aburahamu imbere y’Abaheti bose bari bakoraniye kw’irembo ry’igisagara. <verse eid="GEN 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Nuko Aburahamu ahamba Sara umugore wiwe aho mw’isenga ry’i Makapela, hafi y’i Mamure (ari ho Heburoni), mu gihugu c’i Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Uko ni ko Aburahamu yahawe n’Abaheti iryo tongo n’iryo senga biba ivyiwe burundu nk’ikibanza co guhambamwo.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s1">Isaka na Rebeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Ico gihe Aburahamu yari ashaje, ageze mu zabukuru, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaramuhezagiye mu buryo bwose. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Umusi umwe, Aburahamu abwira umukuru mu bakozi biwe, ari we yaraba ivy’urugo rwiwe, ati: “Shira ukuboko kwawe musi y’itako ryanje, <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />uheze undahire mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’ijuru n’isi, ko utazoronderera umuhungu wanje umugore mu bakobwa b’Abanyakanani, abo mbayemwo. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Ariko uze ugende mu gihugu canje, mu ncuti zanje, abe ari ho ukura umugore wa Isaka umwana wanje.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Wa mukozi aramubaza ati: “Nshobora kutaronka umukobwa ashaka kunkurikira ngo tuzanane muri iki gihugu. None nzoca njana umuhungu wawe Isaka mu guhugu waje uvamwo?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Aburahamu aramwishura ati: “Oya! Uze wirinde gusubiza Isaka muri kiriya gihugu! <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana yo mw’ijuru, we yankuye mu nzu kwa data no mu gihugu canje c’amavukiro, yarambwiye arandahira ko azogabira uruvyaro rwanje iki gihugu. Azorungika umumarayika imbere yawe, kugira ngo ushobore kuronkera umuhungu wanje umugore. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Uwo mukobwa niyanka kugarukana nawe, iyi ndahiro ugira urahire ntizogufata. Ariko uze wirinde kujana umuhungu wanje muri kiriya gihugu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Nuko wa mukozi ashira ukuboko musi y’itako rya shebuja Aburahamu, aramurahira ko azobigenza uko.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Hanyuma afata ingamiya icumi mu za shebuja, atangura urugendo, agenda ajanye n’ingabire zitandukanye z’agaciro ahawe na shebuja, afata inzira ija ahitwa Aramu-Naharayimu, yerekeye mu gisagara Nahori murumuna wa Aburahamu yabamwo. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Ashitse kw’iriba ryari inyuma y’igisagara, apfukamika ingamiya ziwe kugira ngo zinywe amazi. Ico gihe yari amasaha abagore bazirako kuvoma.<verse eid="GEN 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Arasenga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Mana ya databuja Aburahamu, ndakwinginze umpe kuroranirwa uwu musi. Niwereke databuja Aburahamu urukundo rwawe rudahemuka. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Mpagaze hano hambavu y’iri riba, kandi abakobwa bo mu gisagara bagira baze kuvoma. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Umukobwa nja kubwira nti: ‘Ndakwinginze uhengeke umubindi wawe, umpe amazi yo kunywa,’ na we akavuga ati: ‘Ehe nunywe kandi n’ingamiya zawe nca ndazivomera,’ uwo abe ari we watoranirije umusavyi wawe Isaka. Ico ni co kiza kunyereka ko wagiriye databuja urukundo rudahemuka.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Ataraheza gusenga, haseruka inkumi yitwa Rebeka n’umubindi wiwe ku rutugu. Rebeka yari umukobwa wa Betuweli, uwo na we akaba yari umuhungu wa Nahori, murumuna wa Aburahamu, uwo yavyaranye n’umugore wiwe Milika. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Rebeka yari inkumi y’akaranga kandi ntiyari bwaryamane n’umugabo. Nuko aramanuka kw’iriba, yuzuza wa mubindi amazi, aca araduga.<verse eid="GEN 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Wa mukozi wa Aburahamu ariruka aja guhura na we, aramubwira ati: “Ndakwinginze umpe amazi yo kunywa kuri uwo mubindi wawe.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Na we aramwishura ati: “Akira unywe, nyakwubahwa.” Nuko anyarutsa kwururutsa umubindi wiwe, kugira ngo ashobore kunywa.<verse eid="GEN 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Ahejeje kumuha amazi yo kunywa aramubwira ati: “Ngira mvomere n’ingamiya zawe na zo zinywe zihere inyota.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Nuko asuka ya mazi mu bwato ibitungwa vyanyweramwo amazi, asubira kw’iriba yiruka, avomera za ngamiya ziwe zose. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Wa mukozi wa Aburahamu yitegereza ya nkumi mu gacerere, kugira ngo arabe ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahezagiye urugendo rwiwe.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Za ngamiya zihejeje kunywa, wa mugabo aha wa mukobwa ihereni ry’inzahabu bambara ku zuru ripima ingero beka imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 5,7.</char></note> hamwe n’ibikomo bibiri vy’inzahabu vyo kwambara ku maboko bipima shekeli icumi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 115.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Aramubaza ati: “Mbega uri umukobwa wa nde? Ndakwinginze umbwire. Mu rugo kwa so hoba hariho aho kuturaza jewe n’abantu twagendanye?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Na we aramwishura ati: “Ndi umukobwa wa Betuweli, uwo Milika yavyaranye na Nahori.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Yongerako ati: “Egome iwacu hariho ivyatsi vyumye n’ivyokurya vy’izo ngamiya, kandi hariho n’aho kuraza abashitsi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Nuko wa mugabo arunama ahimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Aravuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya databuja Aburahamu, aragahezagirwa, we atibagiye kugirira databuja urukundo rudahemuka n’ubwizigirwa. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yandongoreye mu ncuti za databuja.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Nuko wa mukobwa ariruka aja i muhira kubabwira ibibaye vyose. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Rebeka yari afise musazawe yitwa Labani. Nuko Labani aca ariruka aja kuraba uwo mugabo kw’iriba. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Yari yamaze kubona rya hereni ryo ku zuru na vya bikomo mushikiwe yambaye ku maboko, kandi yari yumvise Rebeka avuga ivyo uwo mugabo yamubwiye. Nuko aja iyo wa mugabo ari, asanga ari kumwe n’ingamiya ziwe hambavu y’iriba. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Labani abwira wa mugabo ati: “Kaze iwacu, wewe uwahezagiwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ni kuki woguma inyuma y’igisagara kandi namaze gutegura inzu n’aho kuraza ingamiya?”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Nuko wa mugabo ashika mu rugo; Labani yururutsa ivyo ingamiya zari zikoreye, arazisasira kandi arazigaburira. Azanira amazi wa mukozi wa Aburahamu n’abari bagendanye na we kugira ngo boge ibirenge. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Bamuzaniye ivyokurya, wa mukozi wa Aburahamu aravuga ati: “Sinshobora kugira ico mfunguye ntaravuga ikingenza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Labani ati: “Tubwire.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Aravuga ati: “Ndi umukozi wa Aburahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarahezagiye cane databuja, aba umuntu akomeye cane. Yamuhaye imikuku y’intama n’impene, amasho y’inka, ubutunzi bw’ifeza n’inzahabu, abakozi b’abahungu n’abakobwa hamwe n’ingamiya n’indogoba. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Kandi Sara umugore wa databuja yamuvyariye umuhungu mu busaza bwiwe. Uwo muhungu ni we databuja yaraze ivyiwe vyose. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Databuja yarandahije avuga ati: ‘Ntuze uronderere umuhungu wanje umugore mu bakobwa b’Abanyakanani, abo mbayemwo. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Ariko uze ugende mu bo mu nzu ya data, mu bo mu bwoko bwanje, abe ari ho ukura umugore w’umwana wanje.’<verse eid="GEN 24:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Nanje mbwira databuja nti: ‘Nshobora kutaronka umukobwa ashaka gusubirana inyuma nanje.’<verse eid="GEN 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Aranyishura ati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> namye numvira, azorungika umumarayika wiwe ajane nawe atume ugira umugisha mu rugendo rwawe, kugira ngo ushobore kuronkera umuhungu wanje umugore wo mu muryango wanje, wo mu nzu ya data. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Niwaja mu bo mu muryango wanje, iyi ndahiro nkurahije ntizogufata; naho bokwanka kuguha uwo mukobwa, iyi ndahiro nkurahije ntize igufate.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />Uno musi igihe nashika kw’iriba nasenze nti: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Mana ya databuja Aburahamu, ndakwinginze umpe kugira umugisha muri uru rugendo. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Raba mpagaze hambavu y’iri riba. Nihaza umukobwa kuvoma nkamubwira nti: “Ndakwinginze umpe amazi yo kunywa muri uwo mu bindi wawe,” <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />na we akambwira ati: “Ehe nunywe kandi nca mvomera n’ingamiya zawe na zo,” uwo aze abe ari we <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatoranirije kuba umugore w’umuhungu wa databuja.’<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Ntaraheza gusengera mu mutima wanje, nabonye Rebeka aseruka n’umubindi wiwe ku rutugu, aramanuka aja kw’iriba aravoma amazi. Maze ndamubwira nti: ‘Ndakwinginze umpe amazi yo kunywa.’<verse eid="GEN 24:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Yaciye anyarutsa kwururutsa umubindi wiwe wari ku rutugu, aravuga ati: ‘Ehe nunywe kandi nca mvomera n’ingamiya zawe na zo.’ Nuko ndanywa, hanyuma avomera n’ingamiya.<verse eid="GEN 24:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Maze ndamubaza nti: ‘Uri umukobwa wa nde?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">Na we arambwira ati: ‘Ndi umukobwa wa Betuweli, umuhungu Nahori yavyaranye na Milika.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">Nuko nca ndamwambika ihereni ku zuru n’ibikomo ku maboko, <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />maze nca ndapfukama mpimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nshima <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya databuja Aburahamu kuko yandongoreye mu nzira nziza, ku mukobwa w’incuti yiwe kugira ngo abere umuhungu wa databuja umugore. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />None, nimba mwiteguye kugirira ineza databuja no kumwereka ubwizigirwa, ndabasavye mumbwire, kandi nimba bitari uko na ho nyene mubimbwire, kugira ngo nje kuronderera ahandi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Nuko Labani na Betuweli baramwishura bati: “Ibi bintu vyavuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni co gituma ata co dushobora kwongerako. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Rebeka ari hano, numujane abe umugore w’umuhungu wa shobuja, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabivuze.”<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Wa mukozi wa Aburahamu yumvise inyishu yabo, arapfukama ahimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Hanyuma asokorora ivyo gushaza vy’inzahabu n’ifeza hamwe n’impuzu abiha Rebeka. Yongera aha ingabire musazawe na nyina. <verse eid="GEN 24:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Hanyuma we na ba bagabo bagendana bararya bongera baranywa, maze barara aho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:54">Bavyutse mu gitondo, aravuga ati: “Nimundeke nsubire kwa databuja.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Musaza wa Rebeka na nyina wiwe baramwishura bati: “Turashaka ko Rebeka agumana natwe akanya, nk’imisi icumi, hanyuma azoheza agende.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Ariko arababwira ati: “Ntimuntevye kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yampaye kugira umugisha mu rugendo rwanje. Nimundekure ngende nsubire kwa databuja.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Baravuga bati: “Hinge duhamagare Rebeka tumubaze ico yiyumvira.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Nuko bahamagara Rebeka baramubaza bati: “Urashaka kujana n’uwu mugabo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Arabishura ati: “Egome ndabishaka.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Nuko basezera Rebeka n’incoreke yamureze babarungikana na wa mukozi wa Aburahamu n’abagendanye na we. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Bahezagira Rebeka bamubwira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">“Mushiki wacu, uze urondoke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">uvyare ibihumbi n’ibihumbi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">uruvyaro rwawe ruze rwigarurire</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">ibisagara vy’abansi bawe.”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Nuko Rebeka n’incoreke ziwe burira kuri za ngamiya basubirana inyuma na wa mugabo. Uko ni ko wa mukozi wa Aburahamu yajanye Rebeka.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Ico gihe Isaka yari yamaze kuva i Beyeri-Lahayi-Royi aja kuba i Negebu, mu bumanuko bw’i Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Umugoroba umwe Isaka aja kugendagenda mu mirima. Yunamuye amaso, abona ingamiya ziza zitumbereye iyo ari. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Rebeka yunamutse akabona Isaka, aca arururuka ava ku ngamiya. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />Abaza wa mukozi wa Aburahamu ati: “Uriya muntu agendagenda mu mirima ariko araza ngo duhure ni nde?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Aramwishura ati: “Ni databuja.” Nuko Rebeka afata igitambara aritwikira.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Wa mukozi abwira Isaka ivyo yakoze vyose. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Isaka ajana Rebeka mw’ihema. Iryo hema ryahora ari irya nyina Sara. Nuko amugira umugore wiwe kandi aramukunda cane. Uko ni ko Isaka yashoboye kwirurwa umubabaro yari yaratewe n’urupfu rwa nyina.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s1">Aburahamu avyara abandi bana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Hanyuma Aburahamu arongora uwundi mugore yitwa Ketura, <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />bavyarana Zimurani, Yokishani, Medani, Midiyani, Ishibaki na Shuwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokishani na we avyara Sheba na Dedani. Abakomotse kuri Dedani ni Abashuri, Abaletushi n’Abaleyuli. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Bene Midiyani ni Efa, Eferi, Hanoki, Abida na Eludaya. Urwo ni rwo ruvyaro Aburahamu yavyaranye na Ketura.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Nuko Aburahamu araga Isaka ivyo yari afise vyose. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Ariko imbere y’uko apfa, agabira abahungu yavyaye ku ncoreke ziwe, aca abarungika mu gihugu co mu buseruko kugira ngo abatandukanye na Isaka umuhungu wiwe.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Aburahamu yapfuye amaze imyaka ijana na mirongo indwi n’itanu. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Nuko aracikana, apfa yisaziye neza, ageze mu zabukuru; ahamvya ba sekuruza. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Abahungu biwe Isaka na Ishimayeli bamuhamba mw’isenga ry’i Makapela hafi y’i Mamure, mw’itongo rya Efuroni mwene Zohari Umuheti. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Iryo tongo Aburahamu yari yariguriye Abaheti. Aho ni ho Aburahamu yahambwe hamwe na Sara umugore wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Aburahamu amaze gupfa, Imana ihezagira Isaka umuhungu wiwe, kandi yaba hafi y’iriba rya Beyeri-Lahayi-Royi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uruvyaro rwa Ishimayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Uru ni rwo rukurikirane rw’abakomoka kuri Ishimayeli umuhungu Aburahamu yavyaye kuri Hagari, incoreke ya Sara y’Umunyegiputakazi.<verse eid="GEN 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Aya ni yo mazina y’abahungu ba Ishimayeli, nk’uko bakurikirana:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 25:13" />
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 25:13">imfura yiwe ni Nebayoti,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 25:13">hagakurikira Kedari, Adibeyeli, Mibusamu,<verse eid="GEN 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishima, Duma, Masa,<verse eid="GEN 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadadi, Tema, Yeturi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 25:15">Nafishi na Kedema.<verse eid="GEN 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Aba ni bo bahungu icumi na babiri ba Ishimayeli. Umwe wese yabaye umukuru w’umuryango witirirwa izina ryiwe kandi aho babaye n’aho bacumbitse hitirirwa amazina yabo.<verse eid="GEN 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ishimayeli yamaze imyaka ijana na mirongo itatu n’indwi, hanyuma aracikana ahamvya ba sekuruza. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Abakomotse kuri Ishimayeli babaye mu karere kava i Havila gushika i Shuri, mu buseruko bwa Egiputa utumbereye ahitwa Ashuri. Kandi babana nabi n’incuti zabo.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo na Esawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Uru ni rwo rukurikirane rw’abakomoka kuri Isaka, umuhungu wa Aburahamu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 25:19" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:19">Aburahamu yavyaye Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Isaka amaze imyaka mirongo ine, arongora Rebeka, umukobwa wa Betuweli Umwaramu w’i Padani-Aramu, akaba na mushiki wa Labani Umwaramu.<verse eid="GEN 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Nuko Isaka asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku bw’umugore wiwe, kuko yari ingumba. Imana yishura isengesho rya Isaka, maze Rebeka asama inda y’amahasa. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Kubera ko abo bana baguma bagwanira mu nda yiwe, Rebeka aja kubaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Ni kuki ibi binshikiye?”<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramubwira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">“Mu nda yawe hari amahanga abiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">uzovyara ubwoko bubiri bwankana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">bumwe buzoba ubukomeye kurusha ubundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">kandi bukuru azokorera butoyi.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Hageze kuvyara, Rebeka asanga afise inda y’amahasa. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Uwavutse ubwa mbere yaratukura kandi umubiri wiwe wari wuzuye ubwoya nk’impuzu y’ubwoya, baca bamwita Esawu. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Uwa kabiri yavutse ikiganza ciwe gifashe igitsintsiri ca Esawu; na we bamwita Yakobo. Igihe bavuka, Isaka yari amaze imyaka mirongo itandatu.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Abo bahungu bamaze gukura, Esawu aba umuhigi w’umuhinga kandi yakunda kugendagenda mu gahinga. Ariko Yakobo yari umuntu atekereje yakunda kuguma i muhira mu mahema. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Isaka yakunda Esawu kuko yakunda inyama yamuzanira avuye guhiga, ariko Rebeka yakunda Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Umusi umwe, Yakobo yariko arateka isupu, hanyuma Esawu ashika i muhira avuye mu gahinga, arushe cane kandi ashonje. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Esawu abwira Yakobo ati: “Ndakwinginze umpe kuri iyo supu yawe itukura, kuko ngira mpfe n’inzara!” Ni co gituma Esawu yiswe Edomu, bisigura “gutukura”.<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobo aramubwira ati: “Banza umpebere uburenganzira bwawe bwo kuba samuragwa.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esawu ati: “None ko ngira mpfe, ukwo kuba samuragwa kumariye iki ubu?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakobo ati: “Banza undahire.” Nuko Esawu arahira Yakobo ko amuhebeye uburenganzira kwo kuba samuragwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Nuko Yakobo aha Esawu umukate na ya supu y’inkore, na we ararya arongera aranywa, hanyuma arahaguruka arigira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:34">Uko ni ko Esawu yahaye agaciro gato uburenganzira bwo kuba samuragwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s1">Isaka na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Inyuma y’aho hatera inzara mu gihugu, nk’uko vyari vyarabaye mu gihe ca Aburahamu. Isaka aca aja kuba i Gerari, mu gihugu ca Abimeleki, umwami w’Abafilisitiya. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yiyereka Isaka amubwira ati: “Ntuje muri Egiputa, ahubwo uze ube mu gihugu nzokwereka. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Guma muri iki gihugu, nzobana nawe ndaguhezagire. Wewe n’uruvyaro rwawe nzobaha iki gihugu, kandi nzoshitsa indahiro narahiye so Aburahamu. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Uruvyaro rwawe nzorugwiza rungane n’inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru, kandi nzobaha iki gihugu cose kibe icabo. Mbere amahanga yose yo mw’isi azohezagirwa biciye ku ruvyaro rwawe. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Ibi nzobikora kuko Aburahamu yanyumviye akitondera ivyo namwihanikirije, amabwirizwa yanje, ivyo nashinze n’ivyagezwe vyanje.” <verse eid="GEN 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Nuko Isaka agerera i Gerari.<verse eid="GEN 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Ababa muri ico gihugu babajije Isaka ku bijanye n’umugore wiwe Rebeka, ababwira ati: “Ni mushikanje”; kuko yaratinya kuvuga ko ari umugore wiwe, yibwira ati: “Bazonyica banziza Rebeka, kuko ari mwiza cane.”<verse eid="GEN 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Ariko haheze igihe Isaka aba aho hantu, Abimeleki umwami w’Abafilisitiya arabira mw’idirisha maze abona Isaka ariko arakuyakuya Rebeka umugore wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimeleki ahamagara Isaka aramubwira ati: “Ni ivy’ukuri Rebeka ni umugore wawe! Ni kuki wavuze ko ari mushikawe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Isaka aramwishura ati: “Nabivuze kuko natinya gupfa ndamuzira.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abimeleki aramubaza ati: “Ibi wadukoreye ni ibiki? Hari hasigaye gato ngo umwe mu bantu banje asambane na we, kandi ivyo vyotumye duharurwako icaha.”<verse eid="GEN 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Nuko Abimeleki agabisha abantu bose, arababwira ati: “Umuntu azogira ikibi akorera uwu mugabo canke umugore wiwe, azokwicwa!”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Nuko Isaka atera imbuto mu mirima yo muri ico gihugu, maze uwo mwaka, yimbura incuro ijana ivyo yari yateye, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amuhezagiye. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Ivyiwe bibandanya vyongerekana, aba umutunzi akomeye. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Yari afise imikuku myinshi y’intama n’impene, amasho menshi y’inka n’abakozi benshi ku buryo Abafilisitiya bamugirira ishari. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Nuko Abafilisitiya buzuza ibivu amariba y’amazi ya Yakobo yose. Ayo yari amariba yari yimbwe n’abakozi ba se Aburahamu.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Abimeleki abwira Isaka ati: “Va mu gihugu cacu, kuko wabaye uwukomeye kuturuta.”<verse eid="GEN 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Nuko Isaka arimuka, ashinga amahema mu kiyaya ca Gerari aba ari ho aba. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Asubira gusibura amariba yari yarimbwe mu gihe ca se Aburahamu, ayo Abafilisitiya bari barasibije se amaze gupfa, yongera ayita amazina se yari yarayise.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Umusi umwe abakozi ba Isaka bariko barimba iriba mu kiyaya, baseruka kw’isoko ry’amazi meza cane. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Ariko abungere b’i Gerari baraza baharira n’abungere ba Isaka bavuga bati: “Aya mazi ni ayacu.” Iryo riba Isaka aryita Eseke, bisigura “imitongano”, kuko abo bungere batonganye na we. <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Abakozi ba Isaka bongera bimba irindi riba, ariko na ryo nyene rituma haba imitongano. Iryo riba na ryo Isaka aryita Sitina, bisigura “urwanko”. <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Aho na ho arahava aja kwimba irindi riba. Maze iryo ntiryatera amatati, aca aryita Rehoboti, bisigura “ikibanza c’umwidegemvyo”. Aravuga ati: “Ubu rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aduhaye kwagukirwa, kandi tugiye gutungira muri iki gihugu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Hanyuma Isaka ava aho hantu aja i Berisheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amwiyereka mw’ijoro yashikiyemwo aho hantu, aramubwira ati: “Ndi Imana ya so Aburahamu, ntutinye kuko ndi kumwe nawe kandi nzoguhezagira, ngwize uruvyaro rwawe kubera urukundo nakunze Aburahamu umusavyi wanje.”<verse eid="GEN 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Maze Isaka yubaka aho hantu igicaniro ahasengera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Yongera ahubaka amahema, maze abakozi biwe bahimba iriba.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Umusi umwe, Abimeleki ava i Gerari aja kuraba Isaka, ari kumwe n’umuhanuzi wiwe Ahuzati na Pikoli, umukuru w’abasoda biwe. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Isaka arababaza ati: “Ni kuki mwaje kundaba kandi munyanka, mukaba mwarananyirukanye mu gihugu canyu?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Baramwishura bati: “Twarabonye neza ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe nawe. Ni co gituma twiyumviriye ko dukwiye kugiriranira amasezerano nawe yubakiye ku ndahiro hagati ya twe nawe. <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />Uturahire ko utazokwigera utugirira nabi, nk’uko natwe tutigeze tugukorera ikibi. Twagukoreye ivyiza, maze tukurungika amahoro. None biraboneka ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaguhezagiye.”<verse eid="GEN 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Nuko Isaka abategurira umusi mukuru, bararya baranywa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Mu gitondo kare, abo bagabo baca bahana indahiro. Nuko Isaka arabasezera, bagenda amahoro.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Uwo musi abakozi ba Isaka baza bamuzaniye inkuru z’iriba bari bimvye, baramubwira bati: “Twaronse amazi!” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Iryo riba Isaka aryita Shiba, bisigura “indahiro”. Ni co gituma gushika n’uno musi igisagara cubatswe aho hantu citwa Berisheba, bisigura “iriba ry’indahiro”.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukurongora kwa Esawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esawu amaze imyaka mirongo ine, arongora abagore b’Abahetikazi babiri: Yudita umukobwa wa Beyeri na Basemati, umukobwa wa Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Ariko abo bagore bateye ingorane nyinshi Isaka na Rebeka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Igihe kimwe, Isaka ariko arasaza kandi ariko arahuma, ahamagara Esawu, umuhungu wiwe mukuru, aramubwira ati: “Mwana wanje!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Na we ati: “Sabwe Data!”<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Arabandanya ati: “Ndashaje kandi sinzi umusi nzopfirako. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Fata umuheto wawe n’imyampi uje mu gahinga, uzane inyama z’igikoko wishe, <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />uzintegurire kumwe ndazikunda zimeze hanyuma uzinzanire ndazirye. Mpejeje ndaheza ndaguhe umuhezagiro wanje, imbere y’uko mpfa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Igihe Isaka yavugana na Esawu, Rebeka yariko arumviriza. Esawu amaze kuja mu gahinga guhiga, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Rebeka abwira Yakobo umuhungu wiwe ati: “Numvise so abwira mukuru wawe Esawu ati: <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‘Genda unzanire inyama z’igikoko wishe hanyuma uzintegurire neza. Mpejeje kuzirya, ndaheza nguhezagire imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, imbere y’uko mpfa.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Mwana wanje nyumviriza neza kandi ukore ico ngusaba: <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Genda mu bitungwa uzane imyagazi y’impene ibiri. Nanje nca ntegurira so inyama kumwe azikunda zimeze. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Nawe uraca uzimushira azirye, hanyuma aguhezagire imbere y’uko apfa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Ariko Yakobo abwira nyina Rebeka ati: “Urazi ko Esawu afise ubwoya bwinshi, ariko jewe umubiri wanje ntugira ubwoya. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Data arashobora kunkorako akumva ko ndiko ndamubesha; ivyo birashobora gutuma amvuma mu kibanza co kumpezagira.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Nyina aramwishura ati: “Mwana wanje, uwo muvumo uramfata jewe! Wewe nyumvira gusa, ugende uzane iz’impene.”<verse eid="GEN 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Nuko Yakobo aragenda azanira nyina za mpene. Rebeka ategura inyama neza mu buryo Isaka yakunda. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Hanyuma afata impuzu nziza cane za Esawu zari mu nzu iwe, azambika Yakobo, umuhungu wiwe mutoya. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Yambika Yakobo insato za ya myagazi y’impene ku maboko hamwe no mw’izosi ahatagira ubwoya. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Nuko aha Yakobo, umuhungu wiwe, vya vyokurya biryoshe yategura hamwe n’umukate.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Yakobo aja aho se ari aramuhamagara ati: “Data!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Na we ati: “Sabwe! Uri nde ga mwana wanje?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobo aramwishura ati: “Ndi Esawu, imfura yawe. Nakoze ivyo wansavye. Niwicare ufungure ku nyama nakuzaniye, hanyuma umpezagire.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Isaka abaza umuhungu wiwe ati: “Mwana wanje, wabigenjeje gute kugira ngo wice igikoko ningoga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Yakobo aramwishura ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe ni we yagishize mu nzira ncamwo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Isaka abwira Yakobo ati: “Egera hafi yanje, mwana wanje, kugira ngo ngukoreko numve vy’ukuri ko uri Esawu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Nuko Yakobo yegera aho se Isaka ari. Amukozeko aravuga ati: “Ijwi ni irya Yakobo, ariko amaboko ni aya Esawu!” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Ntiyashoboye kumumenya kuko amaboko yiwe yari afise ubwoya nk’aya mukuruwe Esawu. Imbere yo kumuhezagira <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />aramubaza ati: “Vy’ukuri uri Esawu umwana wanje?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Aramwishura ati: “Egome ni jewe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Isaka aramubwira ati: “Mwana wanje, ngaburira kuri za nyama uvuye guhiga. Mpejeje kurya ndaheza ndaguhezagire.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:25">Nuko Yakobo arazimuzanira, arafungura. Yongera amuzanira n’umuvinyu aranywa. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Hanyuma Isaka abwira Yakobo ati: “Nyegera mwana wanje ungumbire.”<verse eid="GEN 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Nuko aramwegera aramugumbira. Isaka yumvise ukumota kw’impuzu ziwe, aca aramuhezagira avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">“Ewe kumota kw’umwana wanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">kumeze nk’ukumota kw’imirima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahezagiye.<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Imana iguhe ku kime co mw’ijuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">no ku butunzi bwo mw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">umusesekara w’ingano n’umuvinyu!<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Amahanga aze agukorere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">n’amoko aze yuname imbere yawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Uze uganze abavukanyi bawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">abana ba nyoko baze buname imbere yawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Abazokuvuma baze bavumwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">kandi abazoguhezagira baze bahezagirwe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Isaka arangije kumuhezagira, Yakobo arasohoka. Muri ako kanya nyene, mukuruwe Esawu aca arashika avuye guhiga. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Na we ategura ivyokurya biryoshe abizanira se. Aramubwira ati: “Data, niwicare urye ku nyama mvuye guhiga, hanyuma umpezagire.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Isaka aramubaza ati: “Uri nde?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Esawu aramwishura ati: “Ni jewe umwana wawe w’imfura Esawu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Isaka arajugumira cane, maze aramubaza ati: “None ni nde yagiye guhiga hanyuma akanzanira inyama? Nafunguye kandi namaze kumuhezagira, kandi umuhezagiro namuhaye uzomufata.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Esawu yumvise amajambo ya se, araboroga n’umubabaro mwinshi, abwira se ati: “Mpezagira nanje, data!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Isaka aramwishura ati: “Murumunawe yaje arambesha. Yamaze gutwara umuhezagiro wawe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esawu aravuga ati: “Ubu bugize kabiri anyiba. Ntibitanganje izina ryiwe ni Yakobo nyene, umubeshi. Yanyivye kuba samuragwa kwanje, none raba ubu na ho anyivye n’umuhezagiro wanje. Ariko nta muhezagiro n’umwe wansigarije?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Isaka yishura Esawu ati: “Namaze kumugira mukuru kuri wewe kandi abavukanyi biwe bazoba abakozi biwe. Namuhaye ingano n’umuvinyu musha. None ga mwana wanje wumva hari igisigaye noguha?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esawu abaza se ati: “None ga data ufise umuhezagiro umwe gusa? Mpezagira nanje, data!” Nuko Esawu araturika ararira.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Se Isaka aramubwira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">“Uzoba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">kure y’ubutunzi bwo mw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">kure y’ikime co mw’ijuru.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Uzobeshwaho n’inkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">kandi uzokorera murumunawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Ariko niwiganzura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">uzokwikurako agacinyizo kiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">kw’izosi ryawe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Nuko Esawu agirira inzigo Yakobo kubera ko se yamuhezagiye. Aravuga ati: “Imisi yo kugandarira data iregereje. Hanyuma nzoca nica murumunanje Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Rebeka yumvise ivyo Esawu umuhungu wiwe mukuru yavuze, atumako Yakobo umuhungu wiwe muto, aramubwira ati: “Mukuru wawe ashaka kukwica kugira ngo akwihore. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />None rero mwana wanje, nyumvira ugende uhungire kwa musazanje Labani i Harani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Uze ugumane na we kugeza ishavu rya mukuru wawe riheze. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Ishavu niryahera akibagira ivyo wamukoreye, nzoheza ndagutumeko ugaruke. Nta cotuma ndababura uko muri babiri umusi umwe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Rebeka abwira Isaka ati: “Ubuzima bwanje bubaye bubi cane kubera aba bagore b’Abahetikazi. Yakobo niyarongora umwe mu bakobwa bo muri iki gihugu, b’Abahetikazi nk’aba, nta co nzoba nkibereyeho.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Nuko Isaka ahamagara Yakobo, aramuhezagira, aramwihanikiriza ati: “Ntuze urongore umukobwa w’Umunyakananikazi. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Genda i Padani-Aramu, mu rugo rwa sogokuru Betuweli, hanyuma uhitemwo umwe mu bakobwa ba nyokorome Labani akubere umugore. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Imana Mushoboravyose iguhezagire, iguhe abana benshi. Uruvyaro rwawe ruze rugwire ruhinduke amahanga menshi. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Imana ize iguhe wewe n’uruvyaro rwawe imihezagiro yasezeraniye Aburahamu. Ize iguhe kugaba iki gihugu ubamwo nk’umunyamahanga, kuko yakigabiye Aburahamu.” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Nuko Isaka arungika Yakobo i Padani-Aramu kwa Labani, mwene Betuweli Umwaramu, akaba na musaza wa Rebeka, nyina wa Yakobo na Esawu.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Nuko Esawu yumva ko se Isaka yahezagiye Yakobo kandi ko yamurungitse i Padani-Aramu kurondera umugore, kandi ko yihanikirije Yakobo ati: “Ntuze urongore umugore w’Umunyakananikazi,” <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />kandi ko Yakobo yumviye abavyeyi biwe akaja i Padani-Aramu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Esawu aca atahura ko se Isaka adakunda abagore b’Abanyakananikazi. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Nuko Esawu aja kwa Ishimayeli mwene Aburahamu, arongora umwe mu bakobwa biwe yitwa Mahala yavukana na Nebayoti, amwongera ku bagore yari asanganywe.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indoto ya Yakobo i Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Hanyuma Yakobo ava i Berisheba agenda atumbereye i Harani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Nuko ashika ahantu ashima kuharara, kuko izuba ryari rirenze. Afata ibuye, araryisegura aca araryama. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Asinziriye arota abona ingazi iva kw’isi igashika kw’ijuru; abamarayika b’Imana baduga abandi bamanuka kuri iyo ngazi. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Ku mutwe w’iyo ngazi hari hahagaze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; nuko abwira Yakobo ati: “Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya sogokuru Aburahamu na so Isaka. Aho hantu uryamye nzohaguha hakwegukire, wewe n’uruvyaro rwawe. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Uruvyaro rwawe ruzongana n’umukungugu wo kw’isi. Bazokwiragira mu mihingo yose: mu burengero, mu buseruko, mu buraruko no mu bumanuko. Kandi imiryango yose yo kw’isi izohezagirwa biciye kuri wewe no ku ruvyaro rwawe. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Ikindi na co, ndi kumwe nawe kandi nzokuzigamira aho uzoja hose. Umusi umwe nzokugarukana muri iki gihugu. Sinzokwigera ndaguta, nzoshitsa ivyo nagusezeraniye vyose.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Nuko Yakobo arikangura, avuga ati: “Ni ukuri <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari hano hantu, kandi sinari ndabizi!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Maze afatwa n’ubwoba avuga ati: “Aha hantu hateye ubwoba! Mu vy’ukuri ni inzu y’Imana kandi ni irembo ry’ijuru!”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Bukeye, Yakobo avyuka kare mu gitondo, afata rya buye yaraye yiseguye, arishinga ahantu hejuru nk’inkingi y’icibutso, maze arisukako amavuta. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Aho hantu ahita Beteli, bisigura “inzu y’Imana”, ariko ico gisagara cahora citwa Luzi.<verse eid="GEN 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Nuko Yakobo arasezerana ati: “Imana niyaba iri kumwe nanje kandi ikanzigama muri uru rugendo ndimwo, niyampa ivyokurya n’ivyo kwambara, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />maze ngashika mu rugo kwa data amahoro, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba Imana yanje. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Iri buye ry’icibutso nshinze, rizohinduka ikibanza co gusengeramwo Imana, kandi nzoshikanira Imana ic’icumi ku vyo izompa vyose.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo ashika i Padani-Aramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Nuko Yakobo arabandanya urugendo rwiwe, ashika mu gihugu co mu buseruko. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Ahashitse abona iriba mu gahinga, n’imikuku itatu y’intama ziryamye hafi yaryo, kuko ari ho zari zisanzwe ziza kunywa amazi. Ariko iryo riba ryari ryugaje ikibuye kinini. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Imikuku yose imaze kwegerana, abungere baca bakorana bagatembagaza ca kibuye kikava ku munwa w’iriba, maze bagaha amazi intama. Mu nyuma baraheza bagasubiza ca kibuye ku munwa w’iriba.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobo abaza ubungere ati: “Bavukanyi, mwebwe muva he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Baramwishura bati: “Tuva i Harani.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Arababaza ati: “Mwoba muzi Labani, umwuzukuru wa Nahori?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Baramwishura bati: “Egome, turamuzi.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Yongera arababaza ati: “Arakomeye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Na bo bati: “Egome, arakomeye. Mbere ng’uriya n’umukobwa wiwe Rasheli arashitse n’intama ziwe.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakobo arababwira ati: “Murabona ko hakiri ku murango; ntiharagera kwegeranya imikuku y’intama. Nimuhe amazi izo ntama hanyuma muzisubize kurisha.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Baramwishura bati: “Ntidushobora kubikora ubu nyene imikuku y’intama yose itarashika, hanyuma ngo dutembagaze ikibuye cugaye iriba. Aho ni ho dushobora guha intama amazi.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Yakobo akiriko aravugana na bo, Rasheli arashika ashoreye intama za se, kuko uwo mukobwa yari umwungere. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yakobo abonye Rasheli umukobwa wa Labani inarume, akabona n’intama za Labani, aca aja kuri rya riba, atembagaza ca kibuye kiryugaye, maze aha amazi intama za inarume. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Hanyuma Yakobo agumbira Rasheli, maze araturika ararira. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Abwira Rasheli ati: “Ndi incuti ya so, umuhungu wa Rebeka.” Rasheli aca ariruka abibwira se.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Labani amaze kwumva ko Yakobo, umwana wa mushikiwe, yaje, ariruka aja kumusanganira. Aramugumbira, aramusoma, amujana i muhira iwe. Yakobo amaze kubwira Labani ivyamubayeko vyose, <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Labani aramubwira ati: “Ni ivy’ukuri uri umubiri wanje n’amaraso yanje.”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="GEN 29:14">Yakobo arongora Leya na Rasheli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:14">Yakobo ahamaze ukwezi, <verse eid="GEN 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Labani aramubwira ati: “Ntukwiye kunkorera kuri gusa ngo ni kubera ko turi incuti. Mbwira impembo ushaka.”<verse eid="GEN 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Labani yari afise abakobwa abiri. Umukuru yitwa Leya, umutoya yitwa Rasheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Amaso ya Leya ntiyaraba neza, ariko Rasheli yari mwiza cane kandi yari ateye igomwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Kubera ko Yakobo yakunda Rasheli, abwira Labani ati: “Nzogukorera imyaka indwi niwemera kumpa Rasheli, umukobwa wawe mutoya, ngo twubakane.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labani aramwishura ati: “Ndavyemeye! Nohitamwo kumuguha hako ndamuha uwundi muntu. Guma hano iwanje.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Nuko Yakobo akorera Labani imyaka indwi kugira ngo aronke Rasheli. Kuko yamukunda urukundo rwinshi, iyo myaka yamubereye nk’imisi mike cane.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Nuko Yakobo abarira Labani ati: “Igihe twavuganye kiraheze, mpa umugore nakoreye kugira ngo tubane.”<verse eid="GEN 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Nuko Labani atumira abantu bo muri ako karere agira umusi mukuru. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Ariko hageze ku mugoroba, afata umukobwa wiwe Leya aba ari we aha Yakobo, maze Yakobo aryamana na we. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Labani aha umukobwa wiwe Leya incoreke yiwe Zilupa kugira ngo imukorere.<verse eid="GEN 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Yakobo avyutse mu gitondo, asanga yararanye na Leya. Abwira Labani ati: “Ibi wankoreye ni ibiki? Sinagukoreye imyaka indwi twumvikanye ko umpa Rasheli? Ni kuki wambeshe?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labani aramwishura ati: “Mu migenzo ya hano iwacu ntivyemewe gushingira umukobwa muto imbere y’umukobwa mukuru. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Rangiza iyi ndwi y’inkinga, hanyuma nzoheza ndaguhe Rasheli niwemera kunkorera iyindi myaka indwi.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Nuko Yakobo yemera gukora iyindi myaka indwi. Amaze imisi indwi arongoye Leya, Labani umushingira na Rasheli na we. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Labani atanga incoreke yiwe Biluha kugira ngo akorere umukobwa wiwe Rasheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Nuko Yakobo aryamana na Rasheli na we, kandi urukundo yamukunda rwaruta urwo yakunda Leya. Amara iyindi myaka indwi akorera Labani.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abana ba Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abonye ko Leya adakundwa, amushoboza kuvyara abana, ariko Rasheli we aba ingumba. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Nuko Leya asama inda avyara umuhungu, amwita Reyubeni, kuko yavuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabonye umubabaro wanje; ubu ho umugabo wanje azonkunda.”<verse eid="GEN 29:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Yongera asama iyindi nda avyara umuhungu, maze amwita Simeyoni, kuko yavuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabonye ko ntakundwa; ni co gituma ampaye uwundi muhungu.”<verse eid="GEN 29:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Yongera asama inda igira gatatu, avyara uwundi muhungu. Amwita Lewi, kuko yavuga ati: “Ubu ho umugabo wanje azonkunda, kuko maze kumuvyarira abahungu batatu.”<verse eid="GEN 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Leya yongera asama iyindi nda, avyara uwundi muhungu, amwita Yuda, kuko yavuga ati: “Ubu rero ngiye guhimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>!” Hanyuma aca arahagarika kuvyara.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Rasheli abonye ko adashoboye kuvyarira Yakobo abana, aca agirira ishari mukuruwe. Abwira Yakobo ati: “Mpa abana, bitagenze uko ndapfa!”<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yakobo ashavurira Rasheli, aramubaza ati: “Mbe mbaye Imana, ko ari yo yatumye utavyara?”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Rasheli aramwishura ati: “Fata incoreke yanje Biluha, uryamane na we kugira ngo amvyarire abana, maze biciye muri we nanje ngire uruvyaro.”<verse eid="GEN 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Nuko amuha ya ncoreke yiwe Biluha nk’umugore, Yakobo aryamana na we. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Biluha asama inda, avyarana na Yakobo umuhungu. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Rasheli aravuga ati: “Imana yanciriye urubanza rwiza! Yarumvise ugusenga kwanje maze impa umuhungu.” Nuko amwita Dani.<verse eid="GEN 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Biluha, incoreke ya Rasheli, yongera gusama inda, avyarana na Yakobo umuhungu agira kabiri. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Rasheli aravuga ati: “Nagwanye intambara ikomeye na mukuru wanje, ariko ndanesheje.” Nuko amwita Nafutali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Leya na we abonye ko atagisama inda, afata incoreke yiwe Zilupa, ayizanira Yakobo nk’umugore. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Zilupa incoreke ya Leya na yo ivyarira Yakobo umuhungu. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Leya aravuga ati: “Iki ni igihamana.” Nuko amwita Gadi.<verse eid="GEN 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilupa, incoreke ya Leya, yongera avyarana na Yakobo uwundi muhungu. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Leya aravuga ati: “Ndanezerewe cane! Kuva ubu abandi bagore bazonyita umuhirwe.” Nuko amwita Asheri.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Umusi umwe, hari mw’iyimbura ry’ingano, Reyubeni yamura ivyamwa vyitwa mandaragore mw’ishamba, abizanira nyina Leya. Rasheli abwira Leya ati: “Ndakwinginze umpe kuri mandaragore umuhungu wawe yazanye.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Ariko Leya amwishura ashavuye ati: “Mbega kuntwara umugabo ntivyari bihagije? Ubu na ho ushaka gutwara mandaragore umwana wanje yazanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Rasheli aramwishura ati: “Niwampa ku vyamwa umuhungu wawe yazanye, urashobora kurarana na Yakobo iri joro.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Ku mugoroba Yakobo avuye mu mirima, Leya aja kumusanganira. Aramubwira ati: “Utegerezwa kuryamana nanje, namaze kubiriha mandaragore umuhungu wanje yamuye.” Nuko aryamana na we iryo joro.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Imana yishura isengesho rya Leya, asama inda, avyarana na Yakobo umuhungu agira gatanu. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Leya aravuga ati: “Imana impaye impera kuko natanze incoreke yanje nkayiha umugabo wanje nk’umugore.” Nuko amwita Isakari.<verse eid="GEN 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Leya yongera gusama inda, avyarana na Yakobo umuhungu agira gatandatu. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Leya aravuga ati: “Imana yampaye ingabire nziza. Ubu umugabo wanje agiye kunyubaha, kuko ndamuvyariye abahungu batandatu.” Nuko amwita Zebuloni.<verse eid="GEN 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Mu nyuma Leya avyara umukobwa, amwita Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Maze Imana yibuka Rasheli, yishura amasengesho yiwe, imushoboza kuvyara. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Nuko asama inda avyara umuhungu, aravuga ati: “Imana inkuyeko agakengerwe.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Nuko amwita Yosefu, kuko yavuga ati: “Icompa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akanyongera uwundi muhungu.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukugwira kw’imikuku ya Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Haheze igihe gito Rasheli avyaye Yosefu, Yakobo abwira Labani ati: “Ndungika kugira ngo nsubire i muhira, mu gihugu canje c’amavukiro. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Mpa abagore banje n’abana banje, kuko nabaronse mbanje kugukorera, hanyuma undeke nigire. Urazi neza ko nagukoreye neza.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Labani aramwishura ati: “Nimba ngiriwe ubuntu imbere yawe, ndakwinginze ugume hano, kuko imana zanje zaramenyesheje ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yampezagiye ku bwawe!” <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Yongerako ati: “Mbwira ivyo ngufitiye, ndabiguha uko bingana kwose.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakobo aramwishura ati: “Urazi ingene nagukoreye neza, n’ingene imikuku yawe yagwiriye kubera jewe. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Wari ufise bike igihe naza hano, ariko raba ubutunzi bwawe bwaragwiriye cane. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaraguhezagiye kuva igihe nashikiye mu rugo rwawe. None nanje nzotangura ryari gukorera umuryango wanje?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labani aramubaza ati: “Ushaka ko nguhemba iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yakobo na we ati: “Ntugire ico umpa. Ico ngusavye, ni uko wondeka nkabandanya ndagira nongera nzigama imikuku yawe. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Nyemerera ngenzure imikuku yawe yose uno musi, hanyuma nkuremwo intama zose zirabura hamwe n’impene zose zifise amabara. Izo abe ari zo umpa nk’impembo yanje. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Niwaza kugenzura ibitungwa wampaye nk’impembo muri kazoza, bizokworohera kubona ko ndi imvugakuri. Niwasanga impene n’imwe itagira amabara canke intama itirabura, uzoca umenya ko zibwe.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Labani aravuga ati: “Ndavyemeye, reka tubigenze uko ubivuze.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Ariko uwo musi nyene Labani aca aragenda, akura mu mikuku yiwe impfizi z’impene zifise amabara hamwe n’impene zivyara z’amabara canke zera hamwehamwe, n’intama zose zirabura; azizeza abahungu biwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Hanyuma abarungika kure y’aho Yakobo yari ari, nk’urugendo rw’imisi atatu. Yakobo na we asigarana izisigaye mu mukuku wa Labani.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Nuko Yakobo aca inkoni zo mu biti vyitwa popula, alumonde na palatane, arazishishura ku mpande zimwezimwe, ku buryo izo nkoni zerekana uturongo twera. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Hanyuma ashira za nkoni yashishura ibicebice imbere y’intama n’impene, mu vyo zanyweramwo amazi, kuko zakunda kwima zije kunywa amazi. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Kandi izimiye imbere y’izo nkoni, zaca zivyara izifise imirongo n’amabara. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yakobo aca atandukanya izo zivutse n’umukuku wa Labani kandi azirabisha iyo umukuku wa Labani ugizwe n’iz’amabara n’izirabura uri. Uko ni ko yagwije umukuku wiwe, awutandukanya n’uwa Labani. <verse eid="GEN 30:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Igihe cose intama canke impene zivyara z’inguvu hageze ko zima, Yakobo yaca ashira za nkoni imbere yazo aho zanywera amazi, kugira ngo zimire imbere y’izo nkoni. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Ariko ivyo ntiyabigira ku bitungwa vy’amagara make. Ibitungwa bitobito vyari ivya Labani, ivy’amagara meza bikaba ivya Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Ivyo vyatumye Yakobo atunga cane. Yari afise imikuku minini y’intama n’impene, abamukorera b’abagabo n’abagore, ingamiya n’indogoba nyinshi.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo ava kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Bidatevye, Yakobo yumva ko abahungu ba Labani bidoga bati: “Yakobo yatwaye ivya data vyose. Ubutunzi afise yabukuye mu vyo data yari atunze.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Kandi Yakobo atangura kubona ko Labani atakimuraba ryiza.<verse eid="GEN 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Yakobo ati: “Subira mu gihugu ca ba sogokuruza, mu ncuti zawe; nanje nzobana na we.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Nuko Yakobo atumako Leya na Rasheli bamusanga mu gahinga aho yari aragiye imikuku. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Arababwira ati: “Ndabona ko so atakindaba ryiza nk’uko vyahora. Ariko Imana ya data yabanye nanje. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Murazi ko nakoreye so n’inguvu zanje zose, <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />ariko we yarandenganije, ahindura impembo yanje incuro icumi. Ariko Imana ntiyakunze ko ankorera ikibi. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Igihe cose so yavuze ati: ‘Ibitungwa vyose bifise amabara ni vyo bizoba impembo yawe,’ imikuku yose yaca ivyara ibifise amabara. Igihe cose yavuze ati: ‘Ibifise amabara y’imirongo bizoba impembo yawe,’ haca havuka ibifise amabara y’imirongo gusa. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Ni muri ubwo buryo Imana yafashe ibitungwa vya so ikabimpa.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />Igihe kimwe ibitungwa biriko birima, nabonye mu ndoto ko impfizi zariko zirimya zari zifise amabara y’imirongo canke amabara atandukanye. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Maze muri iyo ndoto umumarayika w’Imana arampamagara ati: ‘Yakobo.’ Nanje nditaba nti: ‘Sabwe.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Arambwira ati: ‘Ehe raba! Impfizi zose ziriko zirimya umukuku zifise amabara y’imirongo n’amabara atandukanye. Ibi ndabigize uko kuko nabonye ingene Labani yakurenganije. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Ndi ya Mana yakwiyerekera i Beteli, hamwe washinga ibuye ry’icibutso ukarisukako amavuta, hanyuma ukahagirira indahiro. Ubu rero va muri iki gihugu usubire mu gihugu wavukiyemwo.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Rasheli na Leya baramubwira bati: “Mbega hari ico tukirindiriye kuragwa mu vya data? <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Ntasigaye adufata nk’abanyamahangakazi? Amaze kutugurisha, yaciye akoresha uko ashaka amahera wadukoye. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Ubutunzi bwose Imana yaguhaye buvuye mu vya data, ni ubwacu n’abana bacu. Kora rero ico Imana yakubwiye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Nuko Yakobo ashira abagore n’abana biwe ku ngamiya, <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />ashorera imikuku yiwe yose imbere yiwe, hamwe n’ubutunzi bwose yaronkeye i Padani-Aramu, aja mu gihugu c’i Kanani, aho se Isaka yaba.<verse eid="GEN 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Igihe bafata urugendo, Labani yari yagiye gikemuza intama ziwe. Nuko Rasheli yiba ibigirwamana vyo mu nzu ya se arabijana. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yakobo yacitse Labani Umwaramu atigeze amubwira ko ashaka kugenda. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Nuko Yakobo ajana ivyiwe vyose, ajabuka uruzi Efurate, atumbereye mu misozi ya Gileyadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Labani akurikira Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Haheze imisi itatu, Labani amenya ko Yakobo yahunze. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Nuko akoranya abo mu muryango wiwe, bagira urugendo rw’imisi indwi bakurikira Yakobo, maze bamuhambiriza mu misozi y’i Gileyadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Ariko Imana ivugana na Labani Umwaramu mu ndoto mw’ijoro iti: “Wirinde ntugire ico ubwira Yakobo, caba ciza canke kibi.”<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Nuko Labani ahamvya Yakobo kuri uwo musozi. Yakobo yari yashinze ihema mu misozi y’i Gileyadi, maze Labani n’abajanye na we na bo bashinga iryabo hafi y’aho. <verse eid="GEN 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Labani abaza Yakobo ati: “Ibi wakoze ni ibiki? Ni kuki wambeshe ukajana abakobwa banje nk’abanyazwe mu ntambara? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Ni kuki watorotse winyegeje, ukambesha ntumbwire ko ushaka kugenda? Nari kugutegurira umusi mukuru, nkagusezera n’indirimbo, n’ingoma n’inanga. <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Ni kuki utampaye akanya ko gusezera abakobwa banje n’abazukuru banje mu kubagumbira? Wakoze ivy’ubupfu! <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Nashobora kukugirira nabi, ariko Imana ya so yanyiyeretse iri joro, irambwira iti: ‘Wirinde ntugire ico ubwira Yakobo, caba ciza canke kibi.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Ndazi ko wafashe ingingo yo kugenda kuko ukumbuye cane abo mu nzu ya so, ariko none ni kuki wivye imana zanje?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobo yishura Labani ati: “Nari mfise ubwoba kuko nibaza ko ushobora kunyaka abakobwa bawe ku nguvu. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Ariko ku bijanye n’imana zawe, zirondere. Umuntu uzisangana ace yicwa. Kandi imbere y’izi ncuti zacu, ikindi kintu cose cawe utora, ndakigusubiza!” Ariko Yakobo ntiyari azi ko ari Rasheli yari yivye vya bigirwamana vyo mu nzu ya se.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Nuko Labani atangura kuronderera mw’ihema rya Yakobo, hanyuma aja mu rya Leya no mw’ihema rya za ncoreke zibiri, ariko ntiyagira ico abona. Mu nyuma aja mw’ihema rya Rasheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Ariko Rasheli yari yafashe vya bigirwamana abishira musi y’ico bicarako ku ngamiya, aca avyicarako. Labani ararondera mw’ihema ryiwe, ntiyagira ico ahabona.<verse eid="GEN 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Rasheli abwira se ati: “Nyakwubahwa, ntunshavurire ngo sinahagurutse imbere yawe, ndi mu bihe vy’imihango y’abagore.” Nuko Labani abandanya arondera ariko ntiyashobora kubona vya bigirwamana vyo mu nzu yiwe.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Maze Yakobo arashavura, abwira Labani ati: “Ni ikihe caha unyagiriza? Nakoze ikibi ki caguteye kunkurikirana nk’uwukurikirana umwicanyi? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Ko warondeye mu vyanje vyose, hari ikintu co mu rugo rwawe wabonye? Cerekane imbere y’incuti zanje n’incuti zawe kugira ngo bakibone, maze batubere abacamanza twe nawe!<verse eid="GEN 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Maranye nawe imyaka mirongo ibiri ndagiye imikuku yawe. Ico gihe cose nta ntama canke impene yaramburuye kandi nta mpfizi n’imwe yo mu mikuku yawe nabaze ngo ndayirye. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Igihe cose igitungwa cishwe n’igikoko, sinigeze ndakikwereka. Ni jewe nibwiriza kugisubiriza. Wansavye kukuriha igitungwa cose cibwe, haba ku murango canke mw’ijoro. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Nagukoreye mu bushuhe buteye ubwoba ku murango no mu mbeho yo mw’ijoro sinatora agatiro. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Iyi myaka mirongo ibiri ndayimaranye nawe. Nagukoreye imyaka icumi n’ine kugira ngo umpe abakobwa bawe babiri, hanyuma ndagukorera imyaka itandatu ndagiye imikuku yawe. Kandi wahinduye impembo yanje incuro icumi zose! <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Iyo Imana ya data, Imana ya Aburahamu, Imana iteye ubwoba ya Isaka itaja kuba iri kumwe nanje, wari kunyirukana iminwe misa. Ariko Imana yarabonye umubabaro wanje n’ubutame bwanje. Ni co gituma yakwiyeretse iri joro, ikakugabisha.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Labani yishura Yakobo ati: “Aba bagore ni abana banje, aba bana ni abuzukuru banje, kandi iyi mikuku ni iyanje; ibi ubona vyose ni ivyanje. Ubu nta co ngishobora gukora ku bakobwa banje no ku bana bavyaye. <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Ingo tugirane isezerano twe nawe, maze rize ribe icabona hagati yanje nawe.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Nuko Yakobo afata ibuye arishinga nk’icibutso. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Abwira abari kumwe na we ati: “Nimwegeranye amabuye.” Baca barayegeranya bagira ikirundo cayo, hanyuma basangirira hambavu y’ico kirundo c’amabuye. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Labani acita Yegari Sahaduta, bisigura “ikirundo c’icabona” mu rurimi rw’Icarameya, Yakobo na we acita Galedi, bisigura “ikirundo c’icabona” mu rurimi rw’Igiheburayo.<verse eid="GEN 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Labani aravuga ati: “Iki kirundo c’amabuye ni icabona hagati yanje nawe uno musi.” Ni co gituma aho hantu hiswe Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Ariko kandi bahita Misipa, bisigura “umunara wo gushibamako”, kuko Labani yavuze ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agumize amaso yiwe kuri twebwe, nitwamara gutandukana. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Niwafata nabi abakobwa banje canke ukarongora abandi bagore, Imana izoba ibibona naho ata wuzoba abibona. Ni yo cabona muri iri sezerano tugiranye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Labani yongera abwira Yakobo ati: “Urabona iki kirundo c’amabuye nashize hagati yanje nawe n’iri buye ry’icibutso. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Ibi ni ivyabona vy’isezerano tugiranye. Sinzokwigera ndengana iki kirundo c’amabuye ngo nze kugukorera ikibi; kandi nawe ntuze wigere urengana iki kirundo c’amabuye canke iri buye ry’icibutso ngo uze kungirira nabi. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Imana ya Aburahamu n’Imana ya Nahori, ari yo Mana ya sewabo, ize itubere umucamanza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 31:53">Maze Yakobo arahira mw’izina ry’Imana iteye ubwoba ya se Isaka, <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />abaga igitungwa, agitangako ikimazi kuri uwo musozi, maze atumira incuti ziwe gusangira na we. Bahejeje gufungura, barara kuri uwo musozi.<verse eid="GEN 31:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Labani avyuka kare mu gitondo, agumbira abuzukuru biwe n’abakobwa biwe, arabahezagira, arabasezera, asubira iwe.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo yitegurira guhura na Esawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Nuko Yakobo na we abandanya inzira yiwe, maze abamarayika b’Imana baza guhura na we. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Ababonye, aravuga ati: “Aha ni ho Imana icumbitse!” Aca yita aho hantu Mahanayimu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Nuko Yakobo aca atuma intumwa imbere yiwe kuri mwene nyina, Esawu, mu karere ka Seyiri, mu gihugu ca Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Arababwira ati: “Mushikirize ubu butumwa databuja Esawu, muti: ‘Ng’ubu ubutumwa bw’umusavyi wawe Yakobo: iki gihe cose ndakimaranye na marume Labani, kandi natebeye iwe. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Ubu rero mfise inka, indogoba, imikuku y’intama n’impene, n’abasuku benshi harimwo abagabo n’abagore. Ndungitse izi ntumwa, nyakwubahwa, ngo zikumenyeshe ko ndiko ndaza, nizera ko nzogirirwa ibakwe imbere yawe.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Za ntumwa zihejeje gutanga ubutumwa, ziragaruka zibwira Yakobo ziti: “Twabonanye na mwene nyoko Esawu, kandi ari mu nzira aza ngo muhure. Ari kumwe n’abagabo amajana ane.”<verse eid="GEN 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Yakobo aca agira ubwoba bwinshi, aja mu gatengo. Afata abantu bari kumwe na we abagaburamwo kubiri; n’intama, impene, inka n’ingamiya na vyo abigaburamwo kubiri. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Yibaza ati: “Esawu niyahura n’umugwi umwe akawutera, umugwi usigaye urashobora kurokoka.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Hanyuma Yakobo aca asenga avuga ati: “Mana ya sogokuru Aburahamu na data Isaka; ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni wewe wambwiye uti: ‘Subira mu gihugu cawe no mu ncuti zawe, nanje nzogukorera ivyiza.’ <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Wanyeretse urukundo rwinshi n’ubwizigirwa jewe umusavyi wawe, kandi ntari ndabikwiye. Igihe nava iwacu nkajabuka uruzi Yorodani, nta co nari mfise uretse inkoni. None raba ngarutse mfise iyi migwi ibiri. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Ndakwinginze, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, unkize ukuboko kwa mwene mama Esawu. Ikinteye ubwoba ni uko aje kuntera, yice abagore n’abana banje. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Wibuke ko wansezeraniye uti: ‘Nzogukorera ivyiza, kandi nzogwiza uruvyaro rwawe rungane n’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga. Bazoba benshi ku buryo badashobora guharurika!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Nuko Yakobo arara aho yari ari. Atoranya mu vyo yari afise ingabire yo guha Esawu, mwene nyina: <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />impene zivyara amajana abiri, impfizi z’impene mirongo ibiri, intama zivyara amajana abiri n’impfizi z’intama mirongo ibiri, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ingamiya zivyara mirongo itatu hamwe n’inyana zazo, inka zivyara mirongo ine n’impfizi z’inka icumi, indogoba zivyara mirongo ibiri hamwe n’impfizi z’indogoba icumi. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Araheza agabura ivyo bitungwa mu mikuku, ayizeza abakozi batandukanye. Maze abwira abo bakozi ati: “Nimujane ibi bitungwa, mugendere imbere yacu, kandi hagati y’umukuku n’uwundi hasigare ikirere.”<verse eid="GEN 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Yakobo abwira uwari arongoye umukuku wa mbere ati: “Mwene mama Esawu niyaza guhura namwe, araja kubabaza ati: ‘Muri abakozi ba nde? Mugiye he? Ibi bitungwa mushoreye ni ivya nde?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Umwishure uti: ‘Ni ivy’umusavyi wawe Yakobo, ni ingabire akurungikiye wewe nyakwubahwa Esawu. Kandi na we ari inyuma ariko araza.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Yakobo abwira ayo majambo n’uwa kabiri hamwe n’uwa gatatu, n’abari bakurikiye imikuku bose ati: “Nimwahura na Esawu, uko abe ari ko mumubwira. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Kandi mumubwire muti: ‘Na databuja Yakobo ariko araza, ari inyuma yacu.’ ” Yakobo yibwira ati: “Ninarungika ingabire imbere yanje, biraja guhwamika ishavu rya Esawu. Ninamushikira amaso mu yandi, arashobora kungirira ikigongwe.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Nuko arungika za ngabire imbere yiwe, ariko we asubira kurara hamwe bari bacumbitse.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo agwana n’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Iryo joro, Yakobo aravyuka afata abagore biwe babiri, za ncoreke ziwe zibiri hamwe n’abana biwe icumi n’umwe, ajabuka umugezi Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Amaze kubajabutsa, ajabutsa n’ivyo yari afise vyose. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Ariko Yakobo we asigara inyuma ari wenyene, maze haza umugabo agwana na we kugeza bukeye. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Uwo mugabo abonye ko bimunaniye kunesha Yakobo, amukubita ku mutsi wo kw’itako, bituma Yakobo atangura gucumbagira mu gihe yariko aragwana na we. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Wa mugabo aravuga ati: “Ndekura ngende kuko burakeye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Yakobo aramwishura ati: “Sindakurekura, utampezagiye!”<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Aramubaza ati: “Witwa nde?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Yakobo aramwishura ati: “Nitwa Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Wa mugabo aramubwira ati: “Ntugisubira kwitwa Yakobo. Kuva ubu uzokwitwa Isirayeli, kuko wagwanye n’Imana n’abantu ukanesha.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Yakobo aramubwira ati: “Ndakwinginze umbwire izina ryawe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Wa mugabo aramwishura ati: “Umbariza iki izina ryanje?” Nuko aca amuhezagirira aho hantu.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Yakobo yita aho hantu Peniyeli, bisigura “mu maso h’Imana”, kuko yavuga ati: “Nabonye Imana amaso mu yandi, ariko ndacari muzima!”<verse eid="GEN 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Izuba riserutse Yakobo ava i Peniyeli, agenda aracumbagira kuko yari yababaye ku mutsi wo kw’itako. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Ni co gituma n’uno musi Abisirayeli batarya umutsi wo kw’itako, kuko ari ho Yakobo yakubiswe.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo ahura na Esawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Yakobo yunamuye amaso akaraba imbere, abona Esawu aje aherekejwe n’abagabo amajana ane. Nuko agabura abana biwe, bamwe ku ruhande rwa Leya, abandi ku ruhande rwa Rasheli, no ku ruhande rwa za ncoreke zibiri. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Ashira imbere za ncoreke n’abana bazo, hakurikira Leya n’abana biwe, hanyuma Rasheli na Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Nuko Yakobo aja imbere yabo. Ariko aregereza mwene nyina, yunama hasi incuro indwi imbere yiwe.<verse eid="GEN 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Maze Esawu aza yiruka kumusanganira aramugumbira, amurenza amaboko ku rutugu; maze bose bararira. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esawu aravye hirya no hino akabona abagore n’abana abaza Yakobo ati: “Aba bari kumwe nawe ni ba nde?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Aramwishura ati: “Ni abana Imana yampaye, mu buntu bwayo, jewe umusavyi wawe.”<verse eid="GEN 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Nuko za ncoreke zizanana n’abana bazo bunama imbere ya Esawu. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Leya na we n’abana biwe baregera na bo bunama imbere yiwe. Hanyuma Yosefu na Rasheli baregera bunama imbere yiwe.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esawu aramubaza ati: “Mbe irya mikuku twahuye na yo ni iy’iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobo aramwishura ati: “Ni ingabire yawe nyakwubahwa, kugira ngo undabe ryiza.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Esawu aramwishura ati: “Mwene mama, ndafise ibinkwiye. Gumya ivyawe!”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Ariko Yakobo arashimika ati: “Oya, ndakwinginze wemere ingabire yanje, nimba natoneshejwe imbere yawe. Biranduhuye kubona mu maso hawe hakeye, ni nko kubona mu maso h’Imana. Kandi wanyakiriye neza cane. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Ndakwingize wemere iyi ngabire nkuzaniye, kuko Imana yarangiriye ubuntu impa ibinkwiye.” Kubera ukwinginga kwa Yakobo, Esawu arateba aremera ya ngabire.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Esawu aravuga ati: “Ingo tugende, jewe ndabaja imbere.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Ariko Yakobo aramwishura ati: “Nyakwubahwa, urabona ko bamwe mu bana bakiri bato cane kandi ko hari intama, impene n’inka vyonsa. Nitwabishorera twihuta, naho hoba umusi umwe, ibitungwa vyose birashobora gupfa. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Ndakwinginze, nyakwubahwa, ube uragenda imbere yanje umusavyi wawe, hanyuma nanje nzoza buhorobuhoro nisunze imikuku yanje n’abana bato, kugeza nshitse iwawe i Seyiri.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Esawu aravuga ati: “Ariko reka ndagusigire bamwe mu bo twagendanye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Yakobo aramwishura ati: “Ntibikenewe nyakwubahwa! Igikomeye ni uko wamaze kunyakira, ngatoneshwa imbere yawe.”<verse eid="GEN 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Maze uwo musi nyene, Esawu afata inzira yisubirira i Seyiri. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Ariko Yakobo abandanya urugendo aja i Sukoti. Ahashitse yiyubakira inzu, yubakira n’imikuku yiwe. Ni co gituma aho hantu hiswe Sukoti, bisigura “aho kwikinga”.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Inyuma y’urugendo rwo kuva i Padani-Aramu, Yakobo arateba ashika amahoro mu gisagara ca Shekemu, mu gihugu c’i Kanani, ashinga amahema inyuma y’igisagara. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Nuko Yakobo agurira abahungu ba Hamori itongo shekeli ijana, aba ari ho ashinga amahema. Hamori yari se wa Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Aho ahubaka igicaniro acita Eli Elohe Isirayeli, bisigura Eli, Imana ya Isirayeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s1">Dina na Shekemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Umusi umwe, Dina umukobwa Leya yavyaranye na Yakobo, aja kuramutsa abakobwa bamwe bo muri ico gihugu. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Shekemu mwene Hamori Umuhiwi, umukuru w’ico gihugu, abonye Dina, aramufata amusambanya ku nguvu. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Mu nyuma yumva akunze Dina, umukobwa wa Yakobo, agerageza kumukwegesha amajambo meza. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Maze Shekemu abwira se Hamori ati: “Nsabira uwu mukobwa, nshaka ko ambera umugore.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Mu nyuma, Yakobo yumva ko Shekemu yononye umukobwa wiwe Dina. Kubera ko abahungu biwe bari baragiye imikuku mu gahinga, arahora kugeza bagarutse.<verse eid="GEN 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Maze Hamori, se wa Shekemu, aja kwa Yakobo kugira ngo babivugane, <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />igihe abahungu ba Yakobo bari batashe bavuye mu gahinga. Bavyumvise barababara cane bashavuzwa cane n’ingene Shekemu yakoze ibidakorwa muri Isirayeli, agasambanya ku nguvu umukobwa wa Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Hamori agerageza kuvugana na Yakobo n’abahungu biwe ati: “Umuhungu wanje Shekemu yakunze umukobwa wawe, ndakwinginze umumuhe amubere umugore. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Kandi twemerere tunywane. Muduhe abakobwa banyu barongorwe n’abahungu bacu; natwe tubahe abakobwa bacu barongorwe n’abahungu banyu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Murashobora kugumana natwe, igihugu kiruguruye. Murashobora kuba aho mushaka hose, mukadandaza, mukagura n’amatongo.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Shekemu na we abwira se wa Dina na basazawe ati: “Ndasavye mungirire imbabazi, kandi ico munsaba cose ndagitanga. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Munsabe inkwano n’ingabire mushaka zose, ico munsaba cose ndagitanga; ariko mumumpe ambere umugore.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Kubera ko Shekemu yari yononye Dina mushiki wabo, abahungu ba Yakobo bishura Shekemu na se Hamori mu buryarya. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Barababwira bati: “Ntidushobora gutanga mushiki wacu ngo arongorwe n’umugabo atakebwe; ico ni ikintu c’iterasoni kuri twebwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Ivyo twovyemera twumvikanye ibi bikurikira: Mwemere kumera nk’uko tumeze, izina muhungu wese muri mwebwe akebwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Aho ni ho dushobora kubaha abakobwa bacu, natwe tukarongora abakobwa banyu. Tuzoheza tubane namwe, maze tube ihanga rimwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Ariko nimutatwumvira, ntimwemere gukebwa, duca twakira umukobwa wacu twigire.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Ayo majambo aryohera Hamori n’umuhungu wiwe Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Shekemu ntiyatevye gukora ivyo bamusavye, kuko yari yakunze umukobwa wa Yakobo cane. Kandi yari yubashwe mu muryango wa se. <verse eid="GEN 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Hamori na Shekemu baja kw’irembo ry’igisagara cabo bavugana n’abagabo bo mu gisagara bati: <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Aba bantu ni abanyamahoro. Muze tubareke babane natwe muri iki gihugu, bahadandarize ata nkomanzi. Igihugu ni kinini cobakwira. Turashobora kurongora abakobwa babo, na bo bakarongora abakobwa bacu. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Ariko ikizotuma bagumana natwe tukaba ihanga rimwe, ni uko abahungu bacu bose bakebwa nka bo. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Ivyo tubikoze, imikuku yabo n’ibindi vyose batunze bizohinduka ivyacu. Muze twemere ivyo badusaba gusa, kugira ngo babane natwe.”<verse eid="GEN 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Nuko abagabo bose basohokera muri iryo rembo bemera inama ya Hamori n’umuhungu wiwe Shekemu, maze izina muhungu wese wo muri ico gisagara arakebwa.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Haheze imisi itatu, ibikomere vyabo bikibababaza, babiri mu bahungu ba Yakobo, Simeyoni na Lewi, basaza ba Dina, bafata inkota zabo binjira muri ca gisagara ata nkomanzi, bica abagabo bose, <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />harimwo na Hamori na Shekemu umuhungu wiwe. Bose babicisha inkota, maze bakura Dina mu nzu kwa Shekemu baca barigira. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Abandi bahungu ba Yakobo baraza baca mu mivyimba basahura ivyari muri ico gisagara vyose, kugira ngo bihore ibara ryakorewe mushiki wabo. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Bafata intama, impene, inka n’indogoba vy’abantu b’i Sikemu; ivyo basanze mu gisagara n’ivyari mu gahinga, <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />batwara ubutunzi bwabo bwose, abana babo n’abagore babo, n’ivyari mu nzu zabo vyose.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Yakobo abwira Simeyoni na Lewi ati: “Munteje ivyago mu bantu bose baba muri iki gihugu! Kubera mwebwe, Abanyakanani n’Abaperizi bagiye kunyanka. Twebwe turi bake. Nibaja hamwe bakantera, bazonesha; umuryango wanje wose bawuherengeteze.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Baramwishura bati: “Ni kuki yafata mushiki wacu nka maraya?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo asubira i Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Imana ibwira Yakobo iti: “Va hasi uje i Beteli abe ari ho uba. Uze uhubakire igicaniro ya Mana yakwiyereka igihe wariko urahunga mwene nyoko Esawu.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Nuko Yakobo abwira umuryango wiwe n’abari kumwe na we bose ati: “Nimukure ibigirwamana vy’abanyamahanga hagati muri mwebwe mwihumanure kandi mwambare impuzu nshasha. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Tugiye kuva hano tuje i Beteli, aho nzokwubakira igicaniro ya Mana yishura ugusenga kwanje igihe nari mu makuba, ikagumana nanje aho nagiye hose.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Nuko bazanira Yakobo ibigirwamana vy’abanyamahanga bari bafise vyose n’ivyo bari bambaye ku matwi, maze abihamba musi y’igiti kinini cari hafi y’i Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Yakobo n’abahungu biwe bavuye aho hantu, ubwoba butewe n’Imana bufata abantu bo mu bisagara vyari bihakikije. Nta muntu n’umwe yubahutse kubakurikirana.<verse eid="GEN 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Nuko Yakobo n’abari kumwe na we bose bashika i Luzi, ari ho Beteli, mu gihugu c’i Kanani, <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />aca ahubaka igicaniro maze ahita Eli Beteli, bisigura “Imana y’i Beteli”, kuko ari ho Imana yari yaramwiyerekeye igihe yariko arahunga mwene nyina Esawu.<verse eid="GEN 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Hanyuma Debora, umurezi wa Rebeka, arapfa, ahambwa musi y’igiti kinini hafi ya Beteli. Maze ico giti bacita Aloni Bakuti, bisigura “igiti c’amarira”.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Inyuma yo kuva i Padani-Aramu, Imana yongera kwiyereka Yakobo iramuhezagira. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Imana iramubwira iti: “Izina ryawe ni Yakobo, ariko kuva ubu ugiye kwitwa Isirayeli.” Nuko Imana imwita Isirayeli.<verse eid="GEN 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Imana yongera iramubwira iti: “Ndi Imana Mushoboravyose. Rondoka ugwire. Uzohinduka ihanga rinini, mbere amahanga menshi azokomoka kuri wewe, kandi abami bazova mu nda yawe. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Nzoguha igihugu nahaye Aburahamu na Isaka; nzokiguha wewe n’uruvyaro rwawe.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Hanyuma Imana iva aho hantu yari iriko iravuganira na we.<verse eid="GEN 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Nuko Yakobo ashinga ibuye mu kibanza Imana yavuganiyemwo na we, arisukako umuvinyu, nk’ishikanwa ashikaniye Imana, arisukako n’amavuta. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Maze aho hantu Imana yavuganiye na we, Yakobo ahita Beteli, bisigura “inzu y’Imana”.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Rasheli na Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Nuko bava i Beteli bagenda bagana ahitwa Efurata. Bakiri mu nzira, Rasheli afatwa n’inda kandi agira ububabare bwinshi cane. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Muri ubwo bubabare bwo kuvyara, umwakirizi aramubwira ati: “Ntutinye, usubiriye kuvyara umuhungu.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Ariko Rasheli yariko arapfa. Imbere yo gucikana amwita Beni-Oni, bisigura “umuhungu wo mu mubabaro wanje”. Ariko se amwita Benyamini, bisigura “umuhungu w’ukuryo kwanje”.<verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Rasheli apfuye, bamuhamba hafi y’inzira ija muri Efurata, ari ho i Betelehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Nuko Yakobo ashinga ibuye ry’icibutso ku mva ya Rasheli, kandi riracahari gushika n’uno musi.<verse eid="GEN 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Isirayeli aca arunguruza ashinga amahema hakurya y’ahitwa Migidali Ederi. <verse eid="GEN 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Isirayeli akiri muri ico gihugu, Reyubeni asambana na Biluha, umwe mu ncoreke Yakobo yari yavyayeko, kandi Yakobo arabimenya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 35:22" />
  <para style="lh" vid="GEN 35:22">Abahungu ba Yakobo bari icumi na babiri:<verse eid="GEN 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Abahungu ba Leya, bari</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:23">Reyubeni, imfura ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:23">Simeyoni, Lewi, Yuda, Isakari na Zebuloni.<verse eid="GEN 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Abahungu ba Rasheli, bari</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:24">Yosefu na Benyamini.<verse eid="GEN 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Abahungu ba Biluha, incoreke ya Rasheli, bari</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:25">Dani na Nafutali.<verse eid="GEN 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Abahungu ba Zilupa, incoreke ya Leya, bari</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 35:26">Gadi na Asheri.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 35:26" />
  <para style="lf" vid="GEN 35:26">Abo ni bo bahungu ba Yakobo, abo yavyariye i Padani-Aramu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Nuko Yakobo agaruka mu rugo kwa se Isaka i Mamure, hafi y’i Kiriyati-Araba, ari ho hitwa Heburoni, aho Aburahamu na Isaka babaye. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isaka yamaze imyaka ijana na mirongo umunani, <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />maze apfa ageze mu zabukuru, ahamvya ba sekuruza. Abahungu biwe Esawu na Yakobo baramuhamba.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s1">Uruvyaro rwo Esawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Uri ni rwo rukurikirane rw’abakomoka kuri Esawu, ari we Edomu:<verse eid="GEN 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esawu yarongoye abakobwa bo mu gihugu c’i Kanani: Ada umukobwa wa Eloni, Umuheti na Oholibama, umukobwa wa Ana, akaba n’umwuzukuru wa Zibeyoni Umuhiwi, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />hamwe na Basemati, umukobwa wa Ishimayeli, mushiki wa Nebayoti.<verse eid="GEN 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada yavyaranye na Esawu Elifazi, Basemati bavyarana Reyuweli, <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Oholibama na we bavyarana Yewushi, Yalamu na Kora. Abo ni bo bahungu Esawu yavyariye i Kanani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Nuko Esawu afata abagore biwe, abahungu n’abakobwa biwe hamwe n’abo yari atunze mu rugo rwiwe, n’imikuku yiwe n’ibindi bikoko yari atunze; n’ivyo yari yararonkeye i Kanani; aragenda aja mu gihugu ca Seyiri, kure ya mwene nyina Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Ivyo bari batunze vyari vyinshi cane ku buryo bitakunda ko bagumana; igihugu bari bagerereyemwo nticari kubakwira kuko bari bafise umikuku n’amasho vyinshi. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Nuko Esawu, ari we Edomu, aja kuba mu misozi ya Seyiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Uru ni rwo rukurikirane rw’abakomoka kuri Esawu, sekuruza w’Abanyedomu mu misozi ya Seyiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Aya ni yo mazina y’abahungu ba Esawu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:10">Elifazi uwo Esawu yavyaranye na Ada, na Reyuweli uwo yavyaranye na Basemati.<verse eid="GEN 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Abakomotse kuri Elifazi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:11">Temani, Omari, Zefo, Gatamu na Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Elifazi umuhungu wa Esawu yari afise uwundi mugore wa kabiri yitwa Timuna, uwo na we bavyaranye Amaleki. Abo ni bo bakomotse kuri Ada, umugore wa Esawu.<verse eid="GEN 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Bene Reyuweli, ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:13">Nahati, Zera, Shama na Miza. Abo ni bo buzukuru ba Esawu ku mugore wiwe Basemati.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Abahungu Esawu yavyaranye na Oholibama, umukobwa wa Ana, akaba n’umwuzukuru wa Zibeyoni, ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:14">Yewushi, Yalamu na Kora.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Aba ni bo bakuru b’imiryango mu ruvyaro rwa Esawu:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 36:15">Mu bavyawe na Elifazi imfura ya Esawu, abakuru b’imiryango bari:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:15">Temani, Omari, Zefo, Kenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Kora, Gatamu na Amaleki. Abo ni bo bakuru b’imiryango bakomotse kuri Elifazi muri Edomu, bakaba bari abuzukuru ba Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Mu bavyawe na Reyuweli umuhungu wa Esawu, abakuru b’imiryango bari:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:17">Nahati, Zera, Shama na Miza. Abo ni bo bakuru b’imiryango bakomotse kuri Reyuweli muri Edomu; bakaba bari abuzukuru ba Basemati, umugore wa Esawu.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Mu bahungu Esawu yavyaranye na Oholibama, abakuru b’imiryango bari:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:18">Yewushi, Yalamu na Kora. Abo ni bo bakuru b’imiryango bakomotse ku mugore wa Esawu Oholibama, akaba n’umukobwa wa Ana.<verse eid="GEN 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Urwo ni rwo ruvyaro rwa Esawu, ari we Edomu, kandi abo ni bo bakuru b’imiryango yabo.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uruvyaro rwa Seyiri</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Aba ni bo bene Seyiri Umuhori, baba muri ico gihugu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:20">Lotani, Shobali, Zibeyoni, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dishoni, Ezeri na Dishani. Abo ni abahungu ba Seyiri muri Edomu babaye abakuru b’imiryango y’Abahori.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Bene Lotani bari</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:22">Hori na Homamu. Lotani yari afise mushikiwe yitwa Timuna.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Bene Shobali, ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:23">Alivani, Manahati, Ebali, Shefo na Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Bene Zibeyoni, ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:24">Ayiya na Ana. Uwu Ana ni we yatoye isoko ry’amazi ashushe mu bugaragwa igihe yari aragiye indogoba za se Zibeyoni.<verse eid="GEN 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Bene Ana, ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:25">Dishoni na Oholibama, umukobwa wiwe.<verse eid="GEN 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Abahungu ba Dishani, ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:26">Hemudani, Eshibani, Itirani na Kerani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Bene Ezeri, ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:27">Bilihani, Zayavani na Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Bene Dishani, ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:28">Uzi na Arani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Abakuru b’imiryango y’Abahori bari aba bakurikira:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:29">Lotani, Shobali, Zibeyoni, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Dishoni, Ezeri na Dishani.</para>
  <para style="lf" vid="GEN 36:30">Abo ni bo bakuru b’imiryango y’Abahori, ukurikije imiryango yabo, mu gihugu ca Seyiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakuru b’imiryango ya Edomu</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Uru ni rwo rukurikirane rw’abami batwaye mu gihugu ca Edomu, imbere y’uko Isirayeli yimika umwami n’umwe:<verse eid="GEN 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela mwene Beyori yabaye umwami wa Edomu, igisagara ciwe citwa Dinihaba.<verse eid="GEN 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela apfuye, asubirirwa ku ngoma na Yobabu mwene Zera yava i Bozira.<verse eid="GEN 36:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobabu apfuye, asubirirwa ku ngoma na Hushamu yava mu gihugu c’Abatemani.<verse eid="GEN 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Hushamu apfuye, asubirirwa ku ngoma na Hadadi mwene Bedadi, ari we yanesheje Abamidiyani mu gihugu ca Mowabu. Igisagara ciwe citwa Aviti.<verse eid="GEN 36:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadadi apfuye, asubirirwa ku ngoma na Samula yava i Masireka.<verse eid="GEN 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samula apfuye, asubirirwa ku ngoma na Shawuli yava i Rehoboti hafi y’uruzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bishoboka ko ari uruzi Efurate</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 36:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Shawuli apfuye, asubirirwa ku ngoma na Bayali-Hanani mwene Akibori.<verse eid="GEN 36:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Bayali-Hanani mwene Akibori apfuye, asubirirwa ku ngoma na Hadadi. Igisagara ciwe citwa Pawu, umugore wiwe yitwa Mehetabeli, umukobwa wa Materedi, akaba n’umwuzukuru wa Mezahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Aya ni yo mazina y’abakuru b’imiryango yakomotse kuri Esawu, ufatiye ku turere babayemwo tukanabitirirwa:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 36:40">Timuna, Aluva, Yeteti,<verse eid="GEN 36:40" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibama, Ela, Pinoni,<verse eid="GEN 36:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenazi, Temani, Mibuzari,<verse eid="GEN 36:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magidiyeli na Iramu.</para>
  <para style="lf" vid="GEN 36:43">Abo ni bo bari abakuru b’imiryango ya Edomu, ufatiye ku turere babayemwo muri ico gihugu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 36:43" />
  <para style="lf" vid="GEN 36:43">Urwo ni rwo ruvyaro rwa Esawu, sekuruza w’Abanyedomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s1">Indoto za Yosefu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Nuko Yakobo aba i Kanani, igihugu se yabayemwo nk’umunyamahanga.<verse eid="GEN 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Iyi ni yo nkuru y’umuryango wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 37:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yosefu amaze imyaka icumi n’indwi, yaciye atangura kuja kuragira ibitungwa na bene se, abahungu ba Biluha na Zilupa, abagore b’ihari ba se, maze akama abwira se ibibi bakora.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Isirayeli yarakunda Yosefu kuruta abandi bahungu biwe bose kuko yamuvyaye ageze mu zabukuru; kandi yari yaramukoreye ikanzu ndende y’amabara menshi. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Bene se babonye ko se amukunda kuruta uko abakunda, baca baramwanka ku buryo batashobora kumuvugisha n’umutima mwiza.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Ijoro rimwe Yosefu ararota, ariko abwiye bene se ivyo yarose, baca barushiriza kumwanka. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Yababwiye ati: “Umviriza indoto nagize. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Twari mu mirima turiko turatekera imikama y’ingano, nja mbona umuganda wanje urahagurutse, maze imiganda yanyu ica irawukikuza, yunama imbere yawo.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Bene se baramubwira bati: “Ushatse kuvuga ko uzoba umwami wacu canke ko uzotubera umutware?” Nuko indoto ziwe n’amajambo yavuga bituma barushiriza kumwanka.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Mu nyuma Yosefu yongera kurota, aca abwira bene se ivyo yarose, ati: “Nimunyumvirize, nasubiye kurota. Nabonye izuba, ukwezi n’inyenyeri icumi n’imwe vyunama imbere yanje.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Iyo ndoto yongera ayibwira na se, na we aramukankamira ati: “Iyo ndoto ni bwoko ki? Wibaza ko nyoko, jewe n’abo muvukana tuzoza tukunama tugashika hasi imbere yawe?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Ariko naho bene se bamugirira inzigo, se we yagumye avyiyumvirako.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosefu agurishwa na benewabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Igihe kimwe, bakuru ba Yosefu bari bagiye i Shekemu kuragira imikuku ya se. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Umusi umwe, Isirayeli abwira Yosefu ati: “Bakuru bawe baragiye imikuku i Shekemu. Ingo uje kubaraba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yosefu arishura ati: “Nditeguye kugenda, data.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Se aramubwira ati: “Genda urabe ko bakuru bawe bakomeye, n’uko imikuku imerewe, hanyuma uheze ugaruke umbwire.” Nuko amurungikira mu kiyaya ca Heburoni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Yosefu ashitse i Shekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />haza umuntu amusanga ayerera mu gahinga, uwo muntu aramubaza ati: “Urondera iki?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yosefu aramwishura ati: “Ndondera bakuru banje. Woba uzi aho baragiye imikuku?”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Wa muntu aramwishura ati: “Egome, bahoze hano ariko barahavuye. Numvise bavuga ko bagiye i Dotani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:17">Nuko Yosefu akurikira bene se abasanga i Dotani. <verse eid="GEN 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Bene se bamubonye akiri kure, baramumenya. Atarabashikira, bagira inama yo kumwica.<verse eid="GEN 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Baravugana bati: “Karosi araje! <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Nimuze tumwice, duterere ikiziga ciwe mu kinogo. Maze tuzovuga ko igikoko camuriye, duheze turabe ico indoto ziwe zivamwo!”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Reyubeni yumvise iyo nama, agerageza gutabara Yosefu. Aravuga ati: “Ntimumwice. <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Ntimusese amaraso. Ahubwo muterere muri iki kinogo, ariko amaboko yacu ntamukoreko.” Reyubeni yashaka kuraba ingene yotabara Yosefu, akamusubiza kwa se.<verse eid="GEN 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Yosefu ashitse aho bene se bari, baca baramufata bamwambura ya kanzu ndende y’amabara menshi yari yambaye, <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />bamuterera muri ca kinogo. Ico gihe nta mazi yari muri ico kinogo.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Hanyuma baca baricara ngo barye. Bunamuye amaso, babona umugwi w’Abishimayeli bari bavuye i Gileyadi baja muri Egiputa. Ingamiya zabo zari zikoreye ibimota neza vyitwa guma, balimu na mira.<verse eid="GEN 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Yuda abwira bene se ati: “Mbega vyotumarira iki kwica umuvukanyi, tugahisha ko twamwishe? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Hako tumugirira nabi, reka tumugurishe kuri barya Bishimayeli. Erega ni umuvukanyi, asangiye amaraso natwe.” Nuko abo bavukana baremera.<verse eid="GEN 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Ba badandaza b’Abamidiyani bahashitse, bakuru ba Yosefu bamukura muri ca kinogo, bamugurisha kuri abo Bishimayeli shekeli mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 230.</char></note> z’ifeza, na bo bamujana muri Egiputa.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Reyubeni agarutse kuri ca kinogo, asanga Yosefu si yo akiri. Yitaburirako impuzu ababaye, <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />agaruka aho bene se bari aravuga ati: “Wa mwana si yo akiri, none ndabigenza gute?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Nuko bafata impene barayibaga, bashira ya kanzu ya Yosefu mu maraso. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Maze bafata ya kanzu ndende y’amabara menshi bayishira se, baramubwira bati: “Ehe ico twatoye! Raba ko yoba ari ya kanzu y’umwana wawe.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Maze se aca arayimenya ubwo nyene, aravuga ati: “Ni ikanzu y’umwana wanje! Igikoko caramuriye; Yosefu yaratabaguwe n’igikoko.”<verse eid="GEN 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Nuko Yakobo yitaburirako impuzu, yambara impuzu zo kugandara, amara igihe kirekire agandariye umuhungu wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Abahungu biwe n’abakobwa biwe bagerageza kumuhoza, ariko arabankira, avuga ati: “Nzorinda mpfa nkigandariye umwana wanje.” Nuko abandanya aririra Yosefu, umwana wiwe.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Ba Bamidiyani bagurisha Yosefu muri Egiputa kuri Potifari, umwe mu basoda bakuru ba Farawo, umwami wa Egiputa. Potifari ni we yatwara abasoda barinda ikirimba c’umwami.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda na Tamari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Muri ico gihe, Yuda avana na bene se, aja kubana n’umugabo yitwa Hira i Adulamu. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Yuda ahashitse abona umukobwa wa Shuwa, Umunyakanani, aramurongora. Aryamanye na we, <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />uwo mugore asama inda, avyara umuhungu, Yuda amwita Eri. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Yongera asama inda, avyara uwundi muhungu, amwita Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Avyaye umuhungu agira gatatu, amwita Shela. Igihe Shela yavuka baba i Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Haheze igihe, Yuda aronderera umuhungu wiwe Eri umugore yitwa Tamari. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Ariko Eri, imfura ya Yuda, yakora ibibi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwica.<verse eid="GEN 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Yuda abwira umuhungu wiwe Onani ati: “Rongora Tamari, umupfakazi wa mukuru wawe; nk’uko ubisabwa n’umugenzo nka muramuwe, uronderere uruvyaro mukuru wawe.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Ariko Onani yari azi ko urwo ruvyaro rutazoba urwiwe. Ni co gituma igihe cose yaryamana na muramuwe, yasesa imbuto ziwe hasi, kugira ngo ntavyarire mukuruwe. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Ariko ivyo yakoze bibabaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we aca aramwica.<verse eid="GEN 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Maze Yuda abwira umukazana wiwe ati: “Subira mu nzu kwa so, ugumeyo nk’umupfakazi urindire ko umuhungu wanje Shela akura.” Ivyo yabivuze kuko yatinya ko Shela na we ashobora gupfa nka bakuruwe. Nuko Tamari asubira i muhira kwa se.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Haheze imisi, umugore wa Yuda, ari we mukobwa wa Shuwa, arapfa. Igihe co kugandara giheze, Yuda na mugenziwe Hira w’i Adulamu bajana i Timuna kuraba abakozi bariko barakemura intama ziwe.<verse eid="GEN 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Maze umuntu umwe abwira Tamari ati: “Sobukwe ariko araja i Timuna gukemura intama ziwe.” <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Tamari yari azi ko Shela yakuze, ariko nta cari cakozwe kugira ngo amurongore. Nuko akura impuzu ziwe z’ubupfakazi, aritwikira kugira ngo ahishe mu maso hiwe. Maze yicara kw’irembo ry’igisagara c’i Enayimu, cari ku nzira ija i Timuna.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Yuda ahashitse aramubona, yibaza ko ari umumaraya, kuko yari yihishije mu maso. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Nuko aramwegera aho yari ari i ruhande y’inzira aramubwira ati: “Ndashaka ko turyamana.” Ariko ntiyari yamenye ko ari umukazana wiwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Na we aramubaza ati: “Umpa iki nitwaryamana?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Aramwishura ati: “Nzokurungikira umwagazi w’impene yo mu mukuku wanje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Na we aramubaza ati: “Ni igiki umpa nk’ingwati kinyemeza ko uzondungikira iyo mpene?”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yuda aramubaza ati: “Ushaka ingwati imeze gute?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Na we aramwishura ati: “Nsigarana iyo mpeta yawe n’umugozi wayo, hamwe n’iyo nkoni ufise mu minwe.” Nuko Yuda arabimuha, barasambana, maze Tamari asama inda. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Hanyuma aca aravyuka aragenda, akura wa mwitwikiro yambara impuzu z’ubupfakazi.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Mu nyuma Yuda atuma wa mugenzi wiwe Hira w’i Adulamu ngo amujanire wa mwagazi w’impene, kugira ngo wa mugore amusubize ivyo yari yarasigaranye nk’ingwati. Ariko Hira ntiyashobora kumutora. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Nuko abaza abantu baba i Enayimu ati: “Wa mumaraya yari ahagaze i ruhande y’inzira kw’irembo ry’i Enayimu ari he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Baramwishura bati: “Nta mumaraya yigeze aba hano.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Nuko Hira asubira iyo Yuda ari aramubwira ati: “Sinashoboye kumutora. Kandi n’abantu baho bambwiye ko hatigeze haba umumaraya.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda aramubwira ati: “Mureke abigumane nk’ivyiwe, abantu ntibahave badutwenga. Jewe narungitse umwagazi w’impene nk’uko twasezeranye, ariko ntiwashoboye kumutora.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Haheze nk’amezi atatu, babwira Yuda bati: “Wa mukazana wawe Tamari yigenjeje nk’imaraya. Ubu afise inda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yuda aravuga ati: “Nibamusohore, bamuturire gushika apfe!”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Ariko bariko baramusohora bamujana kumwica, arungikira ubutumwa sebukwe ati: “Uwanteye iyi nda ni nyene ibi bintu. Raba iyi mpeta n’umugozi wayo hamwe n’iyi nkoni, ugerageze kumenya nyenevyo.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yuda abibonye aravuga ati: “Arandushije kugororoka, kuko sinamuhaye umuhungu wanje Shela ngo amurongore.” Nuko Yuda ntiyasubira kuryamana na Tamari kandi.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Hageze ko yibaruka, basanga atwaye inda y’amahasa. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Ariko aravyara, umwe mu bana agorora ukuboko; umwakirizi aragufata abohera agatambara gatukura ku gikonjo, aravuga ati: “Uwu ni we yavutse ubwa mbere.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Ariko wa mwana aca asubiza ukuboko inyuma, maze uwundi amutanga kuvuka. Wa mwakirizi aratangara ati: “Vyagenze gute ngo uze ubwa mbere?” Nuko amwita Peresi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Hanyuma wa mwana wundi afise agatambara gatukura aravuka, na we amwita Zera.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyabaye kuri Yosefu ari kwa Potifari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Igihe Yosefu yajanwa muri Egiputa, yaguzwe na Potifari, umusoda mukuru w’Umunyegiputa, amugura ku Bishimayeli. Uwo Potifari yari umukuru w’ingabo zicungera ubuzima bwa Farawo, umwami wa Egiputa.<verse eid="GEN 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abana na Yosefu, na we agira umugisha mu vyo yakora vyose. Yosefu yaba mu nzu ya shebuja w’Umunyegiputa. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Shebuja abonye ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe na we, kandi ko amuha kuroranirwa mu vyo akora vyose, <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />ivyo bituma Yosefu agira igikundiro imbere yiwe, amuha kugenzura ivyo mu nzu yiwe, amuzeza ivyo yari atunze vyose. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Kuva umusi Yosefu azezwa inzu ya shebuja n’ivyiwe vyose, Imana yaciye itangura guhezagira urugo rwa Potifari Umunyegiputa kubera Yosefu; umuhezagiro w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uba ku vyo yari atunze vyose mu rugo no mu mirima. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Nuko Potifari aha Yosefu ububasha bwose ku vyo yari atunze vyose, ntiyagira igisubira kumuraza ishinga uretse ivyokurya gusa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yosefu yari umuhungu mwiza mu maso no mu gihagararo. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Nuko muka Potifari atangura kumwipfuza, aramubwira ati: “Ingo turyamane!”<verse eid="GEN 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Ariko Yosefu aramwankira ati: “Urabona ko databuja ata kintu kimuraje ishinga, kuko yanjeje ivyo mu nzu yiwe vyose. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Nta muntu n’umwe muri iyi nzu andusha ububasha. Nta kintu na kimwe databuja yisigarije kiretse wewe, kuko uri umugore wiwe. None nokwubahuka gute gukora ikibi nk’ico, ngacumura ku Mana?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Wa mugore abandanya agora Yosefu ku musi ku musi, ariko Yosefu yanka kuryamana na we, amwigira kure uko bishoboka.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Umusi umwe, Yosefu yinjira mu nzu gukora ibikorwa vyiwe ata wundi muntu n’umwe ahari. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Wa mugore amufata impuzu, aramubwira ati: “Ingo turyamane!” Yosefu aramwiyaka arasohoka, ariko wa mugore asigarana umutamana wiwe mu minwe.<verse eid="GEN 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Abonye ko Yosefu ahunze akamusigarana umutamana wiwe, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />ahamagara abakozi biwe arababwira ati: “Raba iri bara! Umugabo wanje yazanye uwu mugurano w’Umuheburayo kudutukisha. Yinjiye mu cumba canje ashaka kumfata ku nguvu, maze nca ndakoma induru nyinshi. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Yumvise nkomye induru ngatabaza, yaciye yiruka arahunga, ariko asiga umutamana wiwe.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Nuko wa mugore agumya umutamana wa Yosefu kugeza umugabo atashe. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Ashitse, aca aramubwira uko vyagenze, ati: “Wa mugurano w’Umuheburayo wazana yinjiye mu cumba canje kudutukisha. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Nkomye induru ngatabaza, aca arahunga aja hanze, asiga umutamana wiwe.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Shebuja yumvise inkuru y’umugore wiwe, avuga ati: “Ibi ni vyo wa mugurano wawe yankoreye,” aca arashavura cane. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Nuko afata Yosefu amuterera mw’ibohero bapfungiramwo imbohe z’umwami.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:20">Ariko Yosefu ari muri iryo bohero, <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abana na we, amuha kugira ikiganza ciza, agira igikundiro mu maso y’umukuru w’ibohero. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Bidatevye, umukuru w’ibohero amuha kuganza abandi bapfungwa no kugenzura ibibera mw’ibohero vyose. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Umukuru w’ibohero ntiyasubira kugira ikimuraza ishinga, kuko vyose Yosefu yabiraba. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abana na Yosefu, atuma ivyo akora vyose bimugendera neza.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s1">Yosefu asobanura indoto z’abakozi ba Farawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Haheze igihe, uwari ajejwe guha umwami wa Egiputa ivyo kunywa, n’uwari ajejwe imikate y’umwami, bamucumurako. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Nuko Farawo ashavurira cane abo bakuru uko ari babiri: uwujejwe ivyo kunywa n’uwujejwe imikate. <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />Aca abashira mw’ibohero Yosefu yari arimwo, mu kigo c’umukuru w’ingabo zirinda umwami. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Maze umukuru w’imbohe abazeza Yosefu, kugira ngo abarabe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:4">Bamaze igihe kitari gito mw’ibohero, <verse eid="GEN 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />umwe yari ajejwe ivyo kunywa vy’umwami n’uwari ajejwe imikate y’umwami wa Egiputa, uko ari babiri, bagira indoto ijoro rimwe, kandi indoto yose yari ifise insiguro yayo.<verse eid="GEN 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Mu gitondo Yosefu aje kubaraba asanga ntibamerewe neza. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Arababaza ati: “Ni kuki mubabaye uno musi?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Baramwishura bati: “Twese twarose iri joro, ariko nta n’umwe ashobora kutubwira ico izo ndoto zisigura.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yosefu arababwira ati: “Imana ni yo itanga ubwenge bwo gusigura indoto. Nimumbwire ivyo mwarose.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Wa mukuru yari ajejwe guha umwami ivyo kunywa abwira Yosefu indoto yiwe ati: “Mu ndoto nabonye igiti c’umuzabibu imbere yanje. <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />Ico giti cari gifise amashami atatu. Kigitangura kuzana amababi, gica kirashurika, cama amahando y’inzabibu zihiye. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Nari mfise igikombe c’umwami mu minwe, nuko nca mfata ya mahando y’inzabibu ndayakanyira muri ca gikombe, nca nshira ca gikombe mu minwe ya Farawo.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yosefu aramubwira ati: “Insiguro y’indoto yawe ni iyi: Ayo mashami atatu asigura imisi itatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Mu misi itatu, Farawo azokurekura, akubabarire, maze agusubize mu gikorwa cawe. Uzosubira umuhereze igikombe nk’uko wamye ubikora ukimukorera. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Uze unyibuke niyo vyose vyakungendera neza, umvugire ku mwami, kugira ngo ankure muri iri bohero. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Jewe baranyuruje, bankura mu gihugu c’Abaheburayo, none raba ndapfunzwe, ariko nta kibi nakoze cotuma mba ndi muri iri bohero.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Wa mukuru yari ajejwe imikate y’umwami abonye ko insiguro y’indoto ya mugenziwe ari nziza, abwira Yosefu ati: “Nanje narose mbona nikoreye ibiseke bitatu vy’imikate. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Mu giseke co hejuru, harimwo imikate y’ubwoko butandukanye ya Farawo. Hanyuma mbona inyoni ziza kunobagura ya mikate muri ca giseke cari ku mutwe wanje.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yosefu aramubwira ati: “Ibiseke bitatu bisigura imisi itatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Mu misi itatu, Farawo azoguca umutwe, akubambe ku giti. Maze inyoni zizoza zikunobagure.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Haheze imisi itatu, ku musi wo kwibuka ivuka ryiwe, umwami ategura umusi mukuru, atumira abategetsi bakorana n’abakora ku kirimba. Nuko ahamagaza umwe yari ajejwe ivyo kunywa vyiwe n’uwari ajejwe imikate ngo baze mu bandi bategetsi. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Asubiza wa mukuru yari ajejwe ivyo kunywa mu gikorwa ciwe, na we aca ashira igikombe mu minwe y’umwami. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Wa mukuru yari ajejwe imikate we aramubambisha, nk’uko Yosefu yari yabimusiguriye.<verse eid="GEN 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Ariko wa mukuru ajejwe ivyo kunywa vy’umwami ntiyasubira kwibuka Yosefu; aramwibagira rwose.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s1">Indoto za Farawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Haheze imyaka ibiri, Farawo ararota. Muri iyo ndoto yari ahagaze ku nkengera y’uruzi Nili, <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />maze inka indwi nziza kandi zivyibushe ziva mu ruzi, zica zitangura kurisha mu rufunzo rwari hafi y’uruzi. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Hanyuma abona izindi nka indwi zije zikurikira za zindi, zivuye mu ruzi Nili, ariko zo zari mbi kandi zonze. Nuko zihagarara ku nkengera y’uruzi hambavu ya za zindi zivyibushe. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Za nka mbi kandi zonze zimira zimwe indwi nziza kandi zivyibushe. Indoto igeze aho, Farawo aca arikangura.<verse eid="GEN 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Hanyuma asubiriye gusinzira, aca asubira kurota. Abona ingano indwi ziyangitse ziremvye kandi nziza, zakuriye ku mutumba umwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Hanyuma hamera izindi ngano indwi, ariko zo zari ntonto kandi mbi, zumishijwe n’umuyaga wo mu buseruko. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Maze za ngano ntonto kandi mbi zimira zimwe indwi ziremvye kandi nziza. Maze Farawo arikangura, asanga zari indoto.<verse eid="GEN 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Bukeye mu gitondo, Farawo avyuka ahagaritse umutima, aca atumako abanyamareba na ba kamenyi bose bo muri Egiputa. Ababwiye indoto yagize, ntihagira n’umwe ashobora kumuha insiguro yazo.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Maze wa mukuru yari ajejwe ivyo kunywa vy’umwami abwira Farawo ati: “Uno musi ni ho nibutse ikibi nakoze. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Haraheze igihe unshavuriye jewe umusavyi wawe n’uwujejwe imikate, maze udushira mw’ibohero ry’umukuru w’ingabo zirinda umwami. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Maze ijoro rimwe uko turi babiri turarota, kandi indoto yose yari ifise insiguro yayo. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Muri iryo bohero twari kumwe n’umuhungu w’Umuheburayo, yakorera umukuru w’ingabo zirinda umwami. Nuko tumubwira indoto twagize na we aca atubwira ico indoto yose isigura. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Kandi vyagenze nk’uko yari yabivuze. Jewe nasubijwe mu kibanza canje nk’uwujejwe ivyo kunywa vy’umwami, umwe yari ajejwe imikate y’umwami na we arabambwa.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Nuko Farawo aca atumako Yosefu, bamukura mw’ibohero bihuta. Ahejeje kwimosha no guhindura impuzu, aca arinjira ahagarara imbere ya Farawo.<verse eid="GEN 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Nuko Farawo aramubwira ati: “Narose, ariko nta n’umwe yashoboye kunsigurira indoto narose. Ariko numvise ko wewe iyo wumvise indoto, ushobora gutanga insiguro yayo.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yosefu yishura Farawo ati: “Nyakwubahwa, si jewe ndavyishoboza; ariko Imana irashobora kuguha insiguro ibereye y’iyo ndoto warose.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Nuko Farawo abwira Yosefu ati: “Mu ndoto yanje, nabonye mpagaze ku nkengera y’uruzi Nili. <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />Maze inka indwi zivyibushe kandi nziza ziva mu ruzi zica zitangura kurisha mu rufunzo rwari hafi y’uruzi. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Hanyuma mbona inka indwi zisa n’izigwaye, zonze kandi mbi. Nta nka mbi nk’izo nari bwabone mu gihugu cose ca Egiputa. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Hanyuma mbona za nka ndwi zonze kandi mbi zimira zimwe zivyibushe. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Zihejeje kuzimira, nta wari kumenya ko zazimize, kuko zagumye ari mbi nk’uko zari zimeze ubwa mbere. Nuko nca ndikangura.<verse eid="GEN 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Nsubiye gusinzira gato, nongera ndarota, mbona ingano indwi ziyangitse nziza kandi ziremvye, zakuriye ku mutumba umwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Ariko haca hakura izindi ngano indwi mbi, ntonto kandi zumishijwe n’umuyaga wo mu buseruko. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Maze za ngano ntonto kandi mbi zimira zimwe indwi nziza kandi ziremvye. Izi ndoto narazibwiye abanyamareba, ariko nta n’umwe yashoboye kuzinsigurira.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Nuko Yosefu abwira umwami ati: “Izo ndoto umwami yagize zifise insiguro imwe. Imana imenyesheje Farawo ivyo igiye gukora. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Zirya nka indwi nziza na za ngano nziza ziremvye zisigura imyaka indwi y’umwimbu mwinshi. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Za nka mbi kandi zonze zaje mu nyuma na za ngano indwi mbi ntonto, zumishijwe n’umuyaga wo mu buseruko, zisigura imyaka indwi y’amapfa.<verse eid="GEN 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Ibi bizogenda nk’uko namaze kubivuga, kuko Imana yamenyesheje Farawo imbere y’igihe ivyo igiye gukora. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Hagiye kuza imyaka indwi y’umwimbu mwishi cane mu gihugu ca Egiputa cose. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Ariko inyuma yayo hazoza imyaka indwi y’amapfa akomeye ku buryo azokwibagiza abantu na ya myaka y’umwimbu mwinshi mu gihugu ca Egiputa. Ayo mapfa azosiga igihugu cipfumbereje. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Ayo mapfa azoba akomeye ku buryo na ya myaka myiza itazosubira kwibukwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Kandi ko mwabonye indoto zibiri zisa, bisigura ko ivyo ari Imana yabishinze, kandi ko vuba igiye kubishitsa.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />Ubu rero mwami, wari ukwiye kurondera umuntu w’umunyabwenge kandi w’inkerebutsi, ukamuzeza igihugu cose ca Egiputa. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Kandi wari ukwiye gushiraho abagenduzi mu gihugu cose, bajejwe kwegeranya ica gatanu c’ivyimburwa vyo mu gihugu ca Egiputa muri iyo myaka indwi y’umwimbu usagutse. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Abo boba bajejwe kwegeranya ivyokurya muri iyo myaka indwi myiza igiye kuza babizane mu bubiko bwa Farawo mu bisagara bitandukanye, hanyuma babirinde. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Uko ni ko hazoboneka ivyokurya bikwiye mu gihe ca ya myaka indwi y’inzara igiye kuza mu gihugu ca Egiputa. Bitabaye uko, aya mapfa azohonya abantu muri kino gihugu.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Nuko Farawo n’abamukorera bakira neza amajambo ya Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Farawo arababaza ati: “Twoshobora kuronka uwundi muntu ameze nk’uwu mugabo, umuntu arimwo impwemu y’Imana?”<verse eid="GEN 41:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Umwami abwira Yosefu ati: “Nimba Imana yaguhishuriye insiguro y’izi ndoto, biraboneka neza ko ata wundi muntu munganya ubwenge. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Ni wewe ngiye kuzeza ikirimba canje, kandi abantu banje bose bazokwumvira ivyo ubategetse. Ni jewe jenyene nzoba ndi hejuru yawe, kuko ndi umwami.”<verse eid="GEN 41:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosefu aganza Egiputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Nuko Farawo abwira Yosefu ati: “Raba nguhaye kuganza igihugu cose ca Egiputa.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Umwami akura impeta iriko ikidodo ciwe ku rutoke rwiwe, ayambika Yosefu ku rutoke. Yongera amwambika impuzu nziza zera cane, amwambika n’umugufu w’inzahabu mw’izosi. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Hanyuma amwuriza ku mukogote ugenewe icegera c’umwami. Maze ahantu hose Yosefu aciye, abantu bagasemerera bati: “Mubise arengane!” Uko ni ko Farawo yahaye Yosefu kuganza igihugu ca Egiputa cose.<verse eid="GEN 41:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Farawo abwira Yosefu ati: “Ni jewe mwami wa Egiputa, ariko udatanze uruhusha, nta muntu n’umwe azogira ico akora canke aho aja muri Egiputa yose.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Nuko Farawo aha Yosefu izina ry’Abanyegiputa, ari ryo Zafenati-Paneya. Yongera amuha n’umugore yitwa Asenati. Uwo yari umukobwa wa Potifera, umuherezi wo mu gisagara ca Oni. Hanyuma Yosefu ava ku kirimba, aca agendagenda igihugu cose ca Egiputa.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Igihe yatangura gukora ku kirimba kwa Farawo, umwami wa Egiputa, Yosefu yari amaze imyaka mirongo itatu. Nuko ava ku kirimba, aja kugenzura igihugu cose ca Egiputa. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Nk’uko vyari vyavuzwe, mu myaka indwi ya mbere, igihugu catanze umwimbu mwinshi cane. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Muri iyo myaka, Yosefu yegeranya ivyimbuwe vyose muri Egiputa hanyuma abika mu bisagara intete zimbuwe mu mirima ibikikije. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Nuko Yosefu yegeranya ingano nyinshi cane, zogereranywa n’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga. Maze bagera aho bahagarika guharura ivyinjiye, kuko bitari bigishoboka kubiharura.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Muri ico gihe, imbere y’uko ya myaka y’amapfa ishika, Yosefu yavyaye abahungu babiri kuri Asenati, umukobwa wa Potifera, umuherezi wo mu gisagara ca Oni. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Umwana w’imfura Yosefu amwita Manase, kuko yavuga ati: “Imana yanyibagije amakuba yanje yose n’umuryango wa data wose.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Yosefu yita umuhungu wiwe wa kabiri Efurayimu, kuko yavuga ati: “Imana yampaye kurondoka mu gihugu nagiriyemwo amakuba.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Hanyuma ya myaka y’umwimbu mwinshi mu gihugu cose ca Egiputa irarangira. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Haca hatangura ya myaka indwi y’amapfa, nk’uko Yosefu yari yarabivuze. Ayo mapfa yateye no mu bihugu bihakikuje, ariko muri Egiputa ho hari ivyokurya. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Ariko n’igihugu ca Egiputa na co gitangura gufatwa n’inzara. Abantu batanguye gutakambira Farawo ngo abahe ivyokurya, ababwira ati: “Nimuje kwa Yosefu, mukore ivyo ababwira vyose.”<verse eid="GEN 41:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Amapfa arushirije gukomera, Yosefu yugurura bwa bubiko, aha Abanyegiputa ingano, kuko igihugu cose cari cishwe n’inzara. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Abantu bo mu bihugu vyegereye Egiputa baraza kugura ingano kwa Yosefu, kuko amapfa yari yugarije isi yose.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s1">Abavukanyi ba Yosefu baja muri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Yakobo yumvise ko muri Egiputa hari ingano, abwira abahungu biwe ati: “Ni kuki muguma ngaha murabana mu maso? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Narumvise ko hari ingano muri Egiputa. Nimugende mugure ingano zikwiye kugira ngo tube turamaze kabiri, ntidupfe.”<verse eid="GEN 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Nuko bene se ba Yosefu icumi baja muri Egiputa kugura ingano. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Ariko Yakobo ntiyarungika Benyamini, murumuna wa Yosefu, kuko yatinya ko hagira ikibi kimushikira. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Nuko ba bahungu ba Isirayeli bajana n’abandi muri Egiputa kugura ingano, kuko no mu gihugu c’i Kanani na ho hari amapfa.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Yosefu ni we yatwara igihugu ca Egiputa cose, kandi ni na we yari ajejwe kugurisha ingano ku bantu bose. Nuko bene se bashika aho ari, barunama bashika hasi imbere yiwe. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yosefu ababonye aca arabamenya, ariko aca yifata nk’uwutigeze abamenya. Ababazanya amanyama ati: “Muva he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Baramwishura bati: “Tuva mu gihugu c’i Kanani, tuje kugura ivyokurya.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Naho Yosefu yamenye bene se, bo ntibashoboye kumumenya. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Nuko Yosefu yibuka indoto yigeze kugira kuri bo, arababwira ati: “Mwebwe muri abatasi! Muje kuraba aho igihugu cacu gifise intege nke!”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Baramwishura bati: “Oya, nyakwubahwa! Twebwe abasavyi bawe twaje kugura ivyokurya gusa. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Twese turavukana. Ntituri abatasi nyakwubahwa, turi abantu b’intungane.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Ariko arabishura ati: “Oya muri bo! Mwazanywe no kuraba intege nke z’igihugu cacu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Baramwishura bati: “Nyakwubahwa, twese hamwe twavukana turi icumi na babiri. Twebwe abasavyi bawe tuvuka kuri data umwe kandi tuva mu gihugu c’i Kanani. Umuhererezi wacu yasigaranye na data; ariko hariho umwe atakiriho.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Ariko Yosefu arababwira ati: “Nk’uko nabivuze, muri abatasi! <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Uku ni ko ngira ndabageze: ndabarahiye mw’izina rya Farawo ko mudashobora kuva muri Egiputa, mutabanje kuzana umuhererezi wanyu. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Umwe muri mwebwe ategerezwa kuja kumuzana. Abasigaye mba ndabashira mw’ibohero kugeza mbonye ko ivyo mwavuze ari ukuri canke ko ari ibinyoma. Ndabarahiye mw’izina rya Farawo, ninasanga ata muhererezi mufise, muzoba muri abatasi.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Nuko Yosefu abashira mw’ibohero imisi itatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Ku musi wa gatatu, Yosefu arababwira ati: “Jewe ndubaha Imana, nimwakora ivyo ndababwiye, nta co muba. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Nimba muri abantu b’intungane, nimuhitemwo umwe muri mwebwe aguma mw’ibohero. Hanyuma abasigaye murashobora gutaha mujaniye ingano imiryango yanyu iriko iricwa n’inzara. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Ariko mutegerezwa kunzanira umuhererezi wanyu. Ico ni co kizonyemeza ko muvuga ukuri, maze bitume ntabica.” Nuko baravyemera.<verse eid="GEN 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Baravugana bati: “Biragaragara ko turiko turishura ivyo twakoreye umuvukanyi wacu. Twarabonye agahinda yari afise igihe yariko aradusaba adutakambira, ariko ntitwamwumvirije. Ni co gituma ibi vyago bidushikiye.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Reyubeni arababwira ati: “Sinabasavye ngo ntimugire ikibi mumukorera, ariko ntimunyumvirize? Ubu rero turiko turishura urupfu rwiwe.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Ntibari bazi ko Yosefu yumva ivyo bariko baravugana, kuko yabavugisha akoresheje uwumusigurira.<verse eid="GEN 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Nuko Yosefu aca yigira hirya ararira. Mu nyuma aragaruka avugana na bo. Nuko afata Simeyoni, avuga ko bamuboha bose babibona.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Nuko Yosefu asaba ko buzuza imifuko yabo ingano, kandi ko bashira amahera yabo muri iyo mifuko. Yongera abaha n’ivyo bagenda bararya mu rugendo. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Nuko bene se ba Yosefu bashira ya mifuko ku ndogoba zabo baragenda.<verse eid="GEN 42:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Bashitse aho barara, umwe muri bo yugurura umufuko wiwe ngo agaburire indogoba, asangamwo amahera yiwe hejuru mu mufuko. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Ahamagara bene se arababwira ati: “Ehe raba! Bansubije amahera; ari hano mu mufuko!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">Nuko baca bacika intege kubera ubwoba, babazanya bajugumira bati: “Ibi ni ibiki Imana itugiriye?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Bashitse kwa se Yakobo, i Kanani, bamubwira ivyabashikiye vyose, bati: <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Umuntu atwara ico gihugu yatuvugishe adukarira cane, atwagiriza ko tuje gutata igihugu ciwe. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Ariko twaramubwiye tuti: ‘Turi abantu b’intungane, ntituri abatasi. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Tuvukana turi icumi na babiri, kandi dufise data umwe. Umwe ntakiriho, umuhererezi na we yasigaranye na data mu gihugu c’i Kanani.’<verse eid="GEN 42:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Uwo mugabo aganje ico gihugu aratubwira ati: ‘Iki ni co kizonyereka ko muri abantu b’intungane: umwe muri mwebwe ndamusigarana, hanyuma abandi mugende, mushire ingano imiryango yanyu iriko iricwa n’inzara. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Ariko mutegerezwa kunzanira umuhererezi wanyu. Ico ni co kizonyereka ko muri abantu b’intungane, ko mutari abatasi. Nanje nzoca ndabasubiza umuvukanyi wanyu, kandi nzoca ndabareka mugire urudandazwa muri iki gihugu.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Bariko barapfundurura imifuko yabo, umwe wese asangayo agafuko karimwo amahera yiwe; babonye ayo mahera na se akayabona, bose bagira ubwoba. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Nuko Yakobo arababwira ati: “Mushaka kuntwara abana banje bose! Yosefu yarapfuye, Simeyoni aragiye, none ubu na ho mugira muntware Benyamini na we! Ibi vyose ni jewe bibayeko!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Ariko Reyubeni abwira se ati: “Nintakugarukanira Benyamini, uzoce wica abahungu banje babiri. Wewe mumpe gusa, ndakwemereye ko nzomukugarukanira.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Ariko Yakobo aramwishura ati: “Umwana wanje ntazosubiranayo namwe. Mukuruwe Yosefu yarapfuye, uwu ni we nsigaranye gusa. Nihagira ikimushikira mu nzira, muzotuma jewe umutama njana agahinda mu mva.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s1">Basubira muri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Nuko amapfa arushiriza gukomera mu gihugu. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Za ngano bari barakuye muri Egiputa zigiye guhera, se Yakobo arababwira ati: “Nimusubireyo mugure utundi twokurya.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Ariko Yuda aramubwira ati: “Wa mugabo yatwihanikirije ata gufyina ati: ‘Sinze nsubire kubabona imbere yanje mutari kumwe n’umuhererezi wanyu.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Niwaduha Benyamini tukajana, duca tugenda tuje kukugurira ivyokurya. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Ariko nutaduha Benyamini ngo tujane, natwe ntitugenda. Umenye ko wa mugabo yatubwiye ati: ‘Sinze nsubire kubabona imbere yanje mutari kumwe n’umuhererezi wanyu.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Isirayeli arababaza ati: “Ni kuki mwankoreye ikibi nk’ico, mukamubwira ko mufise uwundi muvukana?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Baramwishura bati: “Uwo mugabo yagumye atubaza ibijanye n’umuryango wacu. Yatubajije ati: ‘So aracariho? Hari uwundi muhungu muvukana?’ Natwe duca twishura ibibazo atubajije. Twari kwibaza gute ko ahava avuga ngo: ‘Nimugende muzane umuvukanyi wanyu’?”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Yuda abwira se Isirayeli ati: “Nyemerera njane n’uwu muhungu, hanyuma dufate urugendo, kugira ngo ntitwicwe n’inzara, twebwe, wewe n’imiryango yacu. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Jewe ndamwishinze. Nintamugarukana, uze umumbaze. Niyo ntamukugarukanira, nzokwama nikoreye ico caha imbere yawe. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Iyo tudatakaza uwu mwanya, tuba tumaze gusubirayo kabiri.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Nuko se Isirayeli arababwira ati: “Ko ata kundi bitegerezwa kugenda, nimubigenze uku: nimushire mu mifuko yanyu ibintu vy’agaciro vyo muri kino gihugu, mubishire uwo mugabo nk’ingabire. Mujane umuti wo gusomora muke witwa balimu, ubuki buke, ibimota neza, ibiyoba na alumonde. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Mujane na ya mahera mwasanga basubije mu mifuko yanyu y’ingano, birashoboka ko bihenze. Hanyuma mujane n’ayandi mahera yo kugura ingano. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Mujane kandi na Benyamini murumuna wanyu, musubire kwa wa mugabo. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Imana Mushoboravyose ize itume uwo mugabo abagirira impuhwe abasubize Benyamini n’umuvukanyi wanyu Simeyoni mugarukane. Nanje, nimba ntegerezwa kubura abana banje, nta kundi nzobabura.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Nuko batekera za ngabire n’imitigiri ibiri y’amahera bakeneye. Bajana na Benyamini muri Egiputa, biyereka Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Yosefu ababonye bari kumwe na Benyamini, abwira umukozi yari ajejwe inzu yiwe ati: “Jana aba bantu iwanje, ubage igitungwa hanyuma ugitegure; kuko isaha zitandatu nsangira na bo.”<verse eid="GEN 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Wa mukozi akora uko Yosefu amutegetse, abajana i muhira kwa Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Bariko barabajana kwa Yosefu, bagira ubwoba, bibaza bati: “Batujanye kubera ya mahera twasanga basubije mu mifuko yacu ca gihe ca mbere. Bahava badutera, batugirire nabi, batware indogoba zacu, hanyuma batugire abagurano.”<verse eid="GEN 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Bashitse ku muryango w’inzu ya Yosefu, ba bavukanyi begera wa mukozi ajejwe urugo rwa Yosefu, baramubwira bati: <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />“Nyakwubahwa, twebwe twari tumaze kuza hano muri Egiputa tuje kugura ivyokurya. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Hanyuma turiko turasubira iwacu, dushika ahantu turara, maze twuguruye imifuko yacu, dusanga amahera y’umuntu wese ari hejuru mu mufuko wiwe, kumwe yangana nyene ata gihaze! Ehe ng’aya turayagarukanye. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Twazanye ayandi yo kugura ivyokurya. Ntituzi uwasubije amahera yacu mu mifuko yacu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Wa mukozi arabishura ati: “Nimutekane, ntimugire ubwoba! Ni Imana yanyu, Imana ya so, yashize ubwo butunzi mu mifuko yanyu. Jewe ndazi ko amahera mwarishe yanshikiriye.” Maze arekura Simeyoni, aramubazanira.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Nuko abinjiza mu nzu kwa Yosefu, abazanira amazi kugira ngo boge ibirenge; aha n’indogoba zabo ivyokurya. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Bari bumvise ko baja gufungura kwa Yosefu, nuko bategura ingabire zabo barindiriye ko ashika isaha zitandatu.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yosefu ashitse i muhira, bamuha za ngabire bamuzanira, barunama bashika hasi imbere yiwe. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Ahejeje kubaramutsa, arababaza ati: “Mwarambwiye ko so ashaje. None arakomeye? Yoba akiriho?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Baramwishura bati: “Egome, data umusavyi wawe aracariho kandi arakomeye.” Bongera barunama bashika hasi imbere yiwe.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Yosefu abonye murumunawe Benyamini, arababaza ati: “Uwu ni wa muhererezi wanyu mwambwira? Imana ikugirire ubuntu, muhungu wanje.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Nuko Yosefu ava aho bari bicaye yihuta, kuko ibigumbagumba vyo kubona murumunawe vyari bimurengeye, yumva ashaka kurira. Nuko aja mu cumba ciherereye, araturika ararira.<verse eid="GEN 43:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Ahejeje kwihanagura, aragaruka yigumije. Aravuga ati: “Nimuzane ivyokurya.”<verse eid="GEN 43:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Nuko bazanira Yosefu ivyokurya ku meza yiwe, bene se babashirira ku meza yabo, n’Abanyegiputa bari baje gufungura kwa Yosefu babashirira ku meza yabo; kuko Abanyegiputa barakumira Abaheburayo, ntibashobora gusangira na bo. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Nuko yicarika bene se imbere yiwe, abatondeka akurikije imyaka yabo, kuva ku mukuru gushika ku muto. Bose bararabana baratangara cane. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Nuko Yosefu asaba ko babaha ivyokurya bivuye ku meza yiwe, ariko Benyamini amuha ibiruta ivy’abandi bose incuro zitanu. Nuko bararya kandi baranywa gushitsa bahimvye.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s1">Igikombe c’ifeza mu mufuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Hageze ko basubira inyuma, Yosefu ategeka wa mukozi ajejwe ivyo mu rugo rwiwe ati: “Uzuza imifuko y’abo bagabo ivyokurya bashobora gutwara, hanyuma ushire amahera umuntu wese yashaka kuriha hejuru mu mufuko wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Mu mufuko w’umuhererezi, ushiremwo amahera yashaka kuriha, n’igikombe canje c’ifeza.” Nuko abikora uko Yosefu yamutegetse.<verse eid="GEN 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Bukeye mu gitondo, barabarungika n’indogoba zabo. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Bagiye urugendo ruto bava mu gisagara, Yosefu abwira wa mukozi ajejwe urugo rwiwe ati: “Ihute ubakurikire. Niwabashikira ubabaze uti: ‘Ni kuki mwansubije ikibi ku ciza nabakoreye? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Ni kuki mwivye igikombe c’ifeza ca databuja kandi ari co anywesha, akanagikoresha mu kumenya ivya kazoza? Ivyo mwakoze ni bibi cane!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Wa mukozi ajejwe urugo rwa Yosefu abashikiriye, ababwira nk’uko yatumwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Baramwishura bati: “Nyakwubahwa, ni kuki utubwiye amajambo nk’aya? Ntidushobora gukora ikintu nk’ico twebwe abasavyi bawe. <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Urazi ko twagarukanye amahera twasanze mu mifuko yacu tuyakuye mu gihugu c’i Kanani! None vyogenda gute ngo twibe ifeza canke inzahabu mu nzu kwa shobuja? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Niwasangana ico gikombe umwe muri twebwe, ace yicwa. Natwe abasigaye tube abagurano ba databuja.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Arabishura ati: “Ndavyemeye, reka tubikore nk’uko mubivuze. Ariko uwivye ico gikombe ni we aja kuba umugurano wanje, abasigaye nta co muzoba mwagira.”<verse eid="GEN 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Bose bakura imifuko yabo ku ndogoba bayishira hasi, umwumwe yugurura umufuko wiwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Wa mukozi ajejwe urugo rwa Yosefu arondera mu mifuko yose ya ba bavukanyi, ahereye ku mukuru gushika ku muto; maze asanga ca gikombe mu mufuko wa Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Babibonye bitaburirako impuzu kubera ukwihebura, basubiza imifuko ku ndogoba, maze basubira mu gisagara.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yuda na bene se bashitse i muhira kwa Yosefu, basanga akiri i muhira. Bose barunama bashika hasi imbere yiwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yosefu arababaza ati: “Ni igiki cabateye gukora ivyo? Ntimwari muzi ko umuntu nkanje nshobora kubona ibizoba muri kazoza?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yuda aramwishura ati: “Databuja, nta co dushobora kwishura. Nta co twovuga ngo twerekane ko ata co twiyagiriza. Ni Imana yerekanye icaha cacu. Nyakwubahwa, tugarutse kuba abagurano bawe, twebwe n’uwasanganywe igikombe mu mufuko.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Yosefu aravuga ati: “Ntibikabeho ko nokora uko! Uwivye igikombe ni we wenyene azoba umugurano wanje. Abasigaye murashobora gusubira kwa so mu mahoro.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Yuda yegera Yosefu, aramubwira ati: “Nyakwubahwa, ndakwinginze undeke jewe umusavyi wawe mvuge ijambo rimwe. Ntunshavurire ndakwinginze, ndazi ko unganya ubushobozi na Farawo ubwiwe! <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Nyakwubahwa, waratubajije ko dufise data n’uwundi muvukanyi. <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Natwe turakwishura ko dufise data ageze mu zabukuru kandi ko umuhererezi wiwe yamuvyaye mu butama. Mu bana ba nyina ni we wenyene asigaye, kandi se aramukunda cane, kuko mukuruwe yarapfuye.<verse eid="GEN 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Nyakwubahwa, watubwiye ngo tugende tumuzane kugira ngo umwibonere. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Twakwishuye tuvuga ko uwo muhungu adashobora kuva i ruhande ya se; kuko bishitse, se yoca apfa. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Ariko waratwihanikirije utubwira ko tutazanye umuhererezi wacu tudakwiye kugaruka imbere yawe. <verse eid="GEN 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Dusubiye kwa data, umusavyi wawe, twaramubwiye ivyo wadusavye, nyakwubahwa.<verse eid="GEN 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Mu nyuma ni ho yadutuma ngo tugaruke gusuma ivyokurya. <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Twamwishuye tuti: ‘Ntidushobora gusubirayo tutajanye na murumuna wacu. Ntidushobora guturukira mu maso ha wa mugabo tutari kumwe na murumuna wacu.’<verse eid="GEN 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Maze data umusavyi wawe aratubwira ati: ‘Murazi ko umugore wanje Rasheli yamvyariye abahungu babiri gusa. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Umwe muri bo yaragiye ntiyagaruka. Ategerezwa kuba yatabaguwe n’igikoko co mw’ishamba. Sinigeze nsubira kumubona. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Nimwajana uwu na we kure yanje hakagira ikimushikira, umubabaro muzontera uzonyica, mpfane agahinda mu butama bwanje!’<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />Rero nyakwubahwa, sinshobora gusubira kwa data umusavyi wawe, uwu mwana atari kumwe natwe. Ubuzima bwa data bufatanye cane n’ubw’uwu mwana. <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />Data niyabona uwu mwana atari kumwe natwe, azoca apfa. Ni twebwe abasavyi bawe tuzoba dutumye data umusavyi wawe apfana umubabaro mu butama bwiwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Nyakwubahwa, ni jewe niyemeje imbere ya data ko nishinze uwu mwana. Namubwiye ko nintamumugarukanira, nzokwikorera ico caha imbere yiwe ibihe vyose.<verse eid="GEN 44:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Ndakwinginze databuja, abe ari jewe nguma hano nk’umugurano mu kibanza c’uwu mwana, ariko uwo mwana asubirane i muhira na bene se bandi. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Kuko sinokwubahuka gusubira kwa data ntari kumwe n’uwu mwana. Sinokwihanganira kubona agahinda vyotera data.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s1">Yosefu yimenyekanisha kuri bene se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Maze Yosefu bimunanira guhisha ibigumbagumba yari afise imbere y’abakozi biwe. Nuko abategeka gusohoka bose, asigarana na bene se gusa, maze arabimenyekanisha. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Nuko araturika ararira cane ku buryo Abanyegiputa bavyumva, maze inkuru ishika no ku kirimba kwa Farawo.<verse eid="GEN 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yosefu abwira bene se ati: “Ni jewe Yosefu! Data yoba akiri muzima?” Bene se bumvise ayo majambo biranka ko bamwishura kubera ubwoba bwinshi.<verse eid="GEN 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Yosefu arababwira ati: “Nimunyegere!” Nuko baramwegera. Arabandanya ati: “Ndi Yosefu, umuvukanyi wanyu. Ni jewe mwagurishije nk’umugurano muri Egiputa. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Ubu rero ntimubabare kandi ntimwiteko ishavu ko mwangurishije muri kino gihugu. Imana ni yo yandungitse imbere yanyu, kugira ngo ikize ubuzima bwanyu mu gihe nk’iki. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Iyi nzara imaze imyaka ibiri, ariko haracasigaye iyindi itanu, ata kurima kandi ata kwimbura. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Imana yandungitse hano imbere yanyu kugira ngo mwebwe n’imiryango yanyu ntimuhone kandi kugira ngo harokoke abantu benshi.<verse eid="GEN 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Si mwebwe rero mwandungitse hano, ni Imana. Kandi ni yo yangize umuhanuzi mukuru wa Farawo. Yampaye kuganza ikirimba ciwe, angira n’umukuru w’igihugu cose ca Egiputa. <verse eid="GEN 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Mwihute muje kwa data mumubwire muti: ‘Umuhungu wawe Yosefu avuze ati: Imana yampaye kuganza igihugu cose ca Egiputa. Ingo iwanje udatevye. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Urashobora kwibera mu gihugu ca Gosheni, ukanyegera hafi wewe n’abana bawe n’abuzukuru bawe, intama zawe, impene zawe n’inka zawe, n’ibindi vyose utunze. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Uri i Gosheni, nzogutunga nguhe ivyo ukeneye, kuko hagisigaye imyaka itanu y’amapfa. Bitari uko wewe, umuryango wose n’ibikoko utunze muzokwicwa n’ubukene.’<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Mwese, nawe murumunanje Benyamini, muribonera ko ari jewe Yosefu ndiko ndabavugisha! <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Nimugende mubwire data icubahiro mfise muri Egiputa, mumusigurire ivyo mwabonye vyose, hanyuma mumuzane hano bidatevye.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Nuko agumbira Benyamini arizwa n’umunezero. Benyamini na we aririra ku rutugu rwiwe. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Yosefu agumbira bene se bose yongera arabasoma arira; na bo batangura kumuvugisha bidegemvya.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Maze inkuru imenyekana ku kirimba kwa Farawo ko abavukanyi ba Yosefu baje, ivyo binezereza Farawo n’abakorana na we. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Farawo abwira Yosefu ati: “Bwira bene so uti: ‘Nimushire imizigo yanyu ku ndogoba zanyu mwihute muje i Kanani; <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />hanyuma muzane so n’imiryango yanyu, maze mugaruke hano. Nzobaha amatongo meza aruta ayandi muri Egiputa, hanyuma barye ivyiza vyeze mu gihugu.’<verse eid="GEN 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Babwire kandi bajane imwe mu mikogote yo muri Egiputa, baje kuzana abagore babo, abana babo na se hano. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Ntibakwiye kwicuza ku vyabo bazosiga, kuko ivyiza vyo mu gihugu ca Egiputa ari ivyabo.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Nuko abahungu ba Isirayeli babigenza nk’uko babariwe. Yosefu abaha imikogote, nk’uko Farawo yari yavuze, hanyuma abaha n’ivyo bakeneye mu rugendo. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Umwe wese amuha impuzu nshasha ariko Benyamini we amuha zitanu na shekeli amajana atatu z’ifeza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3,5.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Yongera arungikira se indogoba icumi zikoreye ivyiza vyeze mu gihugu ca Egiputa, indogoba icumi z’ingore zikoreye ingano, imikate, n’ibindi vya nkenerwa mu rugendo rwiwe. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Nuko arungika bene se; bakigenda arababwira ati: “Ntimugende muratongana mu nzira!”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Nuko bava muri Egiputa basubira kwa se Yakobo i Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Bashitse baramubwira bati: “Yosefu aracariho! Mbere ni we aganza igihugu ca Egiputa!” Ariko Yakobo we amera nk’aho ata co yumvise, kuko atemera ivyo bamubwiye. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Ariko bamusubiriyemwo ivyo Yosefu yababwiye vyose, akabona n’imikogote yarungitse ngo imujane muri Egiputa, umutima wa Yakobo usubiramwo ubuzima. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Isirayeli aravuga ati: “Ivyo birakwiye. Umwana wanje Yosefu aracariho. Ndakwiye kugenda nkamubona imbere y’uko mpfa!”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo aja muri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Nuko Isirayeli afata urugendo aja muri Egiputa hamwe n’ivyo yari atunze vyose. Ashitse i Berisheba ashikanira ibimazi Imana ya se Isaka.<verse eid="GEN 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Mw’ijoro, Imana ivugana na we mu nzozi iti: “Yakobo! Yakobo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Aritaba ati: “Sabwe!”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Imana iramubwira iti: “Ndi Imana, Imana ya so. Ntutinye kuja muri Egiputa, kuko muri kirya gihugu nzohagwiriza umuryango wawe ube ihanga rinini. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Nzojana nawe muri Egiputa, kandi nzokugarukana. Wewe uzopfira muri Egiputa, ariko Yosefu ubwiwe ni we azokwugara amaso yawe.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Nuko Yakobo ava i Berisheba, abahungu biwe bamujana muri Egiputa, hamwe n’abana babo n’abagore babo, mu mikogote Farawo yarungitse ngo imujane. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Bajana n’amasho n’imikuku yabo n’ivyo bari batungiye mu gihugu c’i Kanani. Uko ni ko Yakobo n’umuryango wiwe wose bagiye muri Egiputa. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Yajanye n’abahungu n’abakobwa biwe, n’abuzukuru, muri make yajanye n’uruvyaro rwiwe rwose muri Egiputa.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Aya ni yo mazina y’abakomoka kuri Isirayeli (Yakobo n’abahungu biwe) bagiye muri Egiputa:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 46:8" />
  <para style="li1" vid="GEN 46:8">Reyubeni imfura ya Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Abahungu ba Reyubeni ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:9">Hanoki, Palu, Hezironi na Karumi.<verse eid="GEN 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Abahungu ba Simeyoni ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:10">Yemuweli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Zohari na Sawuli, abo yavyaye ku mugore w’Umunyakananikazi.<verse eid="GEN 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Bene Lewi ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:11">Gerishoni, Kohati na Merari.<verse eid="GEN 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Abahungu ba Yuda ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:12">Eri, Onani, Shela, Perezi na Zera (ariko Eri na Onani bari bapfiriye mu gihugu c’i Kanani).</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:12">Abahungu ba Perezi ni:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="GEN 46:12">Hezironi na Hamuli.<verse eid="GEN 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Abahungu ba Isakari ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:13">Tola, Puwa, Yashubi na Shimuroni.<verse eid="GEN 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Abahungu ba Zebuloni ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:14">Seredi, Eloni na Yahileli.<verse eid="GEN 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Aba ni bo bahungu Leya yavyaranye na Yakobo i Padani-Aramu, uretse umukobwa wiwe Dina. Abo bahungu n’abakobwa biwe bose hamwe bari murongo itatu na batatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Abahungu ba Gadi ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:16">Zefoni, Hagi, Shuni, Eziboni, Eri, Arodi na Areli.<verse eid="GEN 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Abahungu ba Asheri ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:17">Imuna, Ishuva, Ishuvi na Beriya. Mushiki wabo yitwa Sera.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:17">Abahungu ba Beriya ni:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="GEN 46:17">Heberi na Malukiyeli.<verse eid="GEN 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Aba ni bo bahungu Yakobo yavyaye kuri Zilupa, uwo Labani yari yahaye umukobwa wiwe Leya nk’incoreke, bose bari icumi na batandatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Abahungu Yakobo yavyaye kuri Rasheli ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:19">Yosefu na Benyamini.<verse eid="GEN 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Muri Egiputa, Yosefu yavyaye Manase na Efurayimu kuri Asenati, umukobwa wa Potifera, umuherezi w’i Oni.<verse eid="GEN 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Abahungu ba Benyamini ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:21">Bela, Bekeri, Ashibeli, Gera. Namani, Ehi. Roshi, Mupimu, Hupimu na Aridi.<verse eid="GEN 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Abo ni bo bahungu Yakobo yavyaye kuri Rasheli, bose bari icumi na bane.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Umuhungu wa Dani ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:23">Hushimu.<verse eid="GEN 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Abahungu ba Nafutali ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:24">Yahaziyeli, Guni, Yezeri na Shilemu.<verse eid="GEN 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Abo ni bo bahungu Yakobo yavyaye kuri Biluha, uwo Labani yari yahaye umukobwa wiwe Rasheli nk’incoreke; bose bari indwi.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Abajanye na Yakobo muri Egiputa bose; abakomoka kuri we, ukuyemwo abagore b’abahungu biwe, bashika mirongo itandatu na batandatu. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Ushizemwo abahungu babiri Yosefu yavyariye muri Egiputa, umuryango wa Yakobo mu gihugu ca Egiputa wari ugizwe n’abantu mirongo indwi.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Bagiye gushika, Yakobo arungika Yuda imbere kugira ngo ahure na Yosefu, maze amwereke inzira ija i Gosheni. Bahashitse, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yosefu ategura imikogote yiwe, aja i Gosheni guhura na se, Isirayeli. Abonye se, aramvura amaboko aramugumbira maze amara umwanya muremure arira.<verse eid="GEN 46:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Isirayeli abwira Yosefu ati: “Ubu rero harageze ko mpfa, kuko nsubiye kubona mu maso hawe kandi mbonye ko ukiriho.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Nuko Yosefu abwira abavukanyi biwe n’umuryango wose wa se ati: “Ngira nje kwa Farawo ndamubwire nti: ‘Abo tuvukana n’umuryango wose wa data baje kundaba bavuye mu gihugu c’i Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Abo bagabo ni abungere kandi ni aborozi. Baje bazananye n’amasho n’imikuku yabo n’ivyo batunze vyose.’ <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Farawo niyabatumako akababaza umwuga wanyu, <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />muze mumwishure muti: ‘Twebwe abasavyi bawe twamye turi aborozi b’ibitungwa kuva mu bwana bwacu, nk’uko na ba sogokuruza bacu bakora.’ Nimwamwishura uko, azoca abemerera kuba mu karere ka Gosheni, kuko Abanyegiputa basanzwe bakumira abungere bose.”<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Nuko Yosefu aja kwa Farawo, aramubwira ati: “Data n’abavukanyi banje baje bava mu gihugu c’i Kanani. Bazananye n’amasho yabo n’imikuku yabo n’ivyo batunze vyose; ubu bari mu karere ka Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Yosefu yari yajanye na batanu muri bene se, maze abereka Farawo.<verse eid="GEN 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Farawo abaza bene se ba Yosefu ati: “Umwuga wanyu ni uwuhe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Baramwishura bati: “Twebwe abasavyi bawe turi abungere b’ibitungwa, nk’uko ba sogokuruza babikora. <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Twaje kuba hano muri Egiputa igihe gito, kuko ata buragiro bw’imikuku yacu bugisigaye mu gihugu c’i Kanani. Hari amapfa ateye ubwoba. Nuko rero turakwinginze utwemerere, twebwe abasavyi bawe, kuba mu karere ka Gosheni.”<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Farawo abwira Yosefu ati: “Ko so na bene so bagusanze hano, <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />igihugu cose ca Egiputa kiri imbere yawe, bahitiremwo aharuta ahandi kuba heza abe ari ho baba. Bareke bibere mu karere ka Gosheni. Kandi muri bo nihaba harimwo abafise ubihanga budasanzwe, ubazeze kuragira imikuku n’amasho vyanje na vyo.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Nuko Yosefu azana se Yakobo amwereka Farawo, maze Yakobo ahezagira Farawo. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Farawo abaza Yakobo ati: “Umaze imyaka ingahe?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobo aramwishura ati: “Maze imyaka ijana na mirongo itatu ngendagenda kuri ino si. Imyaka yanje yabaye mike kandi yarangumiye. Sinashikije imyaka ba sogokuruza bamaze bagendagenda kw’isi.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Nuko Yakobo yongera guhezagira Farawo, maze arasohoka ava ku kirimba.<verse eid="GEN 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Nuko Yosefu aha se na bene se ahantu harusha ahandi kuba heza muri Egiputa, ahitwa mu karere ka Ramusesi, baba ari ho baba nk’uko Farawo yari yategetse. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yosefu aha se, bene se n’imiryango yabo yose ivyokurya, afatiye ku gitigiri c’abana bari bafise.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amapfa muri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Yamara amapfa yarushiriza gukomera mu gihugu cose, kandi abantu bicwa n’inzara mu gihugu ca Egiputa no mu gihugu c’i Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Nuko Yosefu yegeranya amahera yose yavuye mu kudandaza ingano mu gihugu ca Egiputa na Kanani, ayajana mu bubiko bwa Farawo. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Abantu bo muri Egiputa n’i Kanani batagisigaranye uruhera na rumwe, Abanyegiputa bose baza kwa Yosefu baramubwira bati: “Turakwingize uduhe ivyokurya. Uremeye ko dupfira mu maso yawe? Amahera yacu yose yaheze.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yosefu arabishura ati: “Ko amahera yanyu yaheze, nimuzane imikuku yanyu, nanje ndabahe ivyokurya mu gishingo cayo.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Nuko bazanira Yosefu ibitungwa vyabo na we abaha ivyokurya. Mu kibanza c’amafarasi, imikuku y’impene n’intama, amasho y’inka n’indogoba vyabo, Yosefu abaha ivyokurya vyo kubamaza umwaka.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Uwo mwaka uheze, bagaruka mu wukurikira baramubwira bati: “Nyakwubahwa, ntidushobora kuguhisha ukuri. Amahera yacu yaraheze, kandi amasho yacu n’imikuku vyacu ubu ni ivyawe. Nta co dusigaranye twotanga atari imibiri yacu n’amatongo yacu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />None tugupfire mu maso, twebwe n’amatongo yacu? Tugure twebwe n’amatongo yacu, hanyuma uduhe ivyokurya. Twebwe n’amatongo yacu duhisemwo kuba abagurano ba Farawo. Twebwe duhe ingano gusa kugira ngo tubeho, ntidupfe; kandi amatongo ntahinduke ubugaragwa.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Nuko Yosefu agurira Farawo amatongo yose yo muri Egiputa. Abanyegiputa bamugurishako amatongo yabo yose kuko amapfa yari abarembeje. Maze amatongo yose aba aya Farawo. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Abantu na bo abagira abagurano biwe, kuva ku ruhande rumwe rwa Egiputa gushika ku rundi. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Itongo ryonyene ataguze ryari itongo ry’abaherezi. Bari basanzwe baronka ivyo kubafasha bahabwa na Farawo, kandi baronka ivyokurya bikwiye bivuye muri iyo mfashanyo ya Farawo, ni co gituma batagurishije itongo ryabo.<verse eid="GEN 47:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Maze Yosefu abwira abantu ati: “Murabona ko uno musi nabaguze mwebwe n’amatongo yanyu. Ngira ndabahe rero imbuto kugira ngo mushobore gutera imirima yanyu. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Iyimbura niryagera, ica gatanu c’umwimbu wanyu muzogiha Farawo. Umwimbu usigaye uzoba uwanyu kugira ngo mushobore gutera imirima yanyu kandi mufungure n’imiryango yanyu n’abana banyu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Baramwishura bati: “Nyakwubahwa, ko watugiriye ubuntu, ukarokora ubuzima bwacu, natwe tuzoba abagurano ba Farawo.”<verse eid="GEN 47:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Nuko Yosefu aca asohora itegeko, kandi iryo tegeko riracakora gushika n’uno musi mu gihugu ca Egiputa; ko Farawo ategerezwa kuronka ica gatanu c’ivyimbuwe vyose mu gihugu ciwe. Itongo ryahawe abaherezi ni ryo ryonyene ritabaye irya Farawo.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Ico gihe, Abisirayeli na bo baba mu karere ka Gosheni muri Egiputa. Baharonkera amatongo n’amatungo kandi baragwira baba benshi.<verse eid="GEN 47:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobo yabaye muri Egiputa imyaka icumi n’indwi; imyaka yose yamaze yabaye ijana na mirongo ine n’indwi. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Igihe ciwe co gupfa cegereje, Isirayeli atumako umuhungu wiwe Yosefu, aramubwira ati: “Nimba ngiriwe ubuntu mu maso yawe, shira ukuboko kwawe musi y’itako ryanje undahire ko uzonyereka urukundo rudahera n’ubwizigirwa mu gushitsa ico ngusavye: ntuze umpambe muri Egiputa. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Ninapfa ndakwinginze uze ukure umubiri wanje muri Egiputa, umpambe hamwe na ba sogokuruza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yosefu aramwishura ati: “Nzobikora nk’uko ubivuze.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Yakobo aravuga ati: “Ndahira wemeze ko uzobikora uko.” Nuko Yosefu aramurahira, maze Isirayeli arunama asenga Imana yishimikije inkoni yagendesha.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s1">Manase na Efurayimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Haheze igihe gito, Yosefu yumva ko se agwaye. Nuko Yosefu aja kumuraba ajanye n’abahungu biwe babiri, Manase na Efurayimu. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Nuko babwira Yakobo bati: “Umuhungu wawe Yosefu araje kukuraba.” Isirayeli aca arinanata yicara ku buriri bwiwe.<verse eid="GEN 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Abwira Yosefu ati: “Imana Mushoboravyose yanyiyerekeye i Luzi mu gihugu c’i Kanani, irahampezagirira. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Irambwira iti: ‘Nzokugwiza, uruvyaro rwawe ndarugire rwinshi cane. Muri wewe hazova amahanga menshi, kandi nzoha iki gihugu c’i Kanani uruvyaro rwawe kibe icabo bwegu ibihe vyose.’<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Aba bahungu bawe wavyariye muri Egiputa imbere y’uko ndahaza, ndabafata nk’abanje. Efurayimu na Manase ni abana banje nk’uko Reyubeni na Simeyoni ari abanje. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Abo uzovyara inyuma yabo, bazoba abana bawe kandi bazoragwa amatongo mu bice bizohabwa bene se Efurayimu na Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Igihe nariko ndava i Padani, Rasheli yapfiriye mu gihugu c’i Kanani. Twari tukiri mu nzira twerekeye muri Efurata, ari ho i Betelehemu. Aho ni ho namuhamvye mu mubabaro mwinshi, i ruhande y’inzira ija muri Efurata.”<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Isirayeli abonye abahungu ba Yosefu, arabaza ati: “Aba ni ba nde?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yosefu aramwishura ati: “Aba ni abahungu Imana yampereye hano muri Egiputa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Yakobo aravuga ati: “Banyegereze, ndabahezagire.”<verse eid="GEN 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Isirayeli yasa n’uwabaye impumyi kubera ubusaza, ntiyari akibona neza. Nuko Yosefu amwegereza ba bahungu, Yakobo arabasoma yongera arabagumbira.<verse eid="GEN 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Isirayeli abwira Yosefu ati: “Sinigeze nibaza ko nzosubira kukubona, ariko raba Imana yampaye no kubona abana bawe na bo!”<verse eid="GEN 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Maze Yosefu akura ba bahungu ku mavi ya Isirayeli, arunama ashika hasi. <verse eid="GEN 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Hanyuma afata ba bahungu biwe, Efurayimu amutumbereza i buryo bwiwe, atumberanye n’ukubamfu kwa Isirayeli; Manase na we amushira i bubamfu bwiwe, atumberanye n’ukuryo kwa Yakobo; maze yongera kubegereza sekuru. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Ariko Isirayeli agorora amaboko yiwe ayanyuranije ukuryo agushira ku mutwe wa Efurayimu, naho ari we yari muto; hanyuma ukubamfu kwiwe agushira ku mutwe wa Manase, naho Manase ari we yari imfura.<verse eid="GEN 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Nuko ahezagira Yosefu avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">“Imana ya data Isaka na sogokuru Aburahamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">bagendeye imbere mu bwizigirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">Imana yambereye umwungere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">ubuzima bwanje bwose gushitsa uwu musi;<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />umumarayika yandokoye akankiza ikibi cose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">ihezagire aba bahungu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Baze bahamagarwe mw’izina ryanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">no mu mazina ya Aburahamu na Isaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">kandi baze bagwire cane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">kw’isi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yosefu abonye ko se yashize ukuryo kwiwe ku mutwe wa Efurayimu, ntivyamunezera. Nuko afata ukuboko kwa se ngo agukure ku mutwe wa Efurayimu, agushire ku mutwe wa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Yosefu abwira se ati: “Oya data, uwu ni we mfura yanje, ba ari we ushirako ukuryo kwawe ku mutwe.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Ariko se aranka, avuga ati: “Ndabizi, mwana wanje; ndabizi. Na we azohinduka ihanga, kandi na we azoba umuntu akomeye. Ariko murumunawe azomuruta, kandi uruvyaro rwiwe ruzohinduka amahanga menshi cane.” <verse eid="GEN 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Uwo musi arabahezagira, avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:20">“Abisirayeli bazotanga imihezagiro bakoresheje amazina yanyu bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:20">‘Imana ize iguhe kumera nka Efurayimu na Manase.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 48:20">Nuko Yakobo ashira Efurayimu imbere ya Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Isirayeli abwira Yosefu ati: “Raba ngiye gupfa, ariko Imana izobana namwe kandi izobasubiza mu gihugu ca ba sogokuruza banyu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Kandi wewe, nguhaye umugabane urenze ku yo nahaye bene so, nguhaye akarere nanyaze Abamori nkoresheje inkota n’umuheto vyanje.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo ahezagira abahungu biwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Nuko Yakobo akoranya abahungu biwe aravuga ati: “Nimukoranire i ruhande yanje kugira ngo ndababwire ibizobashikira mu misi igiye kuza.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Nimwegere hafi mwumvirize, bahungu ba Yakobo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">nimwumvirize so Isirayeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Reyubeni, ni wewe mfura yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">inkomezi zanje, umwana wo mu buto bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">urusha abandi iteka n’inkomezi.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Umeze nk’amazi atagira uburagamo, ariko ntukibaye uwa mbere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">kuko wuriye uburiri bwa so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">ugahumanya aho ndyama.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Simeyoni na Lewi baravukana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">ibigwanisho vyabo ni ivyo gukora ibara.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Sinze nigere nja mu nama zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">canke ngo nje aho bakoraniye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">kuko bishe abantu kubera ishavu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">banezerezwa no gukomeretsa impfizi.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Ishavu ryabo rirakavumwa, kuko ni iry’inkazi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">kandi ugushangashirwa kwabo ni ukw’abicanyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Nzobashwiragiriza mu ruvyaro rwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">ndabasabagirize muri Isirayeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Yuda, bene so bazogushimagiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">kandi ukuboko kwawe kuzofata abansi bawe kw’izosi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">abahungu ba so bazokwunamira.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yuda, mwana wanje, uri intambwe ikiri nto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">igarutse ihejeje kurya ico yishe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Aravyuka, akicara nk’intambwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">nk’intambwe y’ingore, ni nde yoyitegeka kuvyuka?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Icumu ry’ubugabe ntirizova mu muryango wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">kandi inkoni yo kuganza ntizova mu ruvyaro rwiwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">kugeza aho nyeneyo azozira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">uwo ni we amahanga yose azokwumvira.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Azozirika indogoba yiwe ku muzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">inyana y’indogoba yiwe ayizirike ku muzabibu uruta iyindi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">azomesa impuzu ziwe mu muvinyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">amakanzu yiwe ayamese mu maraso y’inzabibu.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Amaso yiwe azokwakaka kubera umuvinyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">amenyo yiwe yere kurusha amata.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Zebuloni azoba ku nkengera z’ibiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">acike ikivuko c’amato;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">imbibe ziwe zizoshika i Sidoni.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Isakari ni indogoba ikomeye cane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">iryamye hagati y’impongore zibiri z’intama.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Abonye ingene ikibanza ciwe co kuruhukiramwo ari ciza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">n’ingene itongo ryiwe ari ryiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">azotega ibitugu vyiwe vyikorere imitwaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">akore ibikorwa vy’ubugurano.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Dani azotunganiriza abantu biwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:16">nk’umwe mu miryango ya Isirayeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Dani azomera nk’inzoka i ruhande y’ibarabara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">nk’inkoma i ruhande y’inzira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">ikomora amaguru y’ifarasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">kugira ngo uwuyigenderako agwe agaramye.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nditeze agakiza kawe!<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Gadi azoterwa n’umugwi w’abambuzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">ariko azobivuna abatere bariko barahunga.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Asheri azogira ivyokurya vyinshi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">azotanga ivyokurya bikwiye umwami.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Nafutali ni ingeregere izituye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">avuga amajambo aryoshe cane.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Yosefu ni uruzabibu rwama cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">ni uruzabibu rwama cane ruri hafi y’umugezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">amashami yarwo arakura akarenga uruzitiro.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Abantu baramuteye bamurasa imyampi n’umururazi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">baramurashe n’urwanko rwinshi.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Ariko umuheto wiwe wagumanye ubukomezi bwawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">amaboko yiwe akomezwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">n’ukuboko kw’inkomezi kw’Inyenkomezi ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">n’Umwungere, ari we Gitandara ca Isirayeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Imana ya so izogufasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">Iyishoboravyose izoguhezagira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">imihezagiro yo hejuru mw’ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">imihezagiro yo mu mazi hasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">n’imihezagiro y’ibere n’imbanyi.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Imihezagiro ya so ni mikuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">kurusha imihezagiro y’imisozi ya kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">kurusha ivyiza vy’imitumba ya kera cane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Ivyo vyose bibe ku mutwe wa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">ku ruhanga rw’umuganwa muri bene se.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Benyamini ni ibingira ry’amarara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">mu gitondo arya igikoko yishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">ku mugoroba akagabura ivyavuye mu ruhigi.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Iyo ni yo miryango icumi n’ibiri ya Isirayeli, kandi ivyo ni vyo yababwiye igihe yabahezagira, umwumwe wese akamuha umuhezagiro wiwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Hanyuma Yakobo abihanikiriza avuga ati: “Ngiye gupfa vuba, mpamvye ba sogokuruza. Muze mumpambe hambavu ya ba sogokuruza mw’isenga riri mw’itongo rya Efuroni Umuheti. <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />Ni rya senga riri mw’itongo rya Makapela, hafi y’i Mamure mu gihugu c’i Kanani, iryo Aburahamu yaguriye Efuroni, Umuheti nk’itongo ryo guhambamwo. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Aho ni ho bahamvye Aburahamu na Sara umugore wiwe, na Isaka na Rebeka umugore wiwe ni ho bahambwe, kandi ni ho nahamvye Leya. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Iryo tongo n’isenga riri muri ryo vyaguzwe ku Baheti.”<verse eid="GEN 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Ahejeje kubwira abana biwe ayo majambo, Yakobo yuriza amaguru yiwe ku buriri, aracikana, ahamvya ba sekuruza.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Maze Yosefu arambarara kuri se aramuririra amusomagura. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Hanyuma abwira abaganga bamukorera ngo bategure ikiziga ca se Isirayeli; nuko baragitegura. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Igikorwa co gutegura ikiziga ciwe cafashe imisi mirongo ine nk’uko vyari bisanzwe bigenzwa. Nuko Abanyegiputa bamugandarira imisi mirongo indwi.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Igihe co kugandara giheze, Yosefu yegera abahanuzi ba Farawo arababwira ati: “Nimba ngiriwe ubuntu mu maso yanyu, ndabinginze mumvugire kwa Farawo, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />mumubwire ko data yandahije akambwira ati: ‘Urabona ko ngiye gupfa. Uze usubize ikiziga canje mu gihugu c’i Kanani, umpambe mu mva nateguye ko bazompambamwo.’ Nuko rero ndakwinginze unyemerere nje guhamba data. Mpejeje kumuhamba, nzoca ngaruka.”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Farawo yemerera Yosefu ico amusavye, arishura ati: “Genda uhambe so, ubikore nk’uko yakurahije.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Nuko Yosefu aja guhamba se, aherekejwe n’abakozi bakurubakuru bakorera umwami, abajejwe ikirimba n’abubahwa bo mu gihugu ca Egiputa cose. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Yosefu yongera ajana abo mu rugo rwiwe bose, hamwe na bene se n’imiryango yabo. Abana bato n’amasho n’imikuku ni vyo basize i Gosheni gusa. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Yosefu aherekezwa n’imikogote myinshi n’abagendera ku mafarasi benshi.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Bashitse ku mbuga ya Atadi, hafi y’uruzi Yorodani, bagira ikigandaro gikomeye kandi c’akataraboneka. Yosefu ategurira se ikigandaro c’imisi indwi. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Abanyakanani baba aho hantu babonye ikigandaro kiriko kirabera ku mbuga ya Atadi, baravuga bati: “Abanyegiputa bagize ikigandaro kibababaje cane!” Ni co gituma aho hantu hafi y’uruzi Yorodani hitwa Abeli-Misirayimu, bisigura “ikigandaro c’Abanyegiputa”.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Nuko abahungu ba Yakobo bakora vyose nk’uko yari yabibasavye. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Bajana ikiziga ciwe mu gihugu c’i Kanani, bamuhamba mw’isenga riri mw’itongo rya Makapela, hafi y’i Mamure, iryo Aburahamu yari yaraguriye Efuroni Umuheti nk’ikibanza co guhambamwo. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Ahejeje guhamba se, Yosefu asubira muri Egiputa hamwe na bene se n’abari bamuherekeje bose guhamba se.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosefu ahumuriza bene se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Abavukanyi ba Yosefu babonye ko se apfuye, baravuga bati: “Yosefu arashobora kutugirira urwanko akatwihora ku bibi twamukoreye.” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Nuko barungika intumwa kwa Yosefu bati: “Imbere yo gupfa, so yasize avuze ati: <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />‘Muze mubwire Yosefu muti: Aragusavye uze uharire bene so icaha n’ikibi kibishe bagukoreye, igihe bakugirira ibitagirwa.’ None turakwinginze uduharire icaha cacu twebwe abakozi b’Imana ya so.” Yosefu yumvise ayo majambo, aca ararira.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Na bene se baca baraza barambarara imbere yiwe, baramubwira bati: “Turi abagurano bawe!”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Ariko Yosefu arababwira ati: “Ntimugire ubwoba, erega jewe sindi mu kibanza c’Imana. <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Mwebwe mwashaka kunkorera ikibi, ariko Imana yahinduye ico kibi iciza. Yanshize muri kino kibanza kugira ngo ikize ubuzima bw’abantu benshi. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Nuko rero ntimusubire kugira ubwoba, nzobandanya ndabitaho mwebwe n’abana banyu.” Uko ni ko yabaremesheje, ababwira amajambo meza.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Yosefu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Nuko Yosefu na bene se n’imiryango yabo babandanya baba muri Egiputa. Yosefu yamaze imyaka ijana na cumi, <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />yibonera abana b’umuhungu wiwe Efurayimu gushika ku runganwe rwa gatatu; yibonera n’abana ba Makiri, umuhungu wa Manase, bavukiye ku bibero vyiwe.<verse eid="GEN 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Umusi umwe Yosefu abwira bene se ati: “Jewe ngiye gupfa. Ariko Imana izobagendera ibatabare, ibakure muri iki gihugu, ibajane mu gihugu yarahiye ko izoha Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Nuko Yosefu arahiza bene Isirayeli ati: “Imana niyabagendera ikabashoboza gusubira mu gihugu canyu, mundahire ko muzojana amagufa yanje mukayakura muri kino gihugu.”<verse eid="GEN 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Nuko Yosefu apfa afise imyaka ijana na cumi, bategura umubiri wiwe n’amavuta amota kugira ngo ntiwononekare, bamushira mw’isandugu ikozwe mw’ibuye muri Egiputa.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>